ries, and Sagas are historic.)", "When Haphazard Bombardment enters the battlefield, choose four nonenchantment permanents you don't control and put an aim counter on each of them.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if two or more permanents you don't control have an aim counter on them, destroy one of those permanents at random.", 'When Homarid Explorer enters the battlefield, target player mills four cards.', 'When Keldon Raider enters the battlefield, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.', "When Navigator's Compass enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.\\n{T}: Until end of turn, target land you control becomes the basic land type of your choice in addition to its other types.", 'When Niambi, Faithful Healer enters the battlefield, you may search your library and/or graveyard for a card named Teferi, Timebender, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you search your library this way, shuffle.', "When Oath of Teferi enters the battlefield, exile another target permanent you control. Return it to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.\\nYou may activate the loyalty abilities of planeswalkers you control twice each turn rather than only once.", 'When Rona, Disciple of Gix enters the battlefield, you may exile target historic card from your graveyard. (Artifacts, legendaries, and Sagas are historic.)\\nYou may cast spells from among cards exiled with Rona.\\n{4}, {T}: Exile the top card of your library.', 'When Siege-Gang Commander enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Siege-Gang Commander deals 2 damage to any target.', 'When Skittering Surveyor enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Sparring Construct dies, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.', 'When Yavimaya Sapherd enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', 'When Zhalfirin Void enters the battlefield, scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)\\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'Whenever Corrosive Ooze blocks or becomes blocked by an equipped creature, destroy all Equipment attached to that creature at end of combat.', 'Whenever Howling Golem attacks or blocks, each player draws a card.', 'Whenever Karplusan Hound attacks, if you control a Chandra planeswalker, this creature deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Whenever Keldon Warcaller attacks, put a lore counter on target Saga you control.', 'Whenever Two-Headed Giant attacks, flip two coins. If both coins come up heads, Two-Headed Giant gains double strike until end of turn. If both coins come up tails, Two-Headed Giant gains menace until end of turn.', 'Whenever a Saproling you control dies, Slimefoot, the Stowaway deals 1 damage to each opponent and you gain 1 life.\\n{4}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', "Whenever another Elf enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Marwyn, the Nurturer.\\n{T}: Add an amount of {G} equal to Marwyn's power.", 'Whenever you cast a historic spell, Cabal Paladin deals 2 damage to each opponent. (Artifacts, legendaries, and Sagas are historic.)', 'Whenever you cast a historic spell, draw a card. (Artifacts, legendaries, and Sagas are historic.)', 'Whenever you cast a historic spell, tap target creature an opponent controls. (Artifacts, legendaries, and Sagas are historic.)', 'Whenever you cast a historic spell, target player mills two cards. (Artifacts, legendaries, and Sagas are historic.)', "Whenever you cast a historic spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, create a token that's a copy of Mishra's Self-Replicator. (Artifacts, legendaries, and Sagas are historic.)", 'Whenever you cast a historic spell, you may pay {B}. If you do, return Lingering Phantom from your graveyard to your hand. (Artifacts, legendaries, and Sagas are historic.)', "Whenever you cast a spell, if that spell was kicked, Bloodstone Goblin gets +1/+1 and gains menace until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'Woodland Cemetery enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Swamp or a Forest.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}.', 'You may cast Squee, the Immortal from your graveyard or from exile.', "You may have Thorn Elemental assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", 'You may look at the top card of your library any time.\\nYou may cast instant and sorcery spells from the top of your library.\\n{3}: Exile the top card of your library.', "You may pay {3}{U} and tap an untapped artifact you control rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nFlying", '[+1]: Add {R}{R}. Chandra, Bold Pyromancer deals 2 damage to target player.\\n[−3]: Chandra, Bold Pyromancer deals 3 damage to target creature or planeswalker.\\n[−7]: Chandra, Bold Pyromancer deals 10 damage to target player and each creature and planeswalker they control.', '[+1]: Add {R}{R}{R}. Spend this mana only to cast instant or sorcery spells.\\n[+1]: Discard up to three cards, then draw that many cards.\\n[−8]: You get an emblem with "You may cast instant and sorcery spells from your graveyard. If a spell cast this way would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead."', '[+1]: Draw a card. At the beginning of the next end step, untap up to two lands.\\n[−3]: Put target nonland permanent into its owner\'s library third from the top.\\n[−8]: You get an emblem with "Whenever you draw a card, exile target permanent an opponent controls."', '[+1]: Reveal the top two cards of your library. An opponent chooses one of them. Put that card into your hand and exile the other with a silver counter on it.\\n[−1]: Put a card you own with a silver counter on it from exile into your hand.\\n[−2]: Create a 0/0 colorless Construct artifact creature token with "This creature gets +1/+1 for each artifact you control."', '[+2]: Untap up to one target artifact or creature.\\n[−3]: You gain 2 life and draw two cards.\\n[−9]: Take an extra turn after this one.', '{1}, Sacrifice another creature: Thallid Omnivore gets +2/+2 until end of turn. If a Saproling was sacrificed this way, you gain 2 life.', '{1}, {T}: Tap target artifact, creature, or land.', '{1}{G}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.\\nSacrifice two Saprolings: You gain 2 life and draw a card.', '{1}{G}: Add one mana of any color.', '{2}, Sacrifice a creature: Draw a card.', '{3}, {T}: Draw a card. Then discard a card unless you exile a historic card from your graveyard. (Artifacts, legendaries, and Sagas are historic.)', '{3}: Tap Drudge Sentinel. It gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)', '{4}, {T}: You may put a historic permanent card from your hand onto the battlefield. (Artifacts, legendaries, and Sagas are historic.)', '{6}, {T}, Sacrifice Bloodtallow Candle: Target creature gets -5/-5 until end of turn.', '{B}: Dread Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Tragic Poet: Return target enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Draw a card.', '{T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Orcish Vandal deals 2 damage to any target.', '{T}, Sacrifice two creatures: Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color among legendary creatures and planeswalkers you control.', '{T}: Add three mana of any one color.', '{T}: Add {C} for each artifact you control named Powerstone Shard.', '{T}: Add {C}. Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Add {B} for each basic Swamp you control.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Add {G}.\\n{T}: Add {G}{G}. Spend this mana only to cast kicked spells.', '{T}: You may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield.']
flavor: ['"A problem is only a problem if you don\'t have the tools to correct it."\\n—Jhoira', '"All hail the Demonlord Belzenlok, Evincar of the Stronghold, Scion of Darkness, Doom of Fools, Lord of the Wastes, Master of the Ebon Hand, Eternal Patriarch of the Cabal . . ."', '"As Argoth\'s last defenders fell to Urza\'s juggernauts, Titania said, \'Nature cannot be destroyed, only changed.\'"\\n—*The Antiquities War*', '"Bring me an angel feather, and I will give you one death in return. There can be no turning back once the candle is lit."\\n—Whisper, blood liturgist', '"Cherish this world in honor of the martyrs who saved it. We too must be prepared to give our lives."\\n—*The Mending of Dominaria*', '"Chronicles across the ages describe Jodah. They likely refer not to one mage, but to a family or an arcane title."\\n—Arkol, Argivian scholar', '"Don\'t worry, they don\'t bite. They much prefer setting people on fire."\\n—Jaya Ballard, to Chandra', '"Druids endure disaster as seeds endure winter. Now Krosa blooms once more."', '"Everywhere you look, this world is healing from its wounds. Aren\'t you ready to do the same?"\\n—Jhoira, to Teferi', '"Fear the dark if you must, but don\'t mistake sunlight for safety."\\n—Josu Vess', '"For the lost and forgotten, I will keep watch."', '"From the volcanoes of Shiv to the Balduvian steppes, I have sought a worthy teacher. At last, I have found one."', '"Go swiftly, clever arrow, and teach\\nThe philosophy of stillness."\\n—D\'Avenant verse', '"Half of your studies will be learning the laws of magic. The other half will be bending them."\\n—Naru Meha, master wizard', '"Homarids spread northward from Sarpadia as the climate cooled, raiding coastal settlements for supplies."\\n—*Time of Ice*', '"Honor rides before us. All we have to do is catch up."\\n—Danitha Capashen', '"I am heir to many treasures. None is as precious as knowing how my ancestor lived her life."', '"I can\'t bear to see another plane broken before I make my own home whole. I\'m sorry, but my watch is over."', '"I do as I please, little mortal. Do go on about your wishes, though—they amuse me to no end."', '"I have pustules of the great Ratadrabik, very cheap. No? Surely you\'ll want a tincture of Nevinyrral\'s pulverized remains. Genuine!"', '"I will protect the less fortunate. I will love bravely. I will face despair and fight on. As a Capashen, I can do no less."', '"I won\'t abandon the *Weatherlight*. My destiny is to serve at Jhoira\'s side. This \'illness\' means I must trust my faith more and myself less."', '"In a healing world I write—I, who will never be healed. Let my last gift be one of memory: from a thousand lost thoughts, choose one, and remember my name."', '"Let go of all that harms you. Cast your burdens into the darkness, and build for the faithful a house of light."\\n—*Song of All*, canto 1008', '"Light from the Null Moon took form—a mirage made real, alone in grandeur, isolated in a world that once had been its own."\\n—*Fall of the Thran*', '"Light passing through a powerstone is refracted by eternity and colored by planar energy. I wonder how the world appeared through Urza\'s eyes?"\\n—Teferi', '"Llanowar\'s boughs are ever ready\\nTo unleash an autumn of steel leaves."\\n—"Song of Freyalise"', '"Long ago, I enchanted an army of statues to guard Zhalfir. My homeland is gone, but its protectors remain."\\n—Teferi', '"Look how they beg for the knife! The Demonlord has trained them well."', '"My ancestor Toshiro used to say, \'Life is a series of choices between bad and worse.\' I\'m a master of making great bad choices."', '"My child grew from rot and ruin, yet she bloomed."\\n—Multani', '"My father will be happy to see you."', '"My flock flew from a distant continent ruined by cataclysm and war. Benalia gave us shelter to end our exodus."', '"My heart is not mine, it is Belzenlok\'s. All hearts are his, and all blood."\\n—"Rite of Belzenlok"', '"Nature is not always gentle or kind, but all life begets life."\\n—Marwyn of Llanowar', '"Nothing is too broken to mend."', '"Our ancestors brought down a Phyrexian portal ship, then built our town on its hull. We\'re pretty proud of that."\\n—Alene of Riverspan', '"Perfect. Now do it again."', '"Ready . . . uh . . . fire!"', '"Rise, knight of New Benalia."', '"Shiv is a restless land. It heaves ash, bleeds lava, and scabs over in black obsidian."\\n—*The First Eruption*', '"Sleep now, brother. That is the one gift I can give you."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Some aspire to climb the mountain of Honor. The Benalish are born upon its peak, and from there ascend among the stars."\\n—*History of Benalia*', '"Sometimes the only difference between a martyr and a hero is a sword."\\n—Captain Sisay, *Memoirs*', '"Take their faces. The lips of these unbelievers may yet honor the Demonlord."', '"The Ancestor saved us for a purpose."', '"The Demonlord has ruled every age. Every ruin, myth, and nightmare proves his power."\\n—"Rite of Belzenlok"', '"The Mountain gave the Flame to Kradak to light the furnaces of his people\'s hearts. The wanderers became Keldons, and he the first warlord."\\n—"The Flame of Keld"', '"The best way to learn from a book on pyromancy is to burn it."\\n—Jaya Ballard', '"The flame paints a bright wheel on the sky, then shifts into a stabbing spark. The enemy falls; the smoke of victory rises."\\n—"Legends of the Firedancer"', '"The forest surrounding the Vess estate became the Caligo Morass, a vast bog stalked by horrors too terrible to name."\\n—"The Fall of the House of Vess"', '"The future is my gift to Keld."', '"The heat in our hearts sometimes rises to the surface."\\n—Valduk, keeper of the Flame', '"The identifying ornamental growths of alpha thallids may be hereditary, or catalyzed by some chemical signal."\\n—*Sarpadian Empires, vol. III*', '"The old ways were for a winter world. We do what\'s best for us, not for the past. We are Keldons!"\\n—Grand Warlord Radha', '"The perfection of the lotus reminds me of my hopes for this world . . . and my failures. I will not rest until I\'ve atoned for them."\\n—Karn', '"The second mage learned to dissipate blasts of lightning. Threat and response: thus did the study of magic progress."\\n—Naban, dean of iteration', '"The spirit of Serra raised Brindri high and commanded her to keep the balance."\\n—*Song of All*, canto 524', '"The study of magic began when the first mage taught herself to throw lightning."\\n—Naban, dean of iteration', '"The trick is, once you get moving, don\'t stop!"', '"The trick to talking sense into Keldons is getting them to hold still. I learned that from Radha."\\n—Jhoira', '"The true measure of all heroes is not what they achieve, but who they inspire."\\n—*Triumph of Gerrard*', '"The walls of Argive were built by a peaceful dynastic union that has guarded us against war for fifteen centuries. The lesson is clear."', '"The wind whispers, \'come home,\' but I cannot."\\n—Teferi', '"They never found the body of young Josu, or that of his murderous sister."\\n—"The Fall of the House of Vess"', '"To the head of Archaeological Findings: The excavation schedule at dig site 93-beta must be revised. Part of the site has walked off."\\n—Tolarian field dispatch', '"True power never dies, but lies awake, waiting for its name to be spoken."\\n—*The Eldest Reborn*', '"Truly understanding even one volume can be a life\'s work."\\n—Naru Meha, master wizard', '"Urborg used to be lovely—scenic volcanoes, respectable lich lords. Since the Cabal came with their nightmares and thrulls, it\'s all gone to the worms."\\n—Mister Lostspoons, Skulltown gossip', '"Urza\'s machines have a splendid habit of excavating themselves."\\n—Rona, disciple of Gix', '"We don\'t choose who comes here. We choose how long they stay."', '"We have inherited the mysteries of the Thran, but few of the answers."\\n—Jhoira', '"What fire forged, fire remembers."', '"Whatever faith you have in Serra, she has more in you."\\n—Lyra Dawnbringer', '"When history becomes too mournful, even good souls may choose to forget."\\n—Shalai, voice of Plenty', '"When their community grows cluttered, thallids begin a traditional bobbing dance, then trek out in all directions."\\n—*Sarpadian Empires, vol. III*', '"Yavimaya is aware, but not always awake. You will know the difference when you see it."\\n—Karn', '"Yavimaya is one being—one vastness of rippling leaves, one deepness of roots, and one chatter of animals—of which I am one part."', '"You are not alone. You never were."', '"You bound me with a contract only your death could end—and you thought me the fool?"\\n—Liliana Vess', '"You can hear its tail thrashing from a mile away. Keep in mind that its jaws may already be half a mile closer."\\n—Jenson Carthalion, Yavimaya exile', '"You could say it was my pet project."\\n—Jhoira', '"You gotta be pretty smart to live long as me, but not being able to die helps."', '"Your contract is in default. You belong to me now. Serve, or die."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"Your life is finished, your name lost, and your work forgotten. It is as though Mazeura never existed."\\n—*Chainer\'s Torment*', 'A Thran relic, it has spent ten thousand years doing absolutely nothing.', 'A baloth only cares about the many things it eats and the few things that eat it.', 'A light to pierce the shadows.', 'A living remnant of the Ice Age.', 'A missing piece in search of a puzzle.', 'A moment in time made tangible, it has the power to realize epic visions.', 'A new gathering for a new age.', 'A pegasus chooses its rider, bearing the worthy into the clouds and tossing all others to the ground.', 'A shadow to swallow the light.', 'Acolytes of the lost Lord Windgrace fight to keep Urborg relics out of Cabal hands.', 'An ancient device recovered from a thawing glacier high in the Karplusan mountains.', 'An ancient nemesis rendered harmless long ago.', 'Archaeologists depend on automatons inspired by their previous discoveries at Koilos to guard the excavations.', "Archaeologists don't just dig in the dirt. They excavate time, scraping off the years grain by grain.", 'As Jhoira restored the *Weatherlight*, a mushroom growing in its hold unexpectedly became her first crew member.', 'As patient and generous as life, as harsh and merciless as nature.', "As she took the wheel of the *Weatherlight* for the first time in a millennium, Jhoira knew she'd been right to restore the ship. Anything was possible now.", 'As the Cabal legions pushed into Shiv, they learned not to stand so close together.', 'As the irrepressible power of a dormant Multani courses through Yavimaya, the forest passes judgment on travelers and natives alike. Only the fungus prospers.', 'As the phantom flies overhead, the city of Vhelnish screams in silence.', 'Benalish citizens born under the same constellations share a star-clan. Their loyalty to one another interlaces the Seven Houses.', 'Benalish glazeplate is stained with salts from the Rift Era and enchanted to deflect blows.', 'Burning something is easy. Choosing a target can be more difficult.', 'Centuries ago, a barbarian laid his rage to rest.', 'Centuries ago, a mad god offered a simple trade.', "Centuries ago, a pyromancer's spark ignited a fiery conflagration.", 'Centuries ago, a quest to harness time became a spiral into chaos.', 'Centuries ago, five dragons conquered death to rule the living.', "Centuries ago, one man's vengeance plunged the world into ice and darkness.", "Deep beneath the ruined continent of Otaria, there's a mine where goblins still work, ignorant of the destruction above.", 'Descendant of a vanished land, student of a forgotten general, and master of blades no smith could forge anew. He honors them all by living a life worthy of song.', 'Enchanted by mage-smiths and blessed by priests, Benalish windows let in light and cast out darkness.', 'Every ancient relic is a weapon if you throw it hard enough.', 'Every odyssey begins with a single step.', "Fallen Phyrexians were transmuted into elementals by Gaea long ago, but Yavimaya's other inhabitants still regard them with unease.", 'Flittersprites collect unusually valuable things: coins of fallen empires, baby teeth, and memories of treasured names.', "For cryomancers, studying the Ice Age isn't just an academic exercise.", 'For generations, the inhabitants of Orvada have hungered for turtle soup. For generations, the turtles have frustrated their ambitions.', 'Forged out of flowstone for the queen of Vesuva.', 'Glaciers, torrential floods, and temporal disturbances came and went. The mountains yet stood, unchanged.', "Grand Warlord Radha's challengers are always defeated, but she rewards the most passionate with the Flame of Keld. After that, they burn for her.", 'He watches the pass in both directions, and all must pay his toll.', 'Her knack for tampering with wards got her kicked out of the academy, but they also got her back in.', 'Ice may thaw, but malice never does.', 'In lives that have stretched for centuries, there are bound to be a few awkward silences.', 'In the Cabal, death is just another mark of devotion.', "It has witnessed history's most significant events, one incarnation after another.", 'It skitters across Shiv, each tendril hitting the ground with a sharp snap.', "It spilled the blood of one elder dragon. In Gideon's hands, it may yet taste another's.", 'It wails of buried riches and the souls lost seeking them.', 'Keld faced an apocalypse to fulfill a dire prophecy. Now Keldons have nothing left to believe in except themselves.', "Keldon raiders' spoils are limited to what their colos can carry. No matter the value, the rest goes up in smoke.", "Keldon warriors take advantage of the cyclops's inability to focus on more than one thing at a time.", 'Knights get the glory. Soldiers get things done.', 'Like a cross between a spider and a spyglass, but friendlier.', 'Llanowar elfhames occupy different heights within the great forest. Elves of the Loridalh and Kelfae hames can see neither earth nor sky.', 'Llanowar elves conceal their ballistae in the upper canopy of the forest, ready to clear the skies of any intruder.', 'Midwife to mothers and leader to all.', 'Most spiders of Llanowar disdain elvish alliances. No elf has as many beautiful eyes or as many strong arms.', "Multani's mind grasped for consciousness as rage itself rebuilt his body.", 'Neither its appearance nor its temperature varies as the years pass, an eternal testament to the forces that shaped Dominaria.', 'Not since the days of Pashalik Mons have the Rundvelt goblins been so united or effective.', 'Nothing tastes finer to an ooze than a priceless family heirloom.', 'On Amonkhet, Gideon lost both his sural and his faith in himself. But he can still throw a punch, and he still knows a bad guy when he sees one.', 'One eye open to see the truth of the world. One eye covered to gaze at the goddess within.', "Saved from destruction by one planeswalker's sacrifice, the Eliterate colony forswore the taking of life.", "Serra's blessing lies strongest upon Sursi, where her holy chapels are untouched even as the Cabal encroaches.", "Some of the thallids that escaped into the fens of Urborg began emulating the Cabal's bloodsoaked rituals in their own peculiar way.", 'Sometimes Shivan dragons toy with their food. Other times they just cook it.', 'Thallids herd saprolings from place to place in search of detritus to feed them.', 'Thallids nurture saprolings, entertain them, and eat them.', 'The *Weatherlight* can no longer planeshift, but it can traverse Dominaria with ease.', 'The Benalish aristocracy is hereditary, but the loyalty of its subjects is earned.', 'The Cabal assured the Seven Houses that hostages receive all the food and rest they require.', 'The Cabal soldier blinked and found day had become night, he had a face full of thistle seeds, and the old man was nowhere to be seen.', 'The Ghitu of Shiv are as fierce and uncompromising as their volcanic home.', 'The Tolarian Academies are known for their magical research, powerful sorcerers, and accidental destruction of ecosystems.', 'The Tolarian Academies embrace a tradition of study and research while discouraging the kinds of experiments that ruined the original island of Tolaria.', 'The Vodalian Empire tends to be insular. The scholarly Volshe caste are the exception, using education as an antidote to xenophobia.', 'The angel remembers her past lives like dreams. Her song held up meadows. Her blade drove back darkness. Her wings carried her across the ages.', 'The bond between Llanowar elves and their kavu empowers both.', 'The bower shuddered. The stillness broke. The scurf shifted, and a being emerged from the flowers and ferns.', "The crystal pulsed with the power of Teferi's planeswalker spark. Had Jhoira given him a blessing or a curse?", 'The fire spell stuttered and broke. Its pieces reached Teferi out of rhythm, meaningless.', "The first law of Yavimaya is that guests may kill only to survive. As fires aren't needed in the warm weather, cutting trees for wood means death.", 'The first mistake the Grimnant knights made was bullying the owner of an Urborg corpse shop. Their second mistake was dying.', 'The first to arrive on Dominaria from their distant home, the marids are the oldest tribe of djinn and the most respected by storm and sea.', 'The hammer strikes. The Flame awakens.', 'The mage-smiths of New Benalia have perfected the art of blending fine steel and enchanted glass into weapons that are both beautiful and deadly. Only elite knights are entrusted with these martial works of art.', 'The passionate intensity of the Ghitu tempered by the cool insight of Tolarian training.', 'The peaks of Hurloon never fall silent.', 'The portal opens not to the past, but from it. Those who step through discover an unimaginable future.', "The seat of Belzenlok's power, the Stronghold serves as the gathering place for the Cabal as their dark influence spreads from Urborg.", 'The shield took a year to craft, a month to enchant, and a decade to master—all for one glorious moment.', 'The stone whispers tales of darkness and fire. She replies, "Tell me more."', "The sunlight falls pristine on the temple at Epityr, softened by the remembered shadows of angelic saviors' wings.", 'The trainers were a gift of gratitude from the wizards of Tolaria West to the knights of New Benalia for their aid during the Talas Incursion.', "The unicorns of Sursi are a manifestation of Serra's joy and compassion. They frolic and dance like children, offering blessings to anyone they encounter.", 'The versatile "fiery gauntlet" is among the first spells young Ghitu mages learn.', 'Thelon of Havenwood created thallids as a food source in times of darkness. Thallids did the same with saprolings.', 'Theologians now believe the Ancestor was another divine form of Serra.', 'Though it was laid to waste by the brothers, many schools of magic trace their origins to the College of Lat-Nam, including the first Tolarian Academy.', 'To thallids, the whole world is just a pile of mulch to grow saprolings in.', 'Tolarians teach the theory of pyromancy. The Ghitu prefer applied research.', 'War begins with one red ember.', "When Belzenlok's lieutenant Yar-Kul grew too ambitious, the Demonlord transformed him into a maggot. The frog that ate the maggot grew and grew, until a ravenous spirit burst from its body.", "With just a few seconds to escape, Deryan saved Hurkyl's editions on restoring physical objects from ash.", 'Wreckage from the Phyrexian Invasion provided the rats with a seemingly unlimited number of breeding grounds.']
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Adam Paquette', 'Alayna Danner', 'Alex Konstad', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Bastien L. Deharme', 'Bayard Wu', 'Brad Rigney', 'Bram Sels', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Chris Seaman', 'Christine Choi', 'Cliff Childs', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Darek Zabrocki', 'David Palumbo', 'Dimitar Marinski', 'Donato Giancola', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Even Amundsen', 'Filip Burburan', 'Florian de Gesincourt', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'G-host Lee', 'Greg Opalinski', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Arnold', 'James Paick', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Kang', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jehan Choo', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Joe Slucher', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Severin Brassell', 'John Stanko', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Jonathan Kuo', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Josu Hernaiz', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lake Hurwitz', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lindsey Look', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Manuel Castañón', 'Mark Behm', 'Mark Poole', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Stewart', 'Mike Burns', 'Min Yum', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Randy Vargas', 'Ravenna Tran', 'Richard Wright', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Sara Winters', 'Scott Murphy', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Simon Dominic', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Sung Choi', 'Suzanne Helmigh', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Titus Lunter', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tommy Arnold', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Tyler Walpole', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Viktor Titov', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wesley Burt', 'Winona Nelson', 'XiaoDi Jin', 'YW Tang', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Yongjae Choi', 'Zack Stella', 'Zezhou Chen', 'Zoltan Boros']
