rulings: ["[{'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'In Two-Headed Giant, triggers only once per upkeep, not once for each player.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Verdant Force’s ability triggers at the beginning of each upkeep, not just each of your upkeeps.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\'t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers “whenever you cast a historic spell” doesn\'t trigger if a historic card is put onto the battlefield without being cast."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Lands are never cast, so abilities that trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell” won\'t trigger if you play a legendary land. They also won\'t trigger if a card on the battlefield transforms into a legendary land, as the Ixalan and Rivals of Ixalan double-faced cards do."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Some abilities trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell.” Such an ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\'t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers “whenever you cast a historic spell” doesn\'t trigger if a historic card is put onto the battlefield without being cast."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Lands are never cast, so abilities that trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell” won\'t trigger if you play a legendary land. They also won\'t trigger if a card on the battlefield transforms into a legendary land, as the Ixalan and Rivals of Ixalan double-faced cards do."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Some abilities trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell.” Such an ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\'t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn\'t."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A chapter ability doesn\'t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter\'s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won\'t trigger again."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn\'t use the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Each symbol on the left of a Saga\'s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability\'s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won\'t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won\'t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga\'s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn\'t use the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "The effect of Phyrexian Scriptures\'s first chapter ability lasts indefinitely. It doesn\'t expire when Phyrexian Scriptures leaves the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A chapter ability doesn\'t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter\'s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won\'t trigger again."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn\'t use the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Each symbol on the left of a Saga\'s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability\'s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won\'t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won\'t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga\'s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn\'t use the stack."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A creature with first strike and double strike deals combat damage the same as a creature with double strike. It doesn\'t deal damage three times or before other creatures with first strike."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If a creature loses double strike after first strike damage is dealt, it won\'t deal normal combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If a creature you control gains first strike after Kwende has entered the battlefield, that creature also gains double strike.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A spell causes you to gain life if its cost or effect instructs you to gain life or if an instruction in its cost or effect is modified by a replacement effect and the modified event includes you gaining life. If a spell\'s cost or effect instructs a source with lifelink you control to deal damage, that spell causes that life gain as well."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Firesong and Sunspeaker\'s last ability doesn\'t trigger if a triggered ability of a white instant or sorcery spell or card causes you to gain life, such as the triggered ability of Renewed Faith when it\'s cycled."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If a red and white spell you control deals damage and also instructs you to gain life, Firesong and Sunspeaker\'s last ability triggers twice."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If a red and white spell you control deals damage to multiple things using the word “deals” only once, Firesong and Sunspeaker\'s last ability triggers only once. Similarly, if a red and white spell\'s effect causes it to deal damage to one thing and then deal more damage with a second instance of the word “deals,” Firesong and Sunspeaker\'s last ability triggers twice, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If a source you control with lifelink deals damage to you, you gain and lose that much life simultaneously. Your life total doesn\'t change."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If a white instant or sorcery spell you don\'t control causes you to gain life, Firesong and Sunspeaker\'s last ability triggers."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and Firesong and Sunspeaker\'s last ability triggers only once."}, {\'date\': \'2023-04-14\', \'text\': \'The last ability of Firesong and Sunspeaker can’t target a planeswalker or battle.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Adeliz\'s last ability affects only Wizards you control at the time it resolves, including Adeliz itself. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn or that become Wizards later in the turn won\'t get +1/+1."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Adeliz\'s last ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "All of the permanents put onto the battlefield this way enter at the same time. If any have triggered abilities that trigger on something else entering the battlefield, they\'ll see each other."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Other than the casting restriction, the legendary supertype on a sorcery carries no additional rules. You may cast any number of legendary sorceries in a turn, and your deck may contain any number of legendary cards (but no more than four of any with the same name).\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast a legendary sorcery unless you control a legendary creature or a legendary planeswalker. Once you begin to cast a legendary sorcery, losing control of your legendary creatures and planeswalkers won\'t affect that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'You must return all legendary permanent cards to the battlefield, even if the “legend rule” will put some right back into your graveyard. If any abilities triggered from the legendary permanents entering the battlefield, those abilities will be put onto the stack after applying the “legend rule.”\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "As long as it\'s on the battlefield, Shanna\'s last ability will count itself, so it\'ll be at least 1/1."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until it\'s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Shanna may become lethal if other creatures you control leave the battlefield during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Shanna\'s ability that modifies its power and toughness applies only while it\'s on the battlefield. In all other zones, it\'s a 0/0 creature card."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Spells your opponents control can target Shanna.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until it\'s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a legendary creature you control may become lethal if Arvad leaves the battlefield during that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Dub can enchant a creature that\'s already a Knight. It will get +2/+2 and have first strike, but it won\'t benefit from becoming a Knight."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If an Aura or Equipment is put into your graveyard during an end step, you\'ll be able to return it during the next end step, not the current one."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If an Aura or Equipment leaves the graveyard after triggering Tiana\'s last ability, it won\'t be returned to its owner\'s hand as the delayed triggered ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If an Aura or Equipment you control is put into a graveyard at the same time as Tiana is, most likely because an effect destroyed all nonland permanents, you\'ll be able to return it to its owner\'s hand at the beginning of the next end step."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If an Aura you control is put into a graveyard immediately after Tiana leaves the battlefield, most likely because Tiana left the battlefield but the Aura was put into the graveyard as a state-based action after it found itself not attached to anything, Tiana\'s last ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Tiana\'s last ability triggers and creates a delayed triggered ability that will let you return the Aura or Equipment during the next end step. It will do so even if Tiana leaves the battlefield before the next end step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If the target creature\'s power is greater than X as Aryel\'s last ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. You can\'t tap extra Knights once the ability has been activated."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re activating Aryel\'s last ability, no player may take other actions until the ability\'s been paid for. Notably, players can\'t try to make the value of X invalid by removing or tapping your Knights."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Tapping Aryel to activate either of its abilities while it\'s attacking doesn\'t remove it from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped Knights you control, including ones you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the cost of Aryel\'s last ability. However, you must have controlled Aryel continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn in order to use either of its activated abilities."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If you control more than one Wizard, Academy Journeymage\'s cost is reduced by only {1}."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting Academy Journeymage, no player may take other actions until the spell\'s been paid for. Notably, players can\'t try to raise the spell\'s cost by removing your Wizards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If you control no legendary creatures or legendary planeswalkers, you can activate Mox Amber\'s ability, but you won\'t add any mana."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If your legendary creatures and legendary planeswalkers are all colorless, you can activate Mox Amber\'s ability, but you won\'t add any mana. Colorless is not a color."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Mox Amber\'s ability adds one mana of the color of your choice from among the colors of legendary creatures and legendary planeswalkers you control. It doesn\'t add one mana of each of those colors."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once a creature you control has been blocked, changing its power to 1 or less won\'t cause it to become unblocked. Changing its toughness to 1 won\'t cause it to become unblocked, and changing its toughness to less than 1 will cause it to die."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Squee\'s ability doesn\'t prevent you from casting Squee from any other zone."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions and pay its cost to cast Squee from your graveyard or from exile.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'"Equip [quality] creature" is a variant of the equip keyword. "Equip [quality] creature [cost]" means "[Cost]: Attach this Equipment to target [quality] creature you control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Whether the target creature is legendary is checked only as Blackblade Reforged\'s first equip ability is activated and as that ability resolves. If the creature somehow becomes nonlegendary later, Blackblade Reforged remains attached to it."}]', "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn’t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn’t.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'After Rona’s last ability resolves, you have priority if it’s your turn. You can cast the exiled card before any player can take other actions if it’s legal to do so.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Rona leaves the battlefield, the exiled cards will remain exiled indefinitely. If Rona enters the battlefield again, it won’t be associated with the cards the “other” Rona exiled. The new Rona will exile a new set of cards with its first and last abilities. Only those cards can be cast using the new Rona’s middle ability.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once you begin to cast a card, losing control of Rona won’t affect the spell.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The card you’ll exile from the top of your library is determined as Rona’s last ability resolves. This might not be the card that was on top of your library when you activated that ability.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The cards exiled from your library are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The exiled cards aren’t in your hand, so you can’t cycle them, discard them, or activate any of their activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of the cards you cast from exile.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You’ll still pay all costs for that spell, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs such as that granted by Jodah, Archmage Eternal.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn’t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn’t.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'An ability that triggers “whenever you cast a historic spell” doesn’t trigger if a historic card is put onto the battlefield without being cast.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Mishra’s Self-Replicator leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the token will still enter the battlefield as a copy of Mishra’s Self-Replicator, using Mishra’s Self-Replicator’s copiable values from when it was last on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Lands are never cast, so abilities that trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell” won’t trigger if you play a legendary land. They also won’t trigger if a card on the battlefield transforms into a legendary land, as the Ixalan and Rivals of Ixalan double-faced cards do.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Some abilities trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell.” Such an ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The token will have Mishra’s Self-Replicator’s ability. It will also be able to create copies of itself.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The token won’t copy counters or damage marked on Mishra’s Self-Replicator, nor will it copy other effects that have changed Mishra’s Self-Replicator’s power, toughness, types, color, and so on. Normally, this means the token will simply be a Mishra’s Self-Replicator, but if any copy effects have affected that Mishra’s Self-Replicator, they’re taken into account.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'While resolving the triggered ability of Mishra’s Self-Replicator, you can’t pay {1} multiple times to create more than one token. However, if you control more than one Mishra’s Self-Replicator, you can pay {1} for each of their abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn’t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn’t.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'An ability that triggers “whenever you cast a historic spell” doesn’t trigger if a historic card is put onto the battlefield without being cast.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Lands are never cast, so abilities that trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell” won’t trigger if you play a legendary land. They also won’t trigger if a card on the battlefield transforms into a legendary land, as the Ixalan and Rivals of Ixalan double-faced cards do.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Some abilities trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell.” Such an ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn’t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn’t.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Curator’s Ward is attached to a historic permanent you don’t control, you draw two cards when that permanent leaves the battlefield, not that permanent’s controller.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If you give hexproof to an opponent’s permanent, such as by enchanting it with Curator’s Ward, that player can still target that permanent, but you can’t.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn’t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn’t.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can choose to discard a card even if there’s a historic card in your graveyard you could exile.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You don’t choose whether to discard or exile a card from your graveyard until after you see the card you draw.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn’t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn’t.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'An Equipment that becomes an artifact creature becomes unattached if it’s attached to a creature. Its equip ability can be activated, but it won’t become attached to the target creature.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Effects that modify an artifact creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Titanic Growth, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If The Antiquities War somehow becomes an artifact enchantment prior to resolving its final chapter ability, it will become a 5/5 Saga artifact enchantment creature, and will then be sacrificed after that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The final chapter ability of The Antiquities War affects only artifacts you control at the time it resolves. Artifacts you begin to control later in the turn won’t become 5/5 creatures.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The final chapter ability of The Antiquities War overwrites an artifact creature’s normal base power and toughness and all previous effects that set an artifact creature’s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after the ability resolves will overwrite this effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each of Song of Freyalise’s chapter abilities affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t gain abilities or get a +1/+1 counter.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If a player somehow has only one land card in their graveyard when either of Fall of the Thran’s last two chapter abilities resolves, that player returns that one card to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If an effect such as that of Anointed Procession causes the final chapter ability of Chainer’s Torment to create two Nightmare Horror tokens, each will deal X damage to you.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If another effect causes the Nightmare Horror token’s power or toughness to be a number other than X immediately after it enters the battlefield, the amount of damage it deals to you is still X, not its modified power or toughness.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, the first chapter abilities of Chainer’s Torment each cause the opposing team to lose 4 life and you to gain 2 life.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If damage dealt by a source you control is being divided or assigned among multiple permanents an opponent controls or among an opponent and one or more permanents they control simultaneously, divide the original amount before adding 2. For example, if you attack with a 5/5 red creature with trample and your opponent blocks with a 2/2 creature, you can assign 2 damage to the blocker and 3 damage to the defending player. These amounts are then modified to 4 and 5, respectively.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple replacement effects would modify how damage would be dealt, the player being dealt damage (or the controller of the permanent being dealt damage) chooses the order in which to apply those effects.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Fight with Fire does when kicked), the division can’t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can).'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Jaya’s Immolating Inferno does), the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can’t be chosen.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The Mirari Conjecture’s final chapter ability copies any instant or sorcery spell you cast, not just those with targets.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The controller of a copy can’t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the permanent you control from The Eldest Reborn’s final chapter ability is exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'When the first chapter ability of The Eldest Reborn resolves, the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, that opponent) chooses a creature or planeswalker they control, then each other opponent in turn order (if any) does the same. All chosen permanents are then sacrificed at the same time. Players will know the choices made by earlier players when making their choices.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'When the second chapter ability of The Eldest Reborn resolves, the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, that opponent) chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then each other opponent in turn order (if any) does the same. All chosen cards are then discarded at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The effect of Time of Ice’s final chapter ability returns creatures that are tapped for any reason, not just those tapped by Time of Ice.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The effects of Time of Ice’s first two chapter abilities expire if you lose control of it, even if you immediately regain control of it or cast another Time of Ice.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The final chapter ability of History of Benalia affects only Knights you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn or that become Knights later in the turn won’t get +2/+1.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Triumph of Gerrard’s chapter abilities each target any creature you control with the greatest power among creatures you control. If the power of another creature you control becomes greater before that ability resolves, the target is illegal.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'While resolving The First Eruption’s final chapter ability, you must sacrifice one Mountain if able. You can’t sacrifice multiple Mountains to deal more damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A creature attacks alone if it’s the only creature declared as an attacker during the declare attackers step (including creatures controlled by your teammates, if applicable). For example, Grunn’s last ability won’t trigger if you attack with multiple creatures and all but one of them are removed from combat.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If a creature’s power is less than 0 when it’s doubled, instead that creature gets -X/-0, where X is how much less than 0 its power is. For example, if an effect has given Grunn -7/-0 so that it’s a -2/5 creature, doubling its power and toughness gives it -2/+5, and it’s a -4/10 until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to “double” a creature’s power, that creature gets +X/+0, where X is its power as that effect begins to apply. The same is true for its toughness.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A token created by Karn’s last ability will count itself, so it’ll be at least 1/1.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Karn is colorless but not an artifact. The Construct tokens created by Karn’s last ability don’t count Karn.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Abilities that apply “as [this creature] enters the battlefield,” such as choosing a card name with Meddling Mage, are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If a Wizard entering the battlefield at the same time as Naban (including Naban itself) causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If a triggered ability is linked to a second ability, additional instances of that triggered ability are also linked to that second ability. If the second ability refers to “the exiled card,” it refers to all cards exiled by instances of the triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If you somehow control two Nabans, a Wizard entering the battlefield causes abilities to trigger three times, not four. A third Naban causes abilities to trigger four times, a fourth causes abilities to trigger five times, and so on.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'In some cases involving linked abilities, an ability requires information about “the exiled card.” When this happens, the ability gets multiple answers. If these answers are being used to determine the value of a variable, the sum is used. For example, if Elite Arcanist’s enters-the-battlefield ability triggers twice, two cards are exiled. The value of X in the activation cost of Elite Arcanist’s other ability is the sum of the two cards’ converted mana costs. As the ability resolves, you create copies of both cards and can cast none, one, or both of the copies in any order.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Look at each permanent as it exists on the battlefield, taking into account continuous effects, to determine whether any triggered abilities will trigger multiple times. For example, if you control Arcane Adaptation with Wizard as the chosen creature type, a Runeclaw Bear entering the battlefield will cause any abilities it triggers to trigger an additional time.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Naban affects a Wizard’s own enters-the-battlefield triggered abilities as well as other triggered abilities that trigger when that Wizard enters the battlefield. Such triggered abilities start with “when” or “whenever.”'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Naban’s effect doesn’t copy the triggered ability; it just causes the ability to trigger twice. Any choices made as you put the ability onto the stack, such as modes and targets, are made separately for each instance of the ability. Any choices made on resolution, such as whether to put counters on a permanent, are also made individually.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Replacement effects are unaffected by Naban’s first ability. For example, a Wizard that enters the battlefield with one +1/+1 counter on it won’t receive an additional +1/+1 counter.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The trigger event doesn’t have to specifically refer to “Wizards.” For example, an ability that triggers “whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control” would trigger twice if the entering creature is a Wizard.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'After Radha’s triggered ability resolves, you can cast spells and activate abilities before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The amount of mana you’ll add is the number of creatures you attack with. Creatures that are put onto the battlefield attacking before Radha’s triggered ability resolves don’t count, and creatures that attacked but left combat before the triggered ability resolves do count.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Aim counters are interchangeable. Your Haphazard Bombardment can destroy any permanent you don’t control with an aim counter on it no matter how that counter got there—for example, those aim counters may have come from a second Haphazard Bombardment that you or another opponent cast.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If one or more of the permanents with aim counters on them have indestructible, select the permanent destroyed at random from among the permanents with aim counters that don’t have indestructible.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Players can’t take actions between the time the permanent is randomly selected and the time it’s destroyed. Notably, if a land is randomly selected, it can’t be tapped for mana before being destroyed.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The nonenchantment permanents that receive aim counters aren’t targeted. Permanents with hexproof can be given an aim counter this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'All of the permanents put onto the battlefield this way enter at the same time. If any have triggered abilities that trigger on something else entering the battlefield, they’ll see each other.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'For cards in your library with {X} in their mana costs, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Other than the casting restriction, the legendary supertype on a sorcery carries no additional rules. You may cast any number of legendary sorceries in a turn, and your deck may contain any number of legendary cards (but no more than four of any with the same name).'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can’t cast a legendary sorcery unless you control a legendary creature or a legendary planeswalker. Once you begin to cast a legendary sorcery, losing control of your legendary creatures and planeswalkers won’t affect that spell.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any "as [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[this creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If the copied creature is a token, the token that\'s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created that token."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else (for example, if the copied creature is a Clone), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If the equipped creature leaves the battlefield before the triggered ability of Helm of the Host resolves, or if there is no equipped creature, no token is created. However, if Helm of the Host leaves the battlefield while its triggered ability is on the stack, a token will be created of the creature it last equipped. If that creature has also left the battlefield, its last known information is used to determine what the token looks like.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "The token gains haste indefinitely, and this effect isn\'t copiable. If something else copies the token later, that copy won\'t have haste."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'The token isn\\\'t legendary, and this exception is copiable. If something else copies the token later, that copy also won\\\'t be legendary. If you control two or more permanents with the same name but only one is legendary, the "legend rule" doesn\\\'t apply.\'}]', "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Any power-modifying effects, counters, Auras, or Equipment will apply after Evra’s power is set to your former life total. For example, say Evra is enchanted with Dub (which makes it 6/6) and your life total is 7. After the exchange, Evra would be a 9/6 creature (its power became 7, which was then modified by Dub) and your life total would be 6.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Evra isn’t on the battlefield when its activated ability resolves, the exchange can’t happen and the ability will have no effect. However, if Evra is on the battlefield but has power 0 or less, the exchange happens and you’ll lose the game.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'When its activated ability resolves, Evra’s power will become your former life total and you will gain or lose an amount of life such that your life total equals Evra’s former power. Other effects that interact with life gain or life loss will interact with this effect accordingly.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As Warcry Phoenix returns to the battlefield because of its triggered ability, you choose which opponent or opposing planeswalker it’s attacking. It doesn’t have to attack the same opponent or opposing planeswalker as your other attacking creatures.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Warcry Phoenix enters the battlefield attacking, it wasn’t declared as an attacking creature that turn. Abilities that trigger when a creature attacks won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Seal Away leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target creature won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Fungus or Saproling creature you control may become lethal if Sporecrown Thallid leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If a creature is somehow both a Fungus and a Saproling, Sporecrown Thallid’s ability gives it only +1/+1.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Wizard you control may become lethal if Naru leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Fight with Fire does when kicked), the division can’t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can).'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Jaya’s Immolating Inferno does), the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can’t be chosen.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Naru’s triggered ability can copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The controller of a copy can’t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature you control may become lethal if Benalish Marshal leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Bloodstone Goblin’s last ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Both loyalty counters must be put onto the same planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Settle the Score tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t put loyalty counters on a planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You don’t choose which planeswalker receives loyalty counters until Settle the Score resolves. If you don’t control a planeswalker, you’ll simply exile the target creature and not put loyalty counters on anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Broken Bond’s effect doesn’t count as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if you’ve already played your land for the turn.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target by the time Broken Bond tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t put a land card onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can’t cast Broken Bond unless you choose an artifact or enchantment as a target.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Chandra’s first ability can’t target a planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Chandra’s last ability targets only the player. Creatures and planeswalkers that player controls with hexproof will be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Charge affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +1/+1.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Dauntless Bodyguard’s first ability isn’t a triggered ability and doesn’t use the stack. Players can’t respond to your choice of which creature it’s protecting.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Dauntless Bodyguard enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, that creature can’t be chosen for its ability.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the chosen creature leaves the battlefield, you can’t choose a new creature for Dauntless Bodyguard to protect. If you activate its last ability in this case, no creature gains indestructible.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Deep Freeze overwrites all previous effects that set the creature’s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after the ability resolves will overwrite this effect.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Titanic Growth, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature has an ability that grants abilities to other objects, Deep Freeze’s effect will stop it from doing so. If the enchanted creature gains an ability after Deep Freeze resolves, it will keep that ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Demonic Vigor can enchant a token, but its last ability won’t return the token to your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Demonlord Belzenlok’s ability causes it to deal an amount of damage to you all at once; it doesn’t deal 1 damage multiple times.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the mana cost of the nonland card includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the nonland card doesn’t have a mana cost, its converted mana cost is 0.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Land cards exiled this way remain exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the triggered ability resolves, the ability will continue until you either exile a nonland card with converted mana cost 3 or less or fail to exile any nonland cards while performing the process. You can’t choose to stop receiving the blessings of Demonlord Belzenlok any sooner.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a split card, such as a card with aftermath from the Amonkhet block, is equal to the combined mana cost of its two halves.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'For Oath of Teferi’s second ability, you may activate the same ability of a planeswalker twice, or you may activate two different abilities of that planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it ceases to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the exiled card is an Aura, that card’s owner chooses what it will enchant as it returns to the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent’s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If you somehow control more than one Oath of Teferi, you won’t be able to activate abilities of planeswalkers you control more than twice in one turn.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The exiled card will return to the battlefield at the beginning of the next end step even if Oath of Teferi is no longer on the battlefield at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'For your life total to become half your starting life total (normally 10, half of 20), you gain or lose the appropriate amount of life. For example, if your life total is 4 when Torgaar’s ability resolves targeting you, it will cause you to gain 6 life; alternatively, if your life total is 25 when it resolves, it will cause you to lose 15 life. Other cards that interact with life gain or life loss will interact with this effect accordingly.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Torgaar’s ability causes the team’s life total to become half the team’s starting life total (normally 15, half of 30), but only the target player actually gains or loses life.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Torgaar’s first ability can’t reduce its cost below {B}{B}. You can sacrifice any number of creatures, even if they won’t reduce Torgaar’s cost any further.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Gaining a basic land type causes the target land to gain the corresponding mana ability. Because the new basic land type is “in addition to” its other types, it keeps the abilities it had previously.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Gaining control of a permanent doesn’t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it. They’ll remain attached, but an Aura’s effect that affects “you” still affects its controller rather than you, the controller of an Equipment can move it during their next main phase, and so on.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If you control two In Bolas’s Clutches attached to two permanents with the same name, the “legend rule” applies to the enchanted permanents and to In Bolas’s Clutches at once. You can choose to keep the In Bolas’s Clutches that enchants the permanent you wish to keep.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If you control two or more permanents with the same name but only one is legendary, the “legend rule” doesn’t apply.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Ghitu Journeymage’s ability doesn’t trigger if you don’t control another Wizard immediately after it enters the battlefield. If it does trigger but you don’t control another Wizard as it resolves, it does nothing.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Ghitu Journeymage’s triggered ability doesn’t deal more damage if you control more than one other Wizard.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Ghitu Journeymage’s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Goblin Warchief’s effect reduces only generic mana in the cost of Goblin spells you cast. For example, it doesn’t reduce the cost of Skirk Prospector below {R}.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Hallar’s last ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Hallar leaves the battlefield after its last ability has triggered but before it resolves, you don’t put a +1/+1 counter on anything as the ability resolves, but you do use the number of +1/+1 counters that were on Hallar before it left the battlefield to determine how much damage it deals to each opponent.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Hallar’s last ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life for each +1/+1 counter on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Healing Grace only targets the creature, planeswalker, or player that will receive the damage prevention “shield.” The source isn’t targeted.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You choose only one source, even if that source won’t deal 3 damage.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You gain 3 life as Healing Grace resolves, even if there’s no damage to prevent.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Darigaaz is exiled without any egg counters on it, its last ability won’t trigger and won’t return it to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If another effect says to exile Darigaaz if it would die, you may apply Darigaaz’s own effect first, giving it three egg counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Fight with Fire is kicked, it can target creatures, players, and planeswalkers.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If some of the targets are illegal targets as Fight with Fire tries to resolve, the original division of damage still applies and the damage that would have been dealt to the illegal targets is lost.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You choose how many targets Fight with Fire has and how the damage is divided as you put the spell onto the stack. Each target must receive at least 1 damage if Fight with Fire is kicked.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Gaea’s Blessing has no legal target cards in a graveyard, either because its targets became illegal or because you didn’t choose any, the target player shuffles their library.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If an effect puts multiple cards from your library into your graveyard at once, put all of those cards there before Gaea’s Blessing shuffles your graveyard into your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Ghitu Lavarunner loses haste after being declared as an attacker on the turn it comes under your control, it will continue to attack. It won’t be removed from combat. On the other hand, if it loses haste before your declare attackers step, it won’t be able to attack.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Gift of Growth was kicked, the target creature is untapped before getting +4/+4.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Kazarov is dealt damage at the same time that a creature an opponent controls is dealt damage, Kazarov must survive the damage to get a +1/+1 counter.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If a creature is dealt an amount of damage “for each” of something, that damage is dealt as one event and Kazarov’s triggered ability triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Kazarov’s triggered ability triggers once for each creature dealt damage at one time.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Territorial Allosaurus isn’t on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves, or if the target of that ability is illegal, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Territorial Allosaurus’s ability can target another creature you control (such as a Dinosaur with an enrage ability). If you kicked it but your opponent controls no creatures that are legal targets, the ability must target another one of your creatures. Plan carefully before kicking Dinosaurs.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If a creature is equipped with two Shields of the Realm, 4 damage will be prevented. Three Shields of the Realm will prevent 6 damage, and so on.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple replacement effects would modify how damage would be dealt, the controller of the permanent being dealt damage chooses the order in which to apply those effects.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple sources would deal damage to the equipped creature at once (for example, several blocking creatures), 2 damage from each of those sources is prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If all but one of Rampaging Cyclops’s blockers are removed from combat, Rampaging Cyclops’s effect immediately stops reducing its power.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If an effect says that a creature loses hexproof or can be targeted as though it didn’t have hexproof, this applies to hexproof from black as well.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Knight of Grace only gets +1/+0 if any player controls a black permanent, no matter how many black permanents players control.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': '“Hexproof from [quality]” is a variant of the hexproof ability. “Hexproof from black” means “This permanent can’t be the target of black spells your opponents control or abilities of black sources your opponents control.”'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If an effect says that a creature loses hexproof or can be targeted as though it didn’t have hexproof, this applies to hexproof from white as well.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Knight of Malice only gets +1/+0 if any player controls a white permanent, no matter how many white permanents players control.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': '“Hexproof from [quality]” is a variant of the hexproof ability. “Hexproof from white” means “This permanent can’t be the target of white spells your opponents control or abilities of white sources your opponents control.”'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If another creature is dealt lethal damage at the same time as Sparring Construct, Sparring Construct’s ability can’t put a +1/+1 counter on the other creature in time to save it.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If blocked by a creature with banding, the defending player decides whether or not the damage is assigned “as though it weren’t blocked”.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'When assigning combat damage, you choose whether you want to assign all damage to blocking creatures, or if you want to assign all of it to the player or planeswalker this creature is attacking. You can’t split the damage assignment between them.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can decide to assign damage to the defending player or planeswalker even if the blocking creature has protection from green or damage preventing effects on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If each creature the defending player controls can’t block for any reason (such as being tapped), then Gaea’s Protector isn’t blocked. If there’s a cost associated with blocking Gaea’s Protector, the defending player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to be blocked in that case either.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Only one creature is required to block Gaea’s Protector. Other creatures may also block it, and are free to block other creatures or not block at all.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The defending player, not you, chooses which creature blocks Gaea’s Protector.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If that player has one card in hand, it’s discarded at random (even though that’s not very random). You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the creature Corrosive Ooze blocks or is blocking leaves the battlefield, the Equipment that was attached to that creature immediately before it left the battlefield will be destroyed as Corrosive Ooze’s delayed triggered ability resolves at the end of combat.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The set of Equipment to be destroyed is determined only as Corrosive Ooze’s delayed triggered ability resolves at the end of combat. The Equipment will be destroyed even if Corrosive Ooze leaves the battlefield before that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the damage Goblin Chainwhirler would deal to a player is prevented, it still deals 1 damage to that player’s creatures and planeswalkers.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, the Goblin Chainwhirler’s last ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the target creature has an ability that triggers when it becomes tapped, that ability triggers before it loses all abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the target creature has power and toughness written as */* with an ability that defines its power and toughness, it’s 0/0 when it loses all abilities. If its power and toughness are written as */*+1, it’s 0/1, and so on.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting a spell or activating an ability, no player may take other actions until the spell or ability has been paid for. Notably, players can’t try to remove a permanent’s activated abilities to stop them from happening. Once activated, the ability on the stack will resolve even if the creature loses the ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Fungal Infection tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t create a Saproling token.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The target creature will be on the battlefield when you create the Saproling token, even if it’s about to die for having 0 toughness or lethal damage. Its abilities may affect the token’s creation or trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Abilities that trigger this way will resolve after the target creature has died.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Temporal Machinations tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Whether you control an artifact is checked only after returning the target creature to its owner’s hand. If the target creature is the only artifact you control, you won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the target nonland permanent is an illegal target by the time Blink of an Eye tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card if it was kicked.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the target player or target nonland permanent is an illegal target as Karn’s Temporal Sundering resolves, the other target is affected as normal and Karn’s Temporal Sundering is exiled. If both targets are illegal, Karn’s Temporal Sundering doesn’t resolve and isn’t exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Other than the casting restriction, the legendary supertype on a sorcery carries no additional rules. You may cast any number of legendary sorceries in a turn, and your deck may contain any number of legendary cards (but no more than four of any with the same name).'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can’t cast a legendary sorcery unless you control a legendary creature or a legendary planeswalker. Once you begin to cast a legendary sorcery, losing control of your legendary creatures and planeswalkers won’t affect that spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes while you’re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can’t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast the top card of your library, you can’t look at the next one until you’re done paying for that spell.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Precognition Field lets you look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction—see below), even if you don’t have priority. This action doesn’t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The card you’ll exile from the top of your library is determined as Precognition Field’s last ability resolves. This might not be the card that was on top of your library when you activated that ability.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The top card of your library isn’t in your hand, so you can’t cycle it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of the cards you play from your library.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You’ll still pay all costs for that spell, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs such as that granted by Jodah, Archmage Eternal.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If there’s no target for the triggered ability of Forebear’s Blade, or if the ability’s target becomes illegal, Forebear’s Blade remains on the battlefield unattached.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If you apply Jodah’s alternative cost to a spell with {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If you cast a spell for which mana may be spent as though it were mana of any color, you may cast it for Jodah’s alternative cost and still spend mana as though it were mana of any color.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Jodah’s ability is an alternative cost to cast a spell. You can’t combine this with other alternative costs, such as flashback. You can pay additional costs, such as kicker, in addition to this alternative cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If you control Baird, your opponents can choose not to pay to attack with a creature that attacks “if able.” If there’s no other player or planeswalker to attack, that creature simply doesn’t attack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, creatures can attack your teammate and planeswalkers your teammate controls without requiring a mana payment. This is a change from previous rules.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If you control two On Serra\\\'s Wings attached to two creatures you control with the same name, the "legend rule" applies to the enchanted creatures and to On Serra\\\'s Wings at once. You can choose to keep the On Serra\\\'s Wings that enchants the creature you wish to keep.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If you control two permanents with the same name but only one is legendary, the "legend rule" doesn\\\'t apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of flying, vigilance, and/or lifelink on the same creature are redundant.\'}]', "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If you run out of other permanents, cards in hand, and cards in graveyard, you’ll have to exile Lich’s Mastery itself and lose the game.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If you’re dealt more damage than you have cards to exile, you’ll just exile everything you can.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'While you can’t lose the game, your opponents can still win the game if an effect says so.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'While you control Lich’s Mastery, your life total still changes. Lich’s Mastery’s effects don’t replace the life gain or life loss.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You don’t have to exile all the cards from one place. For example, if a source deals 5 damage to you, you may exile one permanent, two cards from hand, and two cards from your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Jaya’s emblem doesn’t grant you permission to do anything with instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard except cast them. For example, you can’t cycle instant or sorcery cards with cycling from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Mana produced by Jaya’s first ability can be spent among any number of instant and/or sorcery spells.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You choose how many cards to discard while Jaya’s second ability is resolving. You can choose to discard zero cards this way (and then draw zero cards) if you wish.'}, {'date': '2018-06-08', 'text': 'Because it’s a loyalty ability, Jaya’s first ability isn’t a mana ability. It can be activated only any time you could cast a sorcery. It uses the stack and can be responded to.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Llanowar Scout’s effect doesn’t count as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if you’ve already played as many lands as able this turn or if it’s not your turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Marwyn’s activated ability is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Multani’s ability that modifies its power and toughness applies only while it’s on the battlefield. In all other zones, it’s a 0/0 creature card.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'To activate Multani’s last ability, you must return lands you control from the battlefield to their owner’s hand. Land cards in your graveyard can’t be returned this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Neither sacrificed creature can be the target of Whisper’s ability.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Whisper can be one of the creatures sacrificed to activate its ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked this creature, changing the power of the blocking creature won’t cause this creature to become unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting Wizard’s Lightning, no player may take other actions until the spell’s been paid for. Notably, players can’t try to raise the spell’s cost by removing your Wizards.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting Wizard’s Retort, no player may take other actions until the spell’s been paid for. Notably, players can’t try to raise the spell’s cost by removing your Wizards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Other than the casting restriction, the legendary supertype on a sorcery carries no additional rules. You may cast any number of legendary sorceries in a turn, and your deck may contain any number of legendary cards (but no more than four of any with the same name).\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast a legendary sorcery unless you control a legendary creature or a legendary planeswalker. Once you begin to cast a legendary sorcery, losing control of your legendary creatures and planeswalkers won\'t affect that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "You can\'t target the same target more than once to have Jaya\'s Immolating Inferno deal more damage to it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Other than the casting restriction, the legendary supertype on a sorcery carries no additional rules. You may cast any number of legendary sorceries in a turn, and your deck may contain any number of legendary cards (but no more than four of any with the same name).\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast a legendary sorcery unless you control a legendary creature or a legendary planeswalker. Once you begin to cast a legendary sorcery, losing control of your legendary creatures and planeswalkers won\'t affect that spell."}]', "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Powerstone Shard’s activated ability is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Radiating Lightning targets only the player. Creatures that player controls with hexproof will be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Rat Colony’s last ability lets you ignore only the “four-of” rule. It doesn’t let you ignore format legality.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Skizzik’s ability checks at each end step whether it was kicked while it was being cast. You don’t have to pay its kicker cost each turn (and can’t do so, even if you really want to kick it again).'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Sylvan Awakening affects only lands you control at the time it resolves. Lands you begin to control before your next turn won’t become creatures.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Sylvan Awakening doesn’t untap any of the lands that become creatures.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The lands affected by Sylvan Awakening stop being creatures as your next untap step begins, before you untap your permanents. If this causes any state-based actions to become applicable, or if any abilities trigger, those are handled during your upkeep.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Tempest Djinn’s ability that modifies its power applies only while it’s on the battlefield. In all other zones, it’s a 0/4 creature card.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The equipped creature, not Sorcerer’s Wand, is the source of the damage-dealing ability and of the damage dealt.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Whether the equipped creature is a Wizard is checked only as the ability resolves. If that creature has left the battlefield, use its last known information to determine if it was a Wizard.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The number of Wizards you control is counted only as Firefist Adept’s ability resolves. If Firefist Adept is still on the battlefield, it will count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The target Saga’s appropriate chapter ability triggers and resolves before blockers are declared.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Verix Bladewing features a new template for creating legendary tokens. It’s functionally identical to the text “create a legendary 4/4 red Dragon creature token with flying named Karox Bladewing.”'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Voltaic Servant’s ability can target an artifact creature, including itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can activate Drudge Sentinel’s ability even if it’s already tapped. It will still gain indestructible.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can cast Warlord’s Fury even if you control no creatures. You’ll still draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Thallid Soothsayer to pay the cost for its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can target and gain control of an untapped creature with Keldon Overseer’s ability. You can also untap a creature you already control and give it haste.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can’t cast Goblin Barrage unless you choose a creature as a target, even if it’s kicked. However, you can target a Goblin or artifact creature you control and then sacrifice it to pay the kicker cost. The target player or planeswalker will be dealt 4 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You choose the target for the triggered ability of Teferi’s emblem after you’ve seen the card you drew.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You don’t decide which two lands to untap until the next end step.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target by the time Invoke the Divine tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target as Invoke the Divine tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t gain 4 life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Which creature cards to return to your hand is determined as Garna\'s triggered ability resolves. If Garna somehow finds its way into your graveyard before that, perhaps due to the “legend rule,” it will be returned to your hand."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Befuddle tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you have fewer than three cards in your library, you put them all into your hand and none into your graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "A spell is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga enchantment subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\'t make a spell more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—a spell either is historic or it isn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The last ability of Jhoira\'s Familiar doesn\'t reduce its own cost while you\'re casting it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "A spell is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga enchantment subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\'t make a spell more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—a spell either is historic or it isn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist. Once the exiled permanent returns, it\'s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If the permanent that returns to the battlefield has any abilities that trigger at the beginning of the end step, those abilities won\'t trigger that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'The exiled card will return to the battlefield at the beginning of the end step even if Sentinel of the Pearl Trident is no longer on the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Once Relic Runner has been blocked, casting a historic spell won\'t remove the blocking creature from combat or cause Relic Runner to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "After Howling Golem\'s triggered ability resolves, players can cast spells and activate abilities before blockers are declared if it\'s attacking, or before damage is dealt if it\'s blocking."}]', "[{'date': '2020-11-10', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Champion of the Flame may become lethal if an Aura or Equipment attached to it leaves the battlefield or becomes attached to another creature during that turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'For example, you may cast an artifact creature spell as your artifact spell and cast another artifact creature spell as your creature spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a permanent card is put into your graveyard during your main phase and the stack is empty, you have a chance to cast it before any player may attempt to remove that card from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If multiple effects allow you to play a card from your graveyard, you must announce which permission you\'re using as you begin to play the card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you play a card from your graveyard and then have a new Muldrotha come under your control in the same turn, you may play another land or spell of that type from your graveyard that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once you begin to cast a spell, losing control of Muldrotha won\'t affect the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Use the type of the card as it\'s played or cast to determine which permanent type to count it as. For example, if you cast a creature spell from your graveyard, you can cast a card with bestow as an enchantment spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of the cards you play from your graveyard. For example, you can\'t use Muldrotha to play a land if you don\'t have an available land play or to cast a planeswalker spell during your end step."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You must pay the costs to cast a spell this way. If it has an alternative cost, you may cast it for that cost instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If either target is an illegal target as Ancient Animus tries to resolve, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the creature you control is an illegal target as Ancient Animus tries to resolve, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on it. If that creature is a legal target but the creature you don\'t control isn\'t, you\'ll still put the counter on the creature you control if it\'s legendary."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The creature you control doesn\'t have to be legendary. It simply won\'t receive a +1/+1 counter before it fights if it isn\'t legendary."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Ancient Animus unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control as targets."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If one or more Saprolings you control die at the same time as Slimefoot, Slimefoot’s first ability will still trigger once for each Saproling that died.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "If Juggernaut can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under your control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, you\'re not forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Once a player announces that they\'re casting a spell or activating an ability, no player may take other actions until the spell or ability has been paid for. Notably, other players can\'t try to tap that player\'s permanents to stop them from paying {T} or to stop them from producing enough mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You can sacrifice any Goblin you control to activate Siege-Gang Commander\'s activated ability, including Siege-Gang Commander itself."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to an Angel you control may become lethal if Lyra leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Damping Sphere’s second ability counts spells that were cast during a turn even if Damping Sphere wasn’t on the battlefield as they were cast. For example, if Damping Sphere itself is the third spell you cast in a turn, the next spell you cast costs {3} more to cast.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If multiple replacement effects would modify the mana an ability you control produces, choose one to apply. After that, determine if any others are applicable. A replacement effect can’t apply to the same event more than once.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Valduk leaves the battlefield after its ability has resolved, the tokens are still exiled at the beginning of the next end step.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Valduk leaves the battlefield after its ability has triggered but before it resolves, use the number of Auras and Equipment that were last attached to it before it left the battlefield to determine how many tokens to create.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Valduk counts all Auras and Equipment attached to it, not only Auras and Equipment you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You can sacrifice any Goblin you control to activate Skirk Prospector’s activated ability, including Skirk Prospector itself. Note that once you sacrifice Skirk Prospector, you won’t be able to activate its ability again, so if you’d like to sacrifice multiple Goblins including Skirk Prospector for mana, be sure to sacrifice Skirk Prospector last.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Fallenstellerin aus D\'Avenant", \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen historischen Zauberspruch wirkst, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. (Legenden, Artefakte und Sagen sind historisch.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': \'„Mit seinen Pfeilen demonstriert der Schütze die Philosophie der Perfektion." —Sprichwort aus D\\\'Avenant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443168&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e318b5f-eef5-46c3-acc9-27d18914b2ec\', \'multiverseId\': 443168}, \'multiverseid\': 443168}, {\'name\': "Trampera D\'Avenant", \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo histórico, gira la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. (Los artefactos, las Sagas y las cartas legendarias son cartas históricas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arquero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Flecha certera, parte ahora y presenta la filosofía de la quietud a quien te sienta". —Poema D\\\'Avenant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77f4a556-257a-4f81-a3f7-8de7f7aec826\', \'multiverseId\': 443437}, \'multiverseid\': 443437}, {\'name\': "Trappeuse d\'Avenant", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort historique, engagez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. (Les artefacts, les légendaires et les sagas sont historiques.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et archer\', \'flavor\': "« File, chère flèche, et enseigne la philosophie de l\'immobilité. » —Verset d\'Avenant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443706&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'592e421f-de76-4c95-bb79-cfd0eb3f7e2c\', \'multiverseId\': 443706}, \'multiverseid\': 443706}, {\'name\': "Trappolatrice D\'Avenant", \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia storica, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. (Artefatti, carte leggendarie e Saghe sono carte storiche.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arciere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Vola rapida, saetta sagace, E insegna la filosofia della quiete." —Verso D\\\'Avenant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f313b70-7bee-4a82-953f-dd989b53a3a0\', \'multiverseId\': 443975}, \'multiverseid\': 443975}, {\'name\': \'アヴナントの罠師\', \'text\': \'あなたが歴史的な呪文を唱えるたび、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。（歴史的とは、アーティファクトと伝説と英雄譚のことである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・射手\', \'flavor\': \'「疾く行け良き矢、教えよ我に 密やかさの心得を。」 ――アヴナントの詩句\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b150d59c-ad3c-418c-82f2-04ddc1270b25\', \'multiverseId\': 444244}, \'multiverseid\': 444244}, {\'name\': \'아브낭 사냥꾼\', \'text\': \'당신이 역사적 주문을 발동할 때마다, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다. (마법물체와 전설적, 서사시가 역사적이다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 궁수\', \'flavor\': \'"가라, 날쌔고 똑똑한 화살아. 고요함의 철학이 무엇인지 가르쳐 주어라." —아브낭의 노랫말\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c01fc9b-660d-4667-af20-63663fa69256\', \'multiverseId\': 444513}, \'multiverseid\': 444513}, {\'name\': "Armadilheira D\'Avenant", \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica histórica, vire a criatura alvo que um oponente controla. (Os artefatos, os cards lendários e as Sagas são cards históricos.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Arqueiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Vá rápido, sagaz flecha, e ensine A filosofia da imobilidade." — Verso D\\\'Avenant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2e1ab01-73a9-403e-b8c3-ea16603e8895\', \'multiverseId\': 444782}, \'multiverseid\': 444782}, {\'name\': "Ловчая Д\'Авенанта", \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете историческое заклинание, поверните целевое существо под контролем оппонента. (Артефакты, легендарные карты и Саги являются историческими.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Лучник\', \'flavor\': "«Лети, премудрая стрела, и научи Философии неподвижности». — стих д\'Авенанта", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eba5137b-403b-40bf-9ba4-ca77f24db9b0\', \'multiverseId\': 445051}, \'multiverseid\': 445051}, {\'name\': \'阿维农布陷人\', \'text\': \'每当你施放史迹咒语时，横置目标由对手操控的生物。（神器、传奇和传纪是史迹。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'「灵箭妙矢，疾行如风， 传授凝定之识。」 ～阿维农诗歌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7bb9e2b-a815-481a-b61d-01fa9c125ee6\', \'multiverseId\': 445320}, \'multiverseid\': 445320}, {\'name\': \'阿維農佈陷人\', \'text\': \'每當你施放史跡咒語時，橫置目標由對手操控的生物。（神器、傳奇和傳紀是史跡。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'「靈箭妙矢，疾行如風， 傳授凝定之識。」 ～阿維農詩歌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e607a3df-310a-4806-aac1-9d6cfbde54e1\', \'multiverseId\': 445589}, \'multiverseid\': 445589}]', '[{\'name\': "In Bolas\' Fängen", \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine bleibende Karte\\nDu kontrollierst die verzauberte bleibende Karte.\\nDie verzauberte bleibende Karte ist legendär.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Vertrag ist nichtig. Du gehörst nun mir. Füge dich oder stirb." —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443211&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58a3087a-e9ce-4e64-aef3-39b556227bcf\', \'multiverseId\': 443211}, \'multiverseid\': 443211}, {\'name\': \'En las garras de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Encantar permanente.\\nTú controlas el permanente encantado.\\nEl permanente encantado es legendario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento legendario — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Incumpliste tu contrato; ahora me perteneces. Sírveme o muere". —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'245aa01b-8827-4d4b-b511-da5e6055af3b\', \'multiverseId\': 443480}, \'multiverseid\': 443480}, {\'name\': \'Entre les griffes de Bolas\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : permanent\\nVous contrôlez le permanent enchanté.\\nLe permanent enchanté est légendaire.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement légendaire : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Ton contrat est en défaut. Tu es à moi désormais. Obéis, ou meurs. » —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443749&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8729f4c-5155-4d08-bf51-06c260f90f89\', \'multiverseId\': 443749}, \'multiverseid\': 443749}, {\'name\': \'Nelle Grinfie di Bolas\', \'text\': \'Incanta permanente\\nControlli il permanente incantato.\\nIl permanente incantato è leggendario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo Leggendario — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Il contratto è stato violato. Ora appartieni a me: puoi servirmi, o morire." —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f05533d-9996-457f-b25f-836e85b4e02d\', \'multiverseId\': 444018}, \'multiverseid\': 444018}, {\'name\': \'ボーラスの手中\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（パーマネント）\\nあなたはエンチャントされているパーマネントをコントロールする。\\nエンチャントされているパーマネントは伝説である。\', \'type\': \'伝説のエンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「おぬしは契約を履行しなかった。おぬしは我のものだ。我に仕えるか、さもなくば死ぬがよい。」 ――ニコル・ボーラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b09942b2-162f-4adb-af60-2c28271de026\', \'multiverseId\': 444287}, \'multiverseid\': 444287}, {\'name\': \'볼라스의 손아귀 안\', \'text\': \'지속물에 부여\\n당신이 부여된 지속물을 조종한다.\\n부여된 지속물은 전설적이다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"너의 계약은 확정되었다. 이제 너는 나의 것이다. 섬기거나, 아니면 죽거라." —니콜 볼라스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6149f5f9-5f52-4e6c-970c-11df994a032e\', \'multiverseId\': 444556}, \'multiverseid\': 444556}, {\'name\': \'Nas Garras de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Encantar permanente\\nVocê controla a permanente encantada.\\nA permanente encantada é lendária.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento Lendário — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Seu contrato não foi cumprido. Agora você me pertence. Sirva ou morra." — Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60e39253-7a9d-48d0-b293-a0f022b0cb45\', \'multiverseId\': 444825}, \'multiverseid\': 444825}, {\'name\': \'В Когтях Боласа\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать перманент\\nВы контролируете зачарованный перманент.\\nЗачарованный перманент является легендарным.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты нарушила условия контракта. Теперь ты принадлежишь мне. Служи — или умрешь». — Никол Болас\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5754497a-002a-4567-b728-ad8b7b68c88c\', \'multiverseId\': 445094}, \'multiverseid\': 445094}, {\'name\': \'受制波拉斯\', \'text\': \'结附于永久物\\n你操控所结附的永久物。\\n所结附的永久物是传奇。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「你违反了契约。今后你属于我。为我效命，否则便受死。」 ～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc532c91-a5b5-49e5-9fef-1944227dad6a\', \'multiverseId\': 445363}, \'multiverseid\': 445363}, {\'name\': \'受制波拉斯\', \'text\': \'結附於永久物\\n你操控所結附的永久物。\\n所結附的永久物是傳奇。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「你違反了契約。今後你屬於我。為我效命，否則便受死。」 ～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d36ef5-2385-4ecd-a8cc-d878bbf89895\', \'multiverseId\': 445632}, \'multiverseid\': 445632}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abenteuerlust\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Jede Odyssee beginnt mit einem einzigen Schritt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443310&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'371d7ad9-5d7d-47b1-89ce-3337a971d7cd\', \'multiverseId\': 443310}, \'multiverseid\': 443310}, {\'name\': \'Impulso aventurero\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de criatura o de tierra que se encuentre entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Toda odisea comienza con un solo paso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1616bbc-fcbc-4acb-8f33-901e88811e1e\', \'multiverseId\': 443579}, \'multiverseid\': 443579}, {\'name\': \'Impulsion audacieuse\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte de créature ou de terrain parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Chaque odyssée commence par un simple pas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443848&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f47e2f39-0739-466e-8820-87cb7ac05671\', \'multiverseId\': 443848}, \'multiverseid\': 443848}, {\'name\': \'Impulso Avventuroso\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta creatura o terra scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni odissea ha inizio con un singolo passo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1db79bca-51db-4e25-af12-e557ed934f7c\', \'multiverseId\': 444117}, \'multiverseid\': 444117}, {\'name\': \'冒険の衝動\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見る。あなたはその中からクリーチャーか土地であるカード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'どの大冒険にも最初の一歩がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e34ee5c-5d1d-41aa-9d6e-bf10ad4c9369\', \'multiverseId\': 444386}, \'multiverseid\': 444386}, {\'name\': \'대담한 충동\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 생물 또는 대지 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 당신이 원하는 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'모든 여정은 한 걸음에서 시작된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ae59a16-f443-4d75-be7c-497df60ce062\', \'multiverseId\': 444655}, \'multiverseid\': 444655}, {\'name\': \'Impulso Aventureiro\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de criatura ou terreno dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Toda odisseia começa com um único passo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84be19ba-8778-490f-b59f-2bfc1c9dda4b\', \'multiverseId\': 444924}, \'multiverseid\': 444924}, {\'name\': \'Зов Приключений\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту существа или земли и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Самое длинное странствие начинается с одного шага.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddf42beb-942a-4854-a510-a4426c8a218a\', \'multiverseId\': 445193}, \'multiverseid\': 445193}, {\'name\': \'冒险冲动\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。你可以展示其中的一张生物或地牌，并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'奥德赛般的万里远征，也始于足下迈出的第一步。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e719a3e0-3783-49ba-8ef1-b54c5c984f4c\', \'multiverseId\': 445462}, \'multiverseid\': 445462}, {\'name\': \'冒險衝動\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。你可以展示其中的一張生物或地牌，並將它置於你手上。將其餘的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'奧德賽般的萬里遠征，也始於足下邁出的第一步。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f23fd0e8-c3b9-4a74-8936-7482f9a955d6\', \'multiverseId\': 445731}, \'multiverseid\': 445731}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abrechnen\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Lege zwei Loyalitätsmarken auf einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Du hast mich an einen Vertrag gebunden, der nur durch deinen Tod aufgelöst werden kann — und du hieltst mich für töricht?" —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443260&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62312a60-f31c-4a50-817e-014b65cc0476\', \'multiverseId\': 443260}, \'multiverseid\': 443260}, {\'name\': \'Ajuste de cuentas\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo. Pon dos contadores de lealtad sobre un planeswalker que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Me ofreciste un contrato que solo se extinguiría en caso de que murieras. ¿Y crees que yo soy la tonta?". —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b9913e2-3766-473f-9c41-e79610807715\', \'multiverseId\': 443529}, \'multiverseid\': 443529}, {\'name\': \'Règlement de comptes\', \'text\': \'Exilez la créature ciblée. Mettez deux marqueurs « loyauté » sur un planeswalker que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« J\'étais liée à toi par un contrat auquel seule ta mort pouvait mettre fin. Tu me prenais vraiment pour une idiote ? » —Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443798&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ab9ad92-95f1-4680-8e8b-6019f64a9e77\', \'multiverseId\': 443798}, \'multiverseid\': 443798}, {\'name\': \'Regolare i Conti\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Metti due segnalini fedeltà su un planeswalker che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi hai vincolato con un contratto che può terminare solo con la tua morte... e pensavi che fossi io la sprovveduta?" —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2f18875-e473-4564-b52b-6e0f30e111ba\', \'multiverseId\': 444067}, \'multiverseid\': 444067}, {\'name\': \'意趣返し\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。あなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカー１体の上に忠誠カウンターを２個置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「お前は私と、死によってしか解消できない契約を結んだじゃないの。私が間抜けだと思っていたのかしら？」 ――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5de406b7-bbae-48ff-8023-8e0a8a009e8b\', \'multiverseId\': 444336}, \'multiverseid\': 444336}, {\'name\': \'원한 해결\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다. 당신이 조종하는 플레인즈워커 한 개에 충성 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"너는 네가 죽어야만 끝나는 계약으로 나를 구속했지—내가 바보로 보이느냐?" —릴리아나 베스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9800f942-2103-4c53-b26a-4bacea28ca2c\', \'multiverseId\': 444605}, \'multiverseid\': 444605}, {\'name\': \'Ajustar as Contas\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo. Coloque dois marcadores de lealdade em um planeswalker que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Você me prendeu a um contrato que só a sua morte pode revogar... e achou que eu é que estava sendo tola?" — Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a5a8afd-fb1a-4457-978f-01d75a701e59\', \'multiverseId\': 444874}, \'multiverseid\': 444874}, {\'name\': \'Сведение Счетов\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевое существо. Положите два жетона верности на planeswalker-а под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты связал меня контрактом, разорвать который может лишь твоя смерть... и ты считаешь глупой меня?» — Лилиана Весс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da738f1c-a1cd-4942-9143-f67bd9fef4dc\', \'multiverseId\': 445143}, \'multiverseid\': 445143}, {\'name\': \'最终了断\', \'text\': \'放逐目标生物。在一个由你操控的鹏洛客上放置两个忠诚指示物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你跟我订了一份唯有你死才能终结的契约～而你还觉得是我傻？」 ～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8bfb972-6f72-45de-9bbf-6fc926d34c92\', \'multiverseId\': 445412}, \'multiverseid\': 445412}, {\'name\': \'最終了斷\', \'text\': \'放逐目標生物。在一個由你操控的鵬洛客上放置兩個忠誠指示物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「你跟我訂了一份唯有你死才能終結的契約～而你還覺得是我傻？」 ～莉蓮娜維斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9e95d70-5cc2-4e4b-9930-39414f42d898\', \'multiverseId\': 445681}, \'multiverseid\': 445681}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adeliz Glutwind\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nImmer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erhalten Zauberer, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Die leidenschaftliche Intensität der ungestümen Ghitu, gemäßigt durch den kühlen Verstand der tolarianischen Schulung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443347&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd8fef44-3b43-4d57-93b7-0d0f86713829\', \'multiverseId\': 443347}, \'multiverseid\': 443347}, {\'name\': \'Adeliz, Viento de Ceniza\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, los Hechiceros que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Mezcla la apasionada intensidad de los ghitu con el análisis racional de la enseñanza tolariana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0c23616-9437-4759-b008-1a896fdb2bdd\', \'multiverseId\': 443616}, \'multiverseid\': 443616}, {\'name\': \'Adeliz, le vent de cendres\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, les sorciers que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "L\'intense passion des Guitûks tempérée par la froide perspicacité de l\'entraînement tolarian.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443885&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1fa2299-95b7-46e3-8a8f-5d2a24d72a32\', \'multiverseId\': 443885}, \'multiverseid\': 443885}, {\'name\': \'Adeliz, il Vento di Brace\', \'text\': \'Volare, rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, i Maghi che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'La focosa intensità dei Ghitu, temperata dalla fredda sapienza degli addestramenti di Tolaria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec3b0db5-e255-4ce9-a6a5-fc06cea215f1\', \'multiverseId\': 444154}, \'multiverseid\': 444154}, {\'name\': \'燃えがらの風、エイデリズ\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\nあなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているウィザードは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'ギトゥの情熱的な激しさが、トレイリアで身に着けた冷静な洞察力によって緩和されている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24bf3d6b-51d6-4b92-a93a-f9253990fd28\', \'multiverseId\': 444423}, \'multiverseid\': 444423}, {\'name\': \'잿가루 바람, 아델리즈\', \'text\': \'비행, 신속\\n당신이 순간마법이나 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 마법사들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'기투의 열정적인 격렬함이 톨라리아 훈련의 냉철한 통찰로 누그러진다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'563236d7-c837-41c1-b157-00851e61b708\', \'multiverseId\': 444692}, \'multiverseid\': 444692}, {\'name\': \'Adeliz, o Vento Cinzento\', \'text\': \'Voar, ímpeto\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, os Magos que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'A intensidade impetuosa dos Ghitu temperada pela frieza do treinamento tolariano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5f02c37-fb02-46c8-853d-6d8a95f0c925\', \'multiverseId\': 444961}, \'multiverseid\': 444961}, {\'name\': \'Аделис, Пепельный Ветер\', \'text\': \'Полет, Ускорение\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, Чародеи под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Страстная горячность Гиту, сдержанная холодной расчетливостью толарианской школы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'738e7b18-33c3-4180-8097-54fbaeca3c9a\', \'multiverseId\': 445230}, \'multiverseid\': 445230}, {\'name\': \'烬火之风艾德莉兹\', \'text\': \'飞行，敏捷\\n每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，由你操控的法术师得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'基图人与生俱来的火热激情，调以陶拉里亚训练带来的冷静预知。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'954f3aa6-4686-4807-bde1-66d7f93c515c\', \'multiverseId\': 445499}, \'multiverseid\': 445499}, {\'name\': \'燼火之風艾德莉茲\', \'text\': \'飛行，敏捷\\n每當你施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，由你操控的魔法師得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'基圖人與生俱來的火熱激情，調以陶拉里亞訓練帶來的冷靜預知。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3c31d5c-d361-4882-978d-495e0111727d\', \'multiverseId\': 445768}, \'multiverseid\': 445768}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aesthirgleiter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDer Aesthirgleiter kann nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vogel, Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Eine uralte Apparatur, die hoch oben in den karplusanischen Bergen aus einem tauenden Gletscher geborgen wurde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443366&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0514e96c-8f2f-4047-a79a-4179dc5ef099\', \'multiverseId\': 443366}, \'multiverseid\': 443366}, {\'name\': \'Planeador aesthir\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEl Planeador aesthir no puede bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo ave\', \'flavor\': \'Un antiguo dispositivo recuperado de un glaciar menguante en lo alto de las montañas karplusanas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91782ae5-a511-4558-a345-33c450c61efd\', \'multiverseId\': 443635}, \'multiverseid\': 443635}, {\'name\': "Planeur d\'aeszir", \'text\': "Vol\\nLe Planeur d\'aeszir ne peut pas bloquer.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : oiseau et construction\', \'flavor\': "Un ancien dispositif récupéré après la fonte d\'un glacier, dans les hautes montagnes karpluséanes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ed045f2-3b2c-428e-884e-4971cf0bd2f9\', \'multiverseId\': 443904}, \'multiverseid\': 443904}, {\'name\': \'Aliante Aesthir\', \'text\': "Volare\\nL\'Aliante Aesthir non può bloccare.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Un antico congegno recuperato da un ghiacciaio in disgelo tra le vette delle montagne di Karplusan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97536684-af7f-4cd9-aef1-0d7eeea027aa\', \'multiverseId\': 444173}, \'multiverseid\': 444173}, {\'name\': \'エイスサーの滑空機\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nエイスサーの滑空機ではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 鳥・構築物\', \'flavor\': \'カープルーザン山脈の頂で解け始めた氷河から回収された古代の機器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51ffbe22-24b7-464e-8217-aa85162b5f50\', \'multiverseId\': 444442}, \'multiverseid\': 444442}, {\'name\': \'애스시르 활강자\', \'text\': \'비행\\n애스시르 활강자는 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 조류 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'카플루산 산맥 높은 곳의 빙하가 녹으면서, 그 안에 있던 고대의 장치가 발견되었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d912624-d536-4193-a367-1a613994f994\', \'multiverseId\': 444711}, \'multiverseid\': 444711}, {\'name\': \'Planador de Aesthir\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nPlanador de Aesthir não pode bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Ave Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Um dispositivo antigo, recuperado em uma geleira em retração no alto das montanhas karplusanas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'127a2263-69c6-4913-a7fc-c4e6bb02f2a2\', \'multiverseId\': 444980}, \'multiverseid\': 444980}, {\'name\': \'Парящий Эстир\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nПарящий Эстир не может блокировать.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Птица Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'Древнее устройство, которое достали из растаявшего ледника высоко в Карплюсанских горах.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1506f16-ef06-4fd8-8465-fbdc726a3dfa\', \'multiverseId\': 445249}, \'multiverseid\': 445249}, {\'name\': \'艾斯鹰滑翔翼\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n艾斯鹰滑翔翼不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～鸟／组构体\', \'flavor\': \'从卡普路桑山脉顶峰融化冰川中取回的远古装置。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c2ae422-92c8-4998-aa91-c51ec8f850ed\', \'multiverseId\': 445518}, \'multiverseid\': 445518}, {\'name\': \'艾斯鷹滑翔翼\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n艾斯鷹滑翔翼不能進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～鳥／組構體\', \'flavor\': \'從卡普路桑山脈頂峰融化冰川中取回的遠古裝置。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b68e18df-cb64-4449-ac2b-677cb3337a8f\', \'multiverseId\': 445787}, \'multiverseid\': 445787}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akademie-Sceada\', \'text\': \'Bonus {4} (Du kannst zusätzlich {4} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nFliegend\\nFalls die Bonuskosten des Akademie-Sceadas bezahlt wurden, kommt er mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443197&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c0351b7-54f6-4f18-9d0a-e6a9fee3bdb4\', \'multiverseId\': 443197}, \'multiverseid\': 443197}, {\'name\': \'Draco de la Academia\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {4}. (Puedes pagar {4} adicionales al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nVuela.\\nSi el Draco de la Academia fue estimulado, entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'472f2b5e-65d1-400b-a20f-5e8a27802d72\', \'multiverseId\': 443466}, \'multiverseid\': 443466}, {\'name\': "Drakôn de l\'Académie", \'text\': "Kick {4} (Vous pouvez payer {4} supplémentaires au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nVol\\nSi le Drakôn de l\'Académie a été kické, il arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.", \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443735&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13f53394-1b6f-4c60-afa3-7b78623ab444\', \'multiverseId\': 443735}, \'multiverseid\': 443735}, {\'name\': "Draghetto dell\'Accademia", \'text\': "Potenziamento {4} (Puoi pagare {4} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nVolare\\nSe il Draghetto dell\'Accademia è stato potenziato, entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30b77fbc-72e7-4e1f-9322-9ee249a79cfa\', \'multiverseId\': 444004}, \'multiverseid\': 444004}, {\'name\': \'アカデミーのドレイク\', \'text\': \'キッカー{4}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{4}を支払ってもよい。）\\n飛行\\nアカデミーのドレイクがキッカーされていたなら、これは＋１/＋１カウンターが２個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67b318d1-c9f5-4a24-a6ef-04f7b898ba5d\', \'multiverseId\': 444273}, \'multiverseid\': 444273}, {\'name\': \'아카데미 드레이크\', \'text\': \'키커 {4} (당신은 이 주문을 발동하면서 추가로 {4}를 지불할 수 있다.)\\n비행\\n아카데미 드레이크의 키커 비용이 지불되었다면, 아카데미 드레이크는 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드레이크\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'268d4404-0919-42ea-894b-b293ec162201\', \'multiverseId\': 444542}, \'multiverseid\': 444542}, {\'name\': \'Dragonete da Academia\', \'text\': \'Reforçar {4} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {4} ao conjurar esta mágica.)\\nVoar\\nSe Dragonete da Academia foi reforçado, ele entra no campo de batalha com dois marcadores +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragonete\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06c71eb8-2aff-41c1-9b5a-695099e7855e\', \'multiverseId\': 444811}, \'multiverseid\': 444811}, {\'name\': \'Дрейк Академии\', \'text\': \'Усилитель {4} (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете дополнительно заплатить {4}.)\\nПолет\\nЕсли Дрейк Академии получил Усилитель, он выходит на поле битвы с двумя жетонами +1/+1 на нем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дрейк\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2515942d-54b1-4f04-825c-9005774c3c0c\', \'multiverseId\': 445080}, \'multiverseid\': 445080}, {\'name\': \'学院龙兽\', \'text\': \'增幅{4}（你施放此咒语时可以额外支付{4}。）\\n飞行\\n如果学院龙兽已增幅，则它进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d17fbe3-ba9e-4b1e-aad9-8b2426a66371\', \'multiverseId\': 445349}, \'multiverseid\': 445349}, {\'name\': \'學院龍獸\', \'text\': \'增幅{4}（你施放此咒語時可以額外支付{4}）。\\n飛行\\n如果學院龍獸已增幅，則它進戰場時上面有兩個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3add6e35-7c31-42b8-b2d8-191b4ee94395\', \'multiverseId\': 445618}, \'multiverseid\': 445618}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amaranthin-Mauer\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\n{2}: Die Amaranthin-Mauer erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Schaden und Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören sie nicht.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Mauer\', \'flavor\': \'Über die Jahre hat sich weder ihr Erscheinungsbild noch ihre Temperatur verändert. Sie ist ein ewiges Mahnmal für die Kräfte, die Dominaria einst formten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443367&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62201410-db40-4df1-93a2-fe39b19f7cf1\', \'multiverseId\': 443367}, \'multiverseid\': 443367}, {\'name\': \'Muro amarantino\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\n{2}: El Muro amarantino gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. (El daño y los efectos que dicen "destruir" no lo destruyen.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'Ni su aspecto ni su temperatura varían con el paso de los años. Es un testimonio eterno de las fuerzas que forjaron Dominaria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dabde1d6-3bc3-4b42-843f-75ede45f87b7\', \'multiverseId\': 443636}, \'multiverseid\': 443636}, {\'name\': "Mur d\'amarante", \'text\': "Défenseur\\n{2} : Le Mur d\'amarante acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Les blessures et les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne le détruisent pas.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : mur\', \'flavor\': \'Ni son apparence, ni sa température ne varie au fil des ans, témoignage éternel des forces qui forgèrent Dominaria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443905&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e0c9ad-e43d-4f46-944f-701f97c174c8\', \'multiverseId\': 443905}, \'multiverseid\': 443905}, {\'name\': \'Muro Immutabile\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\n{2}: Il Muro Immutabile ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. (Il danno e gli effetti che dicono "distruggi" non lo distruggono.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'Testamento eterno delle forze che hanno plasmato Dominaria, non cambia aspetto né temperatura nel corso degli anni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c04fb65-7121-4420-8615-41fc835b6416\', \'multiverseId\': 444174}, \'multiverseid\': 444174}, {\'name\': \'悠久の壁\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n{2}：ターン終了時まで、悠久の壁は破壊不能を得る。（ダメージや「破壊」と書かれた効果では、それは破壊されない。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 壁\', \'flavor\': \'どれだけの歳月が経とうとも、その姿も温度も変わらない。ドミナリアを形作った勢力の永遠の印。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13248e16-5feb-4dee-bbf4-25e65809359f\', \'multiverseId\': 444443}, \'multiverseid\': 444443}, {\'name\': \'시들지 않는 벽\', \'text\': \'수비태세\\n{2}: 시들지 않는 벽은 턴종료까지 무적을 얻는다. (피해와 "파괴"라고 명시된 효과로 파괴되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 벽\', \'flavor\': \'수 년이 지나도 그 모습이나 온도는 바뀌지 않았으며, 도미나리아를 만든 힘의 영원한 증거로서 남아 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8247d457-f824-4452-9e5b-5e4c3f36f579\', \'multiverseId\': 444712}, \'multiverseid\': 444712}, {\'name\': \'Muralha Amarantina\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\n{2}: Muralha Amarantina ganha indestrutível até o final do turno. (O dano e os efeitos que dizem "destrua" não a destroem.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Barreira\', \'flavor\': \'Nem a aparência, nem a temperatura variam com o passar dos anos, um testemunho eterno das forças que moldaram Dominária.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7261d7af-eeba-479f-81f2-1c2626c8e263\', \'multiverseId\': 444981}, \'multiverseid\': 444981}, {\'name\': \'Вековечная Стена\', \'text\': \'Защитник\\n{2}: Вековечная Стена получает Неразрушимость до конца хода. (Повреждения и эффекты с указанием «уничтожьте» не уничтожают ее.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Стена\', \'flavor\': \'Проходят годы, но ее внешний облик и температура остаются неизменными — вечное напоминание о тех силах, что когда-то сотворили Доминарию.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'265387fa-7e37-46aa-9544-10b5113a4b55\', \'multiverseId\': 445250}, \'multiverseid\': 445250}, {\'name\': \'不朽之壁\', \'text\': \'守军\\n{2}：不朽之壁获得不灭异能直到回合结束。（伤害与注明「消灭」的效应不会将它消灭。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～墙\', \'flavor\': \'这堵墙是多明纳里亚经历诸多势力作用所成现状的永恒证明，经年以来其外观和温度都未曾变化。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a05c8c59-b1c0-4154-a5f8-775839fe2dd8\', \'multiverseId\': 445519}, \'multiverseid\': 445519}, {\'name\': \'不朽之壁\', \'text\': \'守軍\\n{2}：不朽之壁獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。（傷害與註明「消滅」的效應不會將它消滅。)\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～牆\', \'flavor\': \'這堵牆是多明納里亞經歷諸多勢力作用所成現狀的永恆證明，經年以來其外觀和溫度都未曾變化。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c0b6291-ec92-43a2-9062-c43a1c0c8046\', \'multiverseId\': 445788}, \'multiverseid\': 445788}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amok laufen\', \'text\': \'Eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+3 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Keld begegnete der Apokalypse, um eine düstere Prophezeiung zu erfüllen. Nun glauben die Keldonen an nichts mehr, außer an sich selbst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443297&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37839206-a03a-4d9e-8bbe-feac10242831\', \'multiverseId\': 443297}, \'multiverseid\': 443297}, {\'name\': \'Carga frenética\', \'text\': \'La criatura atacante objetivo obtiene +3/+3 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Keld se vio abocada al apocalipsis para cumplir una profecía funesta. Ahora los keldon no tienen nada en lo que creer salvo en sí mismos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'800d4095-f55c-4a90-803b-590292c46216\', \'multiverseId\': 443566}, \'multiverseid\': 443566}, {\'name\': \'Folie furieuse\', \'text\': "La créature attaquante ciblée gagne +3/+3 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Keld subit une apocalypse pour accomplir une sombre prophétie. Aujourd\'hui, les Keldes ne peuvent plus avoir foi qu\'en eux-mêmes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443835&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'671ad8b8-400c-4c0a-8fc7-aa7f65d01619\', \'multiverseId\': 443835}, \'multiverseid\': 443835}, {\'name\': \'Perdere il Controllo\', \'text\': \'Una creatura attaccante bersaglio prende +3/+3 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Keld affrontò un\'apocalisse per il compimento di una profezia funesta. Ora i suoi abitanti non hanno altro in cui credere che se stessi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a1382b9-e6c3-4d3d-b914-027b0c06e292\', \'multiverseId\': 444104}, \'multiverseid\': 444104}, {\'name\': \'猛り狂い\', \'text\': \'攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋３の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ケルドに終末が訪れた。恐ろしい予言が成就したのだ。今やケルド人には、自分たち自身以外には頼れるものがない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce04e067-0d58-432c-9e33-b3bf2d8331ab\', \'multiverseId\': 444373}, \'multiverseid\': 444373}, {\'name\': \'미친 듯이 날뛰기\', \'text\': \'공격 중인 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +3/+3을 받고 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'켈드는 끔찍한 예언 속의 종말을 맞이했다. 이제 켈드족에게 믿을 것이라고는 그들 스스로밖에 남지 않게 되었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb0de9fc-3cb9-48e4-b885-9e12bd615cfe\', \'multiverseId\': 444642}, \'multiverseid\': 444642}, {\'name\': \'Enlouquecer de Fúria\', \'text\': \'A criatura atacante alvo recebe +3/+3 e ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Keld enfrentou um apocalipse para cumprir uma profecia terrível. Agora, os keldonianos não têm mais nada em que acreditar, a não ser em si mesmos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ab2de8d-c972-48bb-8f07-434821d3eb24\', \'multiverseId\': 444911}, \'multiverseid\': 444911}, {\'name\': \'Сломя Голову\', \'text\': \'Целевое атакующее существо получает +3/+3 и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Во исполнение мрачного пророчества Келд постигла катастрофа. Теперь келдонцам не во что верить, кроме самих себя.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ab5711e-5902-4cff-a65f-894fd0203e9f\', \'multiverseId\': 445180}, \'multiverseid\': 445180}, {\'name\': \'横冲直撞\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标进行攻击的生物得+3/+3且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'凯尔顿人曾面临启示录预言尽皆实现的可怕境遇。如今他们已无所依托，只相信自己。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1b97e32-ede3-4651-ba2b-ffbe1f6c3e73\', \'multiverseId\': 445449}, \'multiverseid\': 445449}, {\'name\': \'橫衝直撞\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標進行攻擊的生物得+3/+3且獲得踐踏異能。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'凱爾頓人曾面臨啟示錄預言盡皆實現的可怕境遇。如今，他們已無所依託，只相信自己。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2083b3d1-2f22-4255-9656-7f5defd78746\', \'multiverseId\': 445718}, \'multiverseid\': 445718}]', '[{\'name\': \'An Bord der Wetterlicht\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine historische Karte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. (Legenden, Artefakte und Sagen sind historisch.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Eine neue Zusammenkunft für ein neues Zeitalter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443165&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00f24596-6134-445f-bd7b-b734a7efa5d8\', \'multiverseId\': 443165}, \'multiverseid\': 443165}, {\'name\': \'Embarcar en el Vientoligero\', \'text\': \'Mira las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta histórica que se encuentre entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. (Los artefactos, las Sagas y las cartas legendarias son cartas históricas.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Un nuevo encuentro para una nueva era.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d2d73e9-40be-4e9c-8a5d-7864e4a81b0d\', \'multiverseId\': 443434}, \'multiverseid\': 443434}, {\'name\': "À bord de l\'Aquilon", \'text\': \'Regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte historique parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. (Les artefacts, les légendaires et les sagas sont historiques.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Une nouvelle assemblée pour une nouvelle ère.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443703&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd509ed8-6ba1-4be5-8ee2-29aac72fba8e\', \'multiverseId\': 443703}, \'multiverseid\': 443703}, {\'name\': \'Imbarcarsi sulla Cavalcavento\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta storica scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale. (Artefatti, carte leggendarie e Saghe sono carte storiche.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Una nuova adunanza per una nuova era.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0ca8380-8c6a-4862-b774-a6532a52ca9f\', \'multiverseId\': 443972}, \'multiverseid\': 443972}, {\'name\': \'ウェザーライトへの乗艦\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚見る。あなたはその中から歴史的なカード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。（歴史的とは、アーティファクトと伝説と英雄譚のことである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'新時代の新しい顔ぶれ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e256a102-e6b4-4b49-91e3-dd40f12293c7\', \'multiverseId\': 444241}, \'multiverseid\': 444241}, {\'name\': \'웨더라이트 탑승\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 다섯 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 역사적 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 무작위 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다. (마법물체와 전설적, 서사시가 역사적이다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'새로운 시대를 위한 새로운 화합.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7486bd2f-03de-4635-9928-86f2cc8fcf57\', \'multiverseId\': 444510}, \'multiverseid\': 444510}, {\'name\': \'Embarcar no Bons Ventos\', \'text\': \'Olhe os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card histórico dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória. (Os artefatos, os cards lendários e as Sagas são cards históricos.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Um novo grupo, reunido para uma nova era.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9061b8e-5f8d-4ad6-b913-9df3485273bc\', \'multiverseId\': 444779}, \'multiverseid\': 444779}, {\'name\': \'Посадка на «Везерлайт»\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них историческую карту и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке. (Артефакты, легендарные карты и Саги являются историческими.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Новое собрание для новой эпохи.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fea9da8-6f04-419c-b96a-45f8e70136b1\', \'multiverseId\': 445048}, \'multiverseid\': 445048}, {\'name\': \'重登晴空号\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以展示其中的一张史迹牌，并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。（神器、传奇和传纪是史迹。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'为崭新时代重新集结。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'080566bb-a318-4c24-94f1-70d4acb6940b\', \'multiverseId\': 445317}, \'multiverseid\': 445317}, {\'name\': \'重登晴空號\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的五張牌。你可以展示其中的一張史跡牌，並將它置於你手上。將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。（神器、傳奇和傳紀是史跡。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'為嶄新時代重新集結。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98df0b8e-b4c5-45f5-a9f6-e9c6d1505a61\', \'multiverseId\': 445586}, \'multiverseid\': 445586}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anstürmen\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Ehre führt uns in die Schlacht. Wir müssen ihr nur folgen." —Danitha Capashen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443167&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10271adf-5921-41ee-b005-0636adb4c254\', \'multiverseId\': 443167}, \'multiverseid\': 443167}, {\'name\': \'Cargar\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El honor cabalga por delante de nosotros. Todo lo que debemos hacer es alcanzarlo". —Danitha Capashen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d785e569-2e15-4c6f-902d-fbd694763cda\', \'multiverseId\': 443436}, \'multiverseid\': 443436}, {\'name\': \'Charge\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« L\'honneur chevauche devant nous. Nous n\'avons qu\'à le rattraper. » —Danitha Capashen", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443705&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5c3c9d0-b5ea-48d4-8f86-36056461bff3\', \'multiverseId\': 443705}, \'multiverseid\': 443705}, {\'name\': \'Carica\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'Onore cavalca dinanzi a noi. Non dobbiamo che raggiungerlo." —Danitha Capashen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'851caffd-8b86-49ed-956b-0cea68496552\', \'multiverseId\': 443974}, \'multiverseid\': 443974}, {\'name\': \'突撃\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「栄光は我らのすぐ前を走っている。あとは、それに追いつくのみだ。」 ――ダニサ・キャパシェン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c601545a-5b95-4d4c-bd18-4bcf9b78327d\', \'multiverseId\': 444243}, \'multiverseid\': 444243}, {\'name\': \'돌격\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"명예는 우리보다 앞서 달리고 있다. 우리는 단지 그것을 따라잡으면 되는 거다." —다니사 카파셴\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fd32460-117f-4729-9557-10d53d870e31\', \'multiverseId\': 444512}, \'multiverseid\': 444512}, {\'name\': \'Atacar\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A honra cavalga à nossa frente. Só precisamos alcançá-la." — Danitha Capashena\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e92657f-adde-441d-86cc-e4ab6ae18276\', \'multiverseId\': 444781}, \'multiverseid\': 444781}, {\'name\': \'Натиск\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Честь несется вперед перед нами. Мы должны лишь догнать ее». — Данита Капашен\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1455c28-39b3-4a2e-ae95-6253532a4ffe\', \'multiverseId\': 445050}, \'multiverseid\': 445050}, {\'name\': \'冲锋\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「荣耀冲锋在前。我们只需快步赶上。」 ～达妮莎卡帕轩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2cc220d-40d1-4b43-bfa0-2054b42fa6c6\', \'multiverseId\': 445319}, \'multiverseid\': 445319}, {\'name\': \'衝鋒\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「榮耀衝鋒在前。我們只需快步趕上。」 ～達妮莎卡帕軒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b05ee1a3-a33f-4c02-9f3d-f8b82928b1b4\', \'multiverseId\': 445588}, \'multiverseid\': 445588}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkaner Flug\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Die Akademien von Tolaria sind bekannt für ihre Magieforschung, ihre mächtigen Hexer und die gelegentliche Zerstörung von Ökosystemen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443200&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75933a95-6769-4d4c-baa4-89e32922fc88\', \'multiverseId\': 443200}, \'multiverseid\': 443200}, {\'name\': \'Vuelo arcano\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Las Academias Tolarianas son conocidas por su investigación mágica, sus hechiceros poderosos y su destrucción accidental de ecosistemas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60c2c1aa-d118-4a25-a415-5ee180089eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 443469}, \'multiverseid\': 443469}, {\'name\': \'Vol ésotérique\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a le vol.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Les Académies tolarianes sont renommées pour leurs recherches magiques, leurs puissants sorciers et la destruction accidentelle d\'écosystèmes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443738&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bb0290b-c96c-441b-8050-7a6785401613\', \'multiverseId\': 443738}, \'multiverseid\': 443738}, {\'name\': \'Volo Arcano\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Le Accademie di Tolaria sono note per le ricerche in campo magico, i potenti stregoni e la distruzione accidentale di interi ecosistemi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'439be95c-ffb8-4b48-a4e1-1a3781de0aac\', \'multiverseId\': 444007}, \'multiverseid\': 444007}, {\'name\': \'秘儀での飛行\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'トレイリアのアカデミーは、魔法の研究と強力な呪術師、そして環境破壊事故でその名を知られている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7ce201c-49f6-45d9-8cda-eb01a8ce2e05\', \'multiverseId\': 444276}, \'multiverseid\': 444276}, {\'name\': \'신비한 비행\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +1/+1을 받고 비행을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'톨라리아 아카데미는 마법 연구와 강력한 마법사들, 그리고 실수로 생태계를 파괴한 일로 잘 알려져 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88c45a4e-fc94-4ce3-bad9-7a82444acda0\', \'multiverseId\': 444545}, \'multiverseid\': 444545}, {\'name\': \'Voo Arcano\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e tem voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'As Academias Tolarianas são conhecidas por suas pesquisas mágicas, por seus feiticeiros poderosos e por sua destruição acidental de ecossistemas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'612d409c-f557-4af5-956b-e383fa9b2868\', \'multiverseId\': 444814}, \'multiverseid\': 444814}, {\'name\': \'Волшебный Полет\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1 и имеет Полет.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Толарианские Академии славятся своими прорывами в исследованиях магии, могущественными чародеями и случайным уничтожением целых экосистем.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adb9e619-c629-4285-984d-f5f7b7c957f1\', \'multiverseId\': 445083}, \'multiverseid\': 445083}, {\'name\': \'翔空秘法\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1且具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'陶拉里亚大学院以魔法研究、强大巫师和会意外破坏生态系统声名远播。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f454e2a-60aa-4a7c-866c-9c7e4976772b\', \'multiverseId\': 445352}, \'multiverseid\': 445352}, {\'name\': \'翔空秘法\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+1/+1且具有飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'陶拉里亞大學院以魔法研究、強大巫師和會意外破壞生態環境聲名遠播。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c76315fb-0232-43ec-8646-4172c3bb8fd2\', \'multiverseId\': 445621}, \'multiverseid\': 445621}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arvad der Verfluchte\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung, Lebensverknüpfung\\nAndere legendäre Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde die Wetterlicht nicht einfach im Stich lassen. Es ist mein Schicksal, an Jhoiras Seite zu dienen. Meine ‚Krankheit\\\' bedeutet lediglich, dass ich weniger auf mich und mehr auf meinen Glauben bauen muss."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443348&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0bc3864-723b-4da1-ae59-b2ad4fc2f966\', \'multiverseId\': 443348}, \'multiverseid\': 443348}, {\'name\': \'Arvad el Maldito\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal, vínculo vital.\\nLas otras criaturas legendarias que controlas obtienen +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"No abandonaré el Vientoligero. Mi destino es servir junto a Jhoira. Esta \\\'enfermedad\\\' solo significa que debo confiar más en mi fe y menos en mí mismo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed6a4b34-ec5f-4b89-9a99-552366802bff\', \'multiverseId\': 443617}, \'multiverseid\': 443617}, {\'name\': \'Arvad le maudit\', \'text\': \'Contact mortel, lien de vie\\nLes autres créatures légendaires que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : vampire et chevalier\', \'flavor\': \'« Je n\\\'abandonnerai pas l\\\'Aquilon. Mon destin est de servir aux côtés de Djoïra. Cette "maladie" signifie que je dois croire davantage en ma foi et moins en moi-même. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443886&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6039d462-5390-4b36-956e-afaf2933bc01\', \'multiverseId\': 443886}, \'multiverseid\': 443886}, {\'name\': \'Arvad il Maledetto\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale, legame vitale\\nLe altre creature leggendarie che controlli prendono +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Non abbandonerò la Cavalcavento. Il mio destino è servire al fianco di Jhoira. Questa \\\'infezione\\\' significa che devo credere di più nella mia fede e meno in me stesso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5503134a-dd77-4329-9ab1-d988db4d257a\', \'multiverseId\': 444155}, \'multiverseid\': 444155}, {\'name\': \'呪われし者、アルヴァード\', \'text\': \'接死、絆魂\\nあなたがコントロールしている他の伝説のクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「私は決してウェザーライトを見捨てない。ジョイラの傍で仕えるのが私の宿命なのだ。この『病気』は、自分自身よりも自分の信念を頼るべきだということに他ならない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cb25ba5-443b-4b6b-bd89-ca1f84de9bbd\', \'multiverseId\': 444424}, \'multiverseid\': 444424}, {\'name\': \'저주받은 아르바드\', \'text\': \'치명타, 생명연결\\n당신이 조종하는 다른 전설적 생물들은 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 흡혈귀 기사\', \'flavor\': \'"나는 웨더라이트를 버리지 않을 것이다. 조이라의 곁을 지키며 섬기는 것이 나의 운명이다. 이 \\\'병\\\'은 내가 나의 신념을 더욱 믿고 나 스스로에 대한 믿음은 덜어야 한다는 뜻이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aa0a455-51df-47ed-beea-d399d66c8c6f\', \'multiverseId\': 444693}, \'multiverseid\': 444693}, {\'name\': \'Arvad, o Amaldiçoado\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero, vínculo com a vida\\nAs outras criaturas lendárias que você controla recebem +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Vampiro Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Não abandonarei o Bons Ventos. Meu destino é servir ao lado de Jhoira. Essa \\\'doença\\\' significa que eu preciso confiar mais na minha fé e menos em mim mesmo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'321788f8-1ca9-4322-b152-e2bd3055f4f9\', \'multiverseId\': 444962}, \'multiverseid\': 444962}, {\'name\': \'Арвад Проклятый\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание, Цепь жизни\\nДругие легендарные существа под вашим контролем получают +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Вампир Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не брошу «Везерлайт». Моя судьба — служить Джойре. Эта «болезнь» означает, что я должен больше доверять своей вере и меньше — самому себе».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45270103-8ab4-4320-bc67-9858608989fc\', \'multiverseId\': 445231}, \'multiverseid\': 445231}, {\'name\': \'受诅咒的亚瓦德\', \'text\': \'死触，系命\\n由你操控的其他传奇生物得+2/+2。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～吸血鬼／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「我决不会抛弃晴空号。担任尤依拉副手便是我的天命。这种『病』意味着我必须常循自身信念，少从自身行动。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb8e9903-e53c-4c4d-aa14-6cb345840098\', \'multiverseId\': 445500}, \'multiverseid\': 445500}, {\'name\': \'受詛咒的亞瓦德\', \'text\': \'死觸，繫命\\n由你操控的其他傳奇生物得+2/+2。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～吸血鬼／騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「我決不會拋棄晴空號。擔任尤依菈副手便是我的天命。這種『病』意味著我必須常循自身信念，少從自身行動。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6957f35d-72b5-4e17-8554-a40df75da410\', \'multiverseId\': 445769}, \'multiverseid\': 445769}]', "[{'name': 'Aryel, Ritterin von Windgrace', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Ritter-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit.\\n{B}, {T}, tappe X ungetappte Ritter, die du kontrollierst: Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke X oder weniger.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443349&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99994fa5-5a19-4249-8170-f6aa2b54bcbc', 'multiverseId': 443349}, 'multiverseid': 443349}, {'name': 'Aryel, caballero de Windgrace', 'text': 'Vigilancia.\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Caballero blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia.\\n{B}, {T}, girar X Caballeros enderezados que controlas: Destruye la criatura objetivo con fuerza de X o menos.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Caballero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443618&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edf522f3-8c35-41c1-afea-0d0ad9449bee', 'multiverseId': 443618}, 'multiverseid': 443618}, {'name': 'Aryel, chevalière Vent des vertus', 'text': 'Vigilance\\n{2}{W}, {T} : Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chevalier avec la vigilance.\\n{B}, {T}, engagez X chevaliers dégagés que vous contrôlez : Détruisez une créature ciblée de force inférieure ou égale à X.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et chevalier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443887&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed584d84-a72c-4846-9cef-25833c5eca61', 'multiverseId': 443887}, 'multiverseid': 443887}, {'name': 'Aryel, Cavaliera di Windgrace', 'text': 'Cautela\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Crea una pedina creatura Cavaliere 2/2 bianca con cautela.\\n{B}, {T}, TAPpa X Cavalieri STAPpati che controlli: Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a X.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444156&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86d5b946-f16d-4289-b9c8-88e2048e7705', 'multiverseId': 444156}, 'multiverseid': 444156}, {'name': 'ウィンドグレイスの騎士、アルイェール', 'text': '警戒\\n{2}{W}, {T}：警戒を持つ白の２/２の騎士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{B}, {T}, あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態の騎士Ｘ体をタップする：パワーがＸ以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444425&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '831156ee-aafa-4af0-a18e-ea3523e25c68', 'multiverseId': 444425}, 'multiverseid': 444425}, {'name': '윈드그레이스의 기사, 아리엘', 'text': '경계\\n{2}{W}, {T}: 경계를 가진 2/2 백색 기사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n{B}, {T}, 당신이 조종하는 언탭된 기사 X개를 탭한다: 공격력이 X 이하인 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.', 'type': '전설적 생물 — 인간 기사', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444694&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7714e78c-7602-42fc-959b-7bc51584ff8b', 'multiverseId': 444694}, 'multiverseid': 444694}, {'name': 'Aryel, Cavaleira de Windgrace', 'text': 'Vigilância\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Crie uma ficha de criatura branca 2/2 do tipo Cavaleiro com vigilância.\\n{B}, {T}, vire X Cavaleiros desvirados que você controla: Destrua a criatura alvo com poder igual ou inferior a X.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Humano Cavaleiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444963&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82232f3f-290b-4864-8219-0579be128193', 'multiverseId': 444963}, 'multiverseid': 444963}, {'name': 'Арьель, Рыцарь Виндгрейса', 'text': 'Бдительность\\n{2}{W}, {T}: создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 белый Рыцарь с Бдительностью.\\n{B}, {T}, поверните X неповернутых Рыцарей под вашим контролем: уничтожьте целевое существо с силой не более X.', 'type': 'Легендарное Существо — Человек Рыцарь', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445232&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ffd45d1-6db2-459e-aeab-c253703054c1', 'multiverseId': 445232}, 'multiverseid': 445232}, {'name': '风华骑士娅耶尔', 'text': '警戒\\n{2}{W}，{T}：派出一个2/2白色，具警戒异能的骑士衍生生物。\\n{B}，{T}，横置X个由你操控且未横置的骑士：消灭目标力量等于或小于X的生物。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／骑士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445501&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66c4a6d9-2a51-49a3-ba56-219a02610a04', 'multiverseId': 445501}, 'multiverseid': 445501}, {'name': '風華騎士婭耶爾', 'text': '警戒\\n{2}{W}，{T}：派出一個2/2白色，具警戒異能的騎士衍生生物。\\n{B}，{T}，橫置X個由你操控且未橫置的騎士：消滅目標力量等於或小於X的生物。', 'type': '傳奇生物 ～人類／騎士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445770&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ba0652c-ead7-4808-83cd-e9f7de157a92', 'multiverseId': 445770}, 'multiverseid': 445770}]", '[{\'name\': \'Assistent des Handwerkers\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du einen historischen Zauberspruch wirkst, wende Hellsicht 1 an. (Legenden, Artefakte und Sagen sind historisch. Betrachte für Hellsicht 1 die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek, dann kannst du sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443201&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d1778e3-b4ce-421b-89b6-4dd2748d27a6\', \'multiverseId\': 443201}, \'multiverseid\': 443201}, {\'name\': \'Ayudante del artífice\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo histórico, adivina 1. (Los artefactos, las Sagas y las cartas legendarias son cartas históricas. Para adivinar 1, mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca, luego puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84dedd22-9d7e-423b-8c2c-f6a03e380c74\', \'multiverseId\': 443470}, \'multiverseid\': 443470}, {\'name\': "Assistant de l\'artificier", \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort historique, regard 1. (Les artefacts, les légendaires et les sagas sont historiques. Pour appliquer regard 1, regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443739&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bac2e732-9d0c-4bbe-a9ff-4974fd17ad7a\', \'multiverseId\': 443739}, \'multiverseid\': 443739}, {\'name\': "Assistente dell\'Artefice", \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia storica, profetizza 1. (Artefatti, carte leggendarie e Saghe sono carte storiche. Per profetizzare 1, guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio, poi puoi metterla in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c0d4a96-155c-41b6-9bed-6cba970f037a\', \'multiverseId\': 444008}, \'multiverseid\': 444008}, {\'name\': \'工匠の助手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが歴史的な呪文を唱えるたび、占術１を行う。（アーティファクトと伝説と英雄譚が歴史的である。占術１を行うとは、「あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。その後あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。」ということである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8f132db-a694-43b5-868d-ebe632aa4dd1\', \'multiverseId\': 444277}, \'multiverseid\': 444277}, {\'name\': \'마법공학자의 조수\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신이 역사적 주문을 발동할 때마다, 점술 1을 한다. (마법물체와 전설적, 서사시가 역사적이다. 점술 1을 하려면 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e7c190-1792-46b3-9b9f-ca444eb4ffb8\', \'multiverseId\': 444546}, \'multiverseid\': 444546}, {\'name\': \'Assistente de Artesão\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica histórica, use vidência 1. (Os artefatos, os cards lendários e as Sagas são cards históricos. Para usar vidência 1, olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Depois, você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a5bb774-ebc9-4fd0-bba9-fb1078e8c46f\', \'multiverseId\': 444815}, \'multiverseid\': 444815}, {\'name\': \'Помощник Механика\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете историческое заклинание, предскажите 1. (Артефакты, легендарные карты и Саги являются историческими. Чтобы предсказать 1, посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки, затем вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b1c6e8e-b1bd-47af-aa8f-34cb1a2fce37\', \'multiverseId\': 445084}, \'multiverseid\': 445084}, {\'name\': \'神器师助手\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你施放史迹咒语时，占卜1。（神器、传奇和传纪是史迹。占卜1的流程是检视你牌库顶的牌，然后你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe8214ea-b014-4341-8d95-52fb35592fda\', \'multiverseId\': 445353}, \'multiverseid\': 445353}, {\'name\': \'神器師助手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當你施放史跡咒語時，占卜1。（神器、傳奇和傳紀是史跡。占卜1的流程是檢視你的牌庫頂牌，然後你可以將該牌置入你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30638351-2898-4b57-b85b-a40059d596c3\', \'multiverseId\': 445622}, \'multiverseid\': 445622}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf Serras Schwingen\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur ist legendär, erhält +1/+1 und hat Flugfähigkeit, Wachsamkeit und Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Serras Geist trug Brindri hoch in die Lüfte und wies sie an, das Gleichgewicht zu halten." —Das Lied von Allem, Gesang 524\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443185&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26aeeed0-9210-4cc2-9ef3-099304d3cbed\', \'multiverseId\': 443185}, \'multiverseid\': 443185}, {\'name\': \'Con las alas de Serra\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada es legendaria, obtiene +1/+1 y tiene las habilidades de volar, vigilancia y vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento legendario — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"El espíritu de Serra elevó a Brindi y le ordenó mantener el equilibrio". —Canción de Todos, canto 524\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a99008c-0bd9-4d4a-94e7-092c9d8a87ed\', \'multiverseId\': 443454}, \'multiverseid\': 443454}, {\'name\': \'Sur les ailes de Serra\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée est légendaire, gagne +1/+1 et a le vol, la vigilance et le lien de vie.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement légendaire : aura\', \'flavor\': "« L\'esprit de Serra souleva Brindri haut dans les airs et lui ordonna de garder l\'équilibre. » —Geste du Grand Tout, chant 524", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443723&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ee66fdb-a4e5-4cc0-a809-cf6a12c430a8\', \'multiverseId\': 443723}, \'multiverseid\': 443723}, {\'name\': \'Sulle Ali di Serra\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata è leggendaria, prende +1/+1 e ha volare, cautela e legame vitale.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo Leggendario — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo spirito di Serra sollevò Brindri in alto e le ordinò di mantenere l\\\'equilibrio." —Canzone di Tutti, canto 524\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edbd9d90-e03b-4f2a-b55d-8364ab10c1f4\', \'multiverseId\': 443992}, \'multiverseid\': 443992}, {\'name\': \'セラからの翼\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは伝説であり、＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに飛行と警戒と絆魂を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のエンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「セラの精霊はブリンドリを高みに引き上げ、均衡の維持を命じた。」 ――「万物の歌」、詩編五二四\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03136c98-c024-496b-ab82-cb3ab37d4da9\', \'multiverseId\': 444261}, \'multiverseid\': 444261}, {\'name\': \'세라의 날개 위\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 전설적이고, +1/+1을 받으며, 비행, 경계, 생명연결을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"세라의 영혼은 브린드리를 드높이고, 그녀에게 균형을 수호하라 명하네." —모두의 노래, 524절\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6deeb0a2-2f67-4d40-b924-4dd211605d3e\', \'multiverseId\': 444530}, \'multiverseid\': 444530}, {\'name\': \'Nas Asas de Serra\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada é lendária, recebe +1/+1 e tem voar, vigilância e vínculo com a vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento Lendário — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"O espírito de Serra alçou Brindri às alturas e lhe ordenou que mantivesse o equilíbrio." — Canção de Todos, canto 524\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c382d8e-3fc2-48de-a933-e54d07bb7207\', \'multiverseId\': 444799}, \'multiverseid\': 444799}, {\'name\': \'На Крыльях Серры\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо является легендарным, получает +1/+1 и имеет Полет, Бдительность и Цепь жизни.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Дух Серры вознес Бриндри высоко в небо и велел ей хранить равновесие». — «Песнь Сущего», стих 524\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'229e2c32-2015-49ac-93c9-ff073e8212c9\', \'multiverseId\': 445068}, \'multiverseid\': 445068}, {\'name\': \'承撒拉之翼\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物是传奇，得+1/+1，且具有飞行、警戒与系命异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「撒拉精神激励布蓝德蕾斗志，令她维持均衡。」 ～《万物之歌》，524节\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a5fdbd3-c911-4d6b-a46a-eb9721e700bd\', \'multiverseId\': 445337}, \'multiverseid\': 445337}, {\'name\': \'承撒拉之翼\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物是傳奇，得+1/+1，且具有飛行、警戒與繫命異能。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「撒拉精神激勵布藍德蕾鬥志，令她維持均衡。」 ～《萬物之歌》，524節\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f141d969-dd90-4a00-8859-9d9f8b6aee9c\', \'multiverseId\': 445606}, \'multiverseid\': 445606}]', "[{'name': 'Aus Asche erwachsen', 'text': 'Bonus {2} (Du kannst zusätzlich {2} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek. Falls die Bonuskosten dieses Zauberspruchs bezahlt wurden, durchsuche stattdessen deine Bibliothek nach zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443321&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8fba894-3484-4075-a5b0-af9a025cb01d', 'multiverseId': 443321}, 'multiverseid': 443321}, {'name': 'Brotar de las cenizas', 'text': 'Estímulo {2}. (Puedes pagar {2} adicionales al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nBusca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca. Si este hechizo fue estimulado, en vez de eso, busca en tu biblioteca dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443590&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0dc2b28e-286a-450a-a062-e93e93f9f60c', 'multiverseId': 443590}, 'multiverseid': 443590}, {'name': 'Naître des cendres', 'text': 'Kick {2} (Vous pouvez payer {2} supplémentaires au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque. Si ce sort a été kické, à la place cherchez dans votre bibliothèque deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille et mélangez votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443859&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7391e6fe-fd86-4a31-ada7-03e1bc19d3ee', 'multiverseId': 443859}, 'multiverseid': 443859}, {'name': 'Crescere dalle Ceneri', 'text': 'Potenziamento {2} (Puoi pagare {2} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio. Se questa magia è stata potenziata, passa invece in rassegna il tuo grimorio per due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444128&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '973aaca6-1527-4881-a0c8-6e09f1c18427', 'multiverseId': 444128}, 'multiverseid': 444128}, {'name': '灰からの成長', 'text': 'キッカー{2}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{2}を支払ってもよい。）\\nあなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探して戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。この呪文がキッカーされていたなら、代わりに、あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード２枚を探して戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444397&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17669ad4-6573-4b36-b105-2d36239de05f', 'multiverseId': 444397}, 'multiverseid': 444397}, {'name': '재에서 태어나는 생명', 'text': '키커 {2} (당신은 이 주문을 발동하면서 추가로 {2}를 지불할 수 있다.)\\n당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아 전장에 놓은 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다. 이 주문의 키커 비용이 지불되었다면, 대신 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 두 장을 찾아 전장에 놓은 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444666&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bfc4ae2b-f550-4a59-b70a-83a4d92b2334', 'multiverseId': 444666}, 'multiverseid': 444666}, {'name': 'Brotar das Cinzas', 'text': 'Reforçar {2} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {2} ao conjurar esta mágica.)\\nProcure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, coloque-o no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe seu grimório. Se esta mágica tiver sido reforçada, procure, em vez disso, dois cards de terreno básico, coloque-os no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe seu grimório.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444935&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22d76805-20fe-4b32-8bcb-12508cc82e5e', 'multiverseId': 444935}, 'multiverseid': 444935}, {'name': 'Рост из Праха', 'text': 'Усилитель {2} (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете дополнительно заплатить {2}.)\\nНайдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ее на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку. Если это заклинание получило Усилитель, вместо этого найдите в вашей библиотеке две карты базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445204&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95d402b9-a46e-4c06-a2ca-9c6026e33822', 'multiverseId': 445204}, 'multiverseid': 445204}, {'name': '死灰新生', 'text': '增幅{2}（你施放此咒语时可以额外支付{2}。）\\n从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。如果此咒语已增幅，则改为从你的牌库中搜寻两张基本地牌，将它们放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445473&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '658deccb-6b61-4120-9031-f451fe983b17', 'multiverseId': 445473}, 'multiverseid': 445473}, {'name': '死灰新生', 'text': '增幅{2}（你施放此咒語時可以額外支付{2}。）\\n從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將之放進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。如果此咒語已增幅，則改為從你的牌庫中搜尋兩張基本地牌，將它們放進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445742&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '989c9d71-6b51-4e02-b703-7d2fefd26d2f', 'multiverseId': 445742}, 'multiverseid': 445742}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ausfleischen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Fürchte dich ruhig vor der Dunkelheit, aber glaube auch nicht, dass du bei Tageslicht sicher bist." —Josu Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443248&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'894b9af1-aca3-41af-b158-7c7b498a6af9\', \'multiverseId\': 443248}, \'multiverseid\': 443248}, {\'name\': \'Eviscerar\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Teme a la oscuridad, si quieres, pero no confundas la luz del sol con la seguridad". —Josu Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8760df5-61fa-4de4-828c-4950ee1a5268\', \'multiverseId\': 443517}, \'multiverseid\': 443517}, {\'name\': \'Étriper\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Craignez les ténèbres si vous voulez, mais ne confondez pas lumière du soleil et sécurité. » —Josu Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443786&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e80856d-c969-45b0-a0b3-08ffcdd6c8cb\', \'multiverseId\': 443786}, \'multiverseid\': 443786}, {\'name\': \'Eviscerare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Temi l\\\'oscurità, se devi, ma non credere di essere al sicuro alla luce del sole." —Josu Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fb4c2df-d0c4-45d5-adc4-37a9a898f375\', \'multiverseId\': 444055}, \'multiverseid\': 444055}, {\'name\': \'臓腑抜き\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「暗闇を恐れるのはいいが、陽光を安全と勘違いしない方がいい。」 ――ジョス・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c33766a7-aa31-4852-99d4-22987254f377\', \'multiverseId\': 444324}, \'multiverseid\': 444324}, {\'name\': \'내장 제거\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"꼭 그래야 한다면 어둠을 두려워하라. 그러나 태양의 빛을 안전하다고 착각해서는 안 된다." —조수 베스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb16ef6e-2baa-4624-abe7-a746bca480fc\', \'multiverseId\': 444593}, \'multiverseid\': 444593}, {\'name\': \'Eviscerar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Tema a escuridão se quiser, mas não confunda a luz do sol com segurança." — Josu Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95b1553c-6f9f-41af-b4f0-34c9d61117a0\', \'multiverseId\': 444862}, \'multiverseid\': 444862}, {\'name\': \'Выпотрошить\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Бойся темноты, если хочешь, но не ошибись, принимая солнечный свет за безопасность». — Джозу Весс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9002ac73-1298-4af6-91fe-678d267b4adb\', \'multiverseId\': 445131}, \'multiverseid\': 445131}, {\'name\': \'摘胆剜心\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「恐惧黑暗没有问题，但别以为站在阳光下就安全了。」 ～霍苏维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41dac0e7-0da5-4ba5-b82e-4648a1f07ade\', \'multiverseId\': 445400}, \'multiverseid\': 445400}, {\'name\': \'摘膽剜心\', \'text\': \'消滅目標生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「你可以畏懼黑暗，這並不代表光天化日之下必定安全。」 ～霍蘇維斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28d822b0-36a2-448b-a845-c98186e8261f\', \'multiverseId\': 445669}, \'multiverseid\': 445669}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Wachposten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Schar verließ ein entferntes Land, das durch Katastrophen und Krieg verheert wurde. Benalia gab uns Obdach und beendete so unseren ziellosen Exodus."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443160&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1611ca7-32b2-4477-9319-7bc9764a1657\', \'multiverseId\': 443160}, \'multiverseid\': 443160}, {\'name\': \'Centinela aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi bandada emigró de un continente arrasado por la guerra y los cataclismos. Benalia nos acogió y aquí terminamos nuestro éxodo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'534c1f71-690b-4279-ab4e-53ef285deff6\', \'multiverseId\': 443429}, \'multiverseid\': 443429}, {\'name\': \'Sentinelle avemain\', \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Ma volée a fui un continent lointain dévasté par les cataclysmes et la guerre. Bénalia nous a offert un refuge où terminer notre exode. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443698&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd7f6697-3fa7-4b76-9a77-1110be46e0b9\', \'multiverseId\': 443698}, \'multiverseid\': 443698}, {\'name\': \'Aviano Sentinella\', \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mio stormo è fuggito da un continente lontano, flagellato da guerra e cataclismi. Benalia ci ha offerto un rifugio in cui porre fine al nostro esodo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe493376-3db0-4754-aed4-de30d0edc80c\', \'multiverseId\': 443967}, \'multiverseid\': 443967}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの歩哨\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「私の群れは大変動と戦争で廃墟となった遠い大陸から飛んできました。ベナリアは私たちに避難所を与え、放浪生活を終わらせてくれました。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72e1ac75-7b38-4ec4-a5da-083fa2d48ef4\', \'multiverseId\': 444236}, \'multiverseid\': 444236}, {\'name\': \'에이븐 감시병\', \'text\': \'비행\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"우리들은 대재앙과 전쟁으로 파괴된 머나먼 땅에서 날아왔다. 베날리아는 우리에게 머물 수 있는 피신처를 제공해 주었지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'044ccfa3-9d8d-4473-929d-33da2d71c07b\', \'multiverseId\': 444505}, \'multiverseid\': 444505}, {\'name\': \'Sentinela Aviana\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Meu bando veio voando de um continente distante, arruinado por cataclismos e guerras. Benália nos deu abrigo e encerrou nosso êxodo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e804a4aa-72bf-40f5-aa5a-1ea8dce1b4d2\', \'multiverseId\': 444774}, \'multiverseid\': 444774}, {\'name\': \'Авен-Страж\', \'text\': \'Полет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Моя стая прилетела с далекого континента, истерзанного катастрофами и войной. В Беналии мы нашли приют, и наш исход закончился».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8fc1a20-b3a3-46af-bbe9-1df9a40bcb3c\', \'multiverseId\': 445043}, \'multiverseid\': 445043}, {\'name\': \'艾文哨兵\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「吾族原本所栖息的大陆已遭灾害战事摧毁，因而一路流离至此。宾纳里亚予吾人落脚之所，出逃之记终告段落。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6111c078-2d86-40c5-9a65-e007ee7dd06e\', \'multiverseId\': 445312}, \'multiverseid\': 445312}, {\'name\': \'艾文哨兵\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鳥／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「吾族原本所棲息的大陸已遭災害戰事摧毀，因而一路流離至此。賓納里亞予吾人落腳之所，出逃之記終告段落。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9babbc71-7878-465c-b29d-f9d335d11514\', \'multiverseId\': 445581}, \'multiverseid\': 445581}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baird, Vogt von Argivia\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nKreaturen können weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {1} für jede dieser Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Mauern von Argivia wurden von einer friedlichen und vereinten Dynastie errichtet, die uns fünfzehn Jahrhunderte lang vor Krieg beschützt hat. Ihre Botschaft ist unmissverständlich."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443161&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce79de60-44fa-4a71-ab3e-9ca091f3405a\', \'multiverseId\': 443161}, \'multiverseid\': 443161}, {\'name\': \'Baird, custodio de Argivia\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nLas criaturas no pueden atacarte a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas a menos que su controlador pague {1} por cada una de esas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Los muros de Argivia los construyó una pacífica unión dinástica que nos protegió de la guerra durante quince siglos. La lección está clara".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ec6bcb4-7bff-4ce8-9597-1032eb3c5b04\', \'multiverseId\': 443430}, \'multiverseid\': 443430}, {\'name\': "Baird, intendant d\'Argive", \'text\': \'Vigilance\\nLes créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer ou attaquer un planeswalker que vous contrôlez à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {1} pour chacune de ces créatures.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« L\'enceinte d\'Argive a été construite par une union dynastique pacifique qui nous préserve de la guerre depuis quinze siècles. La leçon est claire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443699&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7419836-a6e7-48b0-8bef-640b8fbe5ba8\', \'multiverseId\': 443699}, \'multiverseid\': 443699}, {\'name\': \'Baird, Reggente di Argivia\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nLe creature non possono attaccare te o un planeswalker che controlli a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {1} per ognuna di quelle creature.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Le mura di Argivia furono costruite da un\\\'unione dinastica pacifica che ci ha protetto dalla guerra per quindici secoli. Abbiamo imparato la lezione."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9063101d-45a8-4d25-b7c4-8898b6f9e30c\', \'multiverseId\': 443968}, \'multiverseid\': 443968}, {\'name\': \'アルガイヴ国家執事、ベイルド\', \'text\': \'警戒\\nあなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃するクリーチャー１体につきそのコントローラーが{1}を支払わないかぎり、その攻撃はできない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「アルガイヴの壁は平和的な国家同盟によって建設され、その後15世紀もの間戦争を防ぎ続けている。この教訓は明白だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa9c8e75-72b0-4f05-b843-40f578093740\', \'multiverseId\': 444237}, \'multiverseid\': 444237}, {\'name\': \'아르기브의 관리자, 베이어드\', \'text\': \'경계\\n각 생물은 그 생물의 조종자가 {1}을 지불하지 않는 한 당신 또는 당신이 조종하는 플레인즈워커를 공격할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"아르기브의 벽은 150년 동안이나 우리를 전쟁으로부터 보호해 준, 평화로운 왕조 연합이 세운 것입니다. 그로부터 얻을 수 있는 교훈은 너무도 분명하지요."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b474cbc-9514-4ec6-b1af-364fea84c2bc\', \'multiverseId\': 444506}, \'multiverseid\': 444506}, {\'name\': \'Baird, Guardião do Argivo\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nAs criaturas não podem atacar você nem um planeswalker que você controla, a menos que seu controlador pague {1} para cada uma daquelas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"As muralhas do Argivo foram construídas por uma união dinástica pacífica que nos resguardou da guerra por quinze séculos. A lição é clara."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b589e23-28f6-4f42-a1e6-1ed4b2ae57ee\', \'multiverseId\': 444775}, \'multiverseid\': 444775}, {\'name\': \'Бэйрд, Управитель Аргива\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nСущества не могут атаковать вас или planeswalker-а под вашим контролем, если только контролирующий их игрок не заплатит {1} за каждое из тех существ.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Стены Аргива возвел миролюбивый династический союз, уже пятнадцать веков обороняющий нас от войны. Вот к чему надо стремиться».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17b868bb-0864-47b7-8d88-6ca1306b7881\', \'multiverseId\': 445044}, \'multiverseid\': 445044}, {\'name\': \'阿基夫监管人贝尔德\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n对每个生物而言，除非其操控者为其支付{1}，否则它不能攻击你或由你操控的鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「爱好和平的统治联盟为了免受战事侵扰而修建了阿基夫高墙，让子孙尽享十五世纪太平岁月。结论不言自明。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b853ad0-8fea-467b-ba53-a80531a8ffb9\', \'multiverseId\': 445313}, \'multiverseid\': 445313}, {\'name\': \'阿基夫監管人貝爾德\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n對每個生物而言，除非其操控者為其支付{1}，否則它不能攻擊你或由你操控的鵬洛客。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「愛好和平的統治聯盟為了免受戰事侵擾而修建了阿基夫高牆，讓子孫盡享十五世紀太平歲月。結論不言自明。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'386c36ac-7677-4b4b-bdda-08f11fe0d084\', \'multiverseId\': 445582}, \'multiverseid\': 445582}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baloth-Verschlinger\', \'text\': \'Bonus {4} (Du kannst zusätzlich {4} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nFalls die Bonuskosten des Baloth-Verschlingers bezahlt wurden, kommt er mit drei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Baloth denkt hauptsächlich an sein Fressen und nur sehr wenig an seine Fressfeinde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443313&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e231a0a-c7de-4c0a-a988-56019eaf1b3d\', \'multiverseId\': 443313}, \'multiverseid\': 443313}, {\'name\': \'Báloth devorador\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {4}. (Puedes pagar {4} adicionales al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nSi el Báloth devorador fue estimulado, entra al campo de batalla con tres contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'A un báloth solo le importan las muchas cosas que devora y las pocas cosas que podrían devorarlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a0e9b43-8a47-4def-9d7b-642e09781df4\', \'multiverseId\': 443582}, \'multiverseid\': 443582}, {\'name\': \'Avaleur baloth\', \'text\': "Kick {4} (Vous pouvez payer {4} supplémentaires au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nSi l\'Avaleur baloth a été kické, il arrive sur le champ de bataille avec trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Un baloth ne se soucie que de ce qu\'il peut manger et des rares choses qui peuvent le manger.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443851&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0d679ee-7995-4f5a-a118-416f9a3e2783\', \'multiverseId\': 443851}, \'multiverseid\': 443851}, {\'name\': \'Baloth Trangugiatore\', \'text\': \'Potenziamento {4} (Puoi pagare {4} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nSe il Baloth Trangugiatore è stato potenziato, entra nel campo di battaglia con tre segnalini +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Un baloth si preoccupa solo delle molte cose che può mangiare e delle poche che possono mangiarlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72f5627c-9f0e-43f3-8ba9-8a38ec12df48\', \'multiverseId\': 444120}, \'multiverseid\': 444120}, {\'name\': \'ベイロスの大喰らい\', \'text\': \'キッカー{4}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{4}を支払ってもよい。）\\nベイロスの大喰らいがキッカーされていたなら、これは＋１/＋１カウンターが３個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'ベイロスが関心を持つのは、それが捕食する多数のものと、それを捕食する僅かなもののみだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd6b44ff-c7c5-4fe9-a358-fc89dc1263fc\', \'multiverseId\': 444389}, \'multiverseid\': 444389}, {\'name\': \'발로스 포식자\', \'text\': \'키커 {4} (당신은 이 주문을 발동하면서 추가로 {4}를 지불할 수 있다.)\\n발로스 포식자의 키커 비용이 지불되었다면, 발로스 포식자는 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'발로스는 자신이 잡아먹는 많은 것들, 그리고 아주 드물게 발로스를 잡아먹는 존재들에게만 신경을 쓴다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5c63b37-7094-419d-87f8-f9f960340829\', \'multiverseId\': 444658}, \'multiverseid\': 444658}, {\'name\': \'Devorador Baloth\', \'text\': \'Reforçar {4} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {4} ao conjurar esta mágica.)\\nSe Devorador Baloth foi reforçado, ele entra no campo de batalha com três marcadores +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Um baloth só se importa com as muitas coisas que come e com as poucas que o comem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'113e83bd-87d9-411e-892d-2ac6dd157c2b\', \'multiverseId\': 444927}, \'multiverseid\': 444927}, {\'name\': \'Балот-Пожиратель\', \'text\': \'Усилитель {4} (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете дополнительно заплатить {4}.)\\nЕсли Балот-Пожиратель получил Усилитель, он выходит на поле битвы с тремя жетонами +1/+1 на нем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Балоту есть дело лишь до его многочисленной еды и до тех немногих, для кого еда — он сам.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da03608a-3a39-4426-9d94-4e51c648f277\', \'multiverseId\': 445196}, \'multiverseid\': 445196}, {\'name\': \'暴食巴洛西\', \'text\': \'增幅{4}（你施放此咒语时可以额外支付{4}。）\\n如果暴食巴洛西已增幅，则它进战场时上面有三个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'巴洛西只关心它能吃掉的大量东西，以及能吃掉它的少数东西。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'054a75f3-c409-4659-9f16-e44774201b17\', \'multiverseId\': 445465}, \'multiverseid\': 445465}, {\'name\': \'暴食巴洛西\', \'text\': \'增幅{4}（你施放此咒語時可以額外支付{4}）。\\n如果暴食巴洛西已增幅，則它進戰場時上面有三個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'巴洛西只關心牠能吃掉的大量東西，以及能吃掉牠的少數東西。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2623b67-8db5-46c5-8179-bc1a14efe1c7\', \'multiverseId\': 445734}, \'multiverseid\': 445734}]', "[{'name': 'Beichtvater der Felsenburg', 'text': 'Bonus {3} (Du kannst zusätzlich {3} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nBedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\\nFalls die Bonuskosten des Beichtvaters der Felsenburg bezahlt wurden, kommt er mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443262&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92121030-bdfe-4261-9329-2d1f9d884172', 'multiverseId': 443262}, 'multiverseid': 443262}, {'name': 'Confesor de la Fortaleza', 'text': 'Estímulo {3}. (Puedes pagar {3} adicionales al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nAmenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\\nSi el Confesor de la Fortaleza fue estimulado, entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre él.', 'type': 'Criatura — Clérigo humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443531&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8bf7070-0dee-4c98-81f5-7fd83bb12248', 'multiverseId': 443531}, 'multiverseid': 443531}, {'name': 'Confesseur de la forteresse', 'text': 'Kick {3} (Vous pouvez payer {3} supplémentaires au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nMenace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\\nSi le Confesseur de la forteresse a été kické, il arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et clerc', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443800&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f85bec4-5048-46e8-9027-3d6d3216e4bc', 'multiverseId': 443800}, 'multiverseid': 443800}, {'name': 'Confessore della Fortezza', 'text': 'Potenziamento {3} (Puoi pagare {3} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nMinacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\\nSe il Confessore della Fortezza è stato potenziato, entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.', 'type': 'Creatura — Chierico Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444069&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7c7a135-c00a-433a-a67d-abad63d4f393', 'multiverseId': 444069}, 'multiverseid': 444069}, {'name': '要塞の聴罪司祭', 'text': 'キッカー{3}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{3}を支払ってもよい。）\\n威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。）\\n要塞の聴罪司祭がキッカーされていたなら、これは＋１/＋１カウンターが２個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444338&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7afe6992-3b62-4a0b-92b2-93d007e14a88', 'multiverseId': 444338}, 'multiverseid': 444338}, {'name': '성채 고해신부', 'text': '키커 {3} (당신은 이 주문을 발동하면서 추가로 {3}을 지불할 수 있다.)\\n호전적 (이 생물은 두 개 이상의 생물에만 방어될 수 있다.)\\n성채 고해신부의 키커 비용이 지불되었다면, 성채 고해신부는 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.', 'type': '생물 — 인간 성직자', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444607&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3dbd2d1a-84b9-42c6-9d8a-bd369a14f4e7', 'multiverseId': 444607}, 'multiverseid': 444607}, {'name': 'Confessor da Fortaleza', 'text': 'Reforçar {3} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {3} ao conjurar esta mágica.)\\nAmeaçar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por duas ou mais criaturas.)\\nSe Confessor da Fortaleza foi reforçado, ele entra no campo de batalha com dois marcadores +1/+1.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Clérigo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444876&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0be32531-822f-4d24-8834-0fcd21bf9dca', 'multiverseId': 444876}, 'multiverseid': 444876}, {'name': 'Исповедник из Твердыни', 'text': 'Усилитель {3} (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете дополнительно заплатить {3}.)\\nУгроза (Это существо не может быть заблокировано менее чем двумя существами.)\\nЕсли Исповедник из Твердыни получил Усилитель, он выходит на поле битвы с двумя жетонами +1/+1 на нем.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Священник', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445145&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f8bba3e-4e41-48d6-a05c-882947d04962', 'multiverseId': 445145}, 'multiverseid': 445145}, {'name': '城塞告解僧', 'text': '增幅{3}（你施放此咒语时可以额外支付{3}。）\\n威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\\n如果城塞告解僧已增幅，则它进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／僧侣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445414&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee4366c0-8dc1-49cc-b604-4639c38b9d0e', 'multiverseId': 445414}, 'multiverseid': 445414}, {'name': '城塞告解僧', 'text': '增幅{3}（你施放此咒語時可以額外支付{3}。）\\n威懾（此生物只能被兩個或更多生物阻擋。）\\n如果城塞告解僧已增幅，則它進戰場時上面有兩個+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物 ～人類／僧侶', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445683&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c31b0d3-5d39-41df-acaf-9efe5f106daa', 'multiverseId': 445683}, 'multiverseid': 445683}]", '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge drei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\n{1}{R}, opfere einen Goblin: Der Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'„Achtung … äh … Feuer!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443300&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c3edc6d-c5bc-44ed-b2a0-282efe78a931\', \'multiverseId\': 443300}, \'multiverseid\': 443300}, {\'name\': \'Comandante de sitiadores\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Comandante de sitiadores entre al campo de batalla, crea tres fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\\n{1}{R}, sacrificar un Trasgo: El Comandante de sitiadores hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Preparados..., eeeh..., ¡fuego!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f6464bb-afa5-462c-97cf-4a472997679e\', \'multiverseId\': 443569}, \'multiverseid\': 443569}, {\'name\': \'Commandant des assiégeants\', \'text\': "Quand le Commandant des assiégeants arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez trois jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\\n{1}{R}, sacrifiez un gobelin : Le Commandant des assiégeants inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin\', \'flavor\': \'« Prêts ? Euh... Feu ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443838&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fcd02c2-b0fd-47e7-a975-5dd4e954454d\', \'multiverseId\': 443838}, \'multiverseid\': 443838}, {\'name\': \'Capo della Squadra di Assedio\', \'text\': \'Quando il Capo della Squadra di Assedio entra nel campo di battaglia, crea tre pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifica un Goblin: Il Capo della Squadra di Assedio infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Pronti... Ehm... Fuoco!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0a662e3-294b-47f5-9dd4-c15a8fecf926\', \'multiverseId\': 444107}, \'multiverseid\': 444107}, {\'name\': \'包囲攻撃の司令官\', \'text\': \'包囲攻撃の司令官が戦場に出たとき、赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークンを３体生成する。\\n{1}{R}, ゴブリン１体を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。包囲攻撃の司令官はそれに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン\', \'flavor\': \'「ヨーイ……えーと……撃て！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9e5e22b-6ded-46b3-afea-23ad761d8e6e\', \'multiverseId\': 444376}, \'multiverseid\': 444376}, {\'name\': \'공성무리 지휘관\', \'text\': \'공성무리 지휘관이 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 적색 고블린 생물 토큰 세 개를 만든다.\\n{1}{R}, 고블린 한 개를 희생한다: 원하는 목표를 정한다. 공성무리 지휘관은 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고블린\', \'flavor\': \'"준비... 어... 발사!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3305cb0b-ed64-4772-9c5d-58c1afd9eba0\', \'multiverseId\': 444645}, \'multiverseid\': 444645}, {\'name\': \'Comandante do Grupo de Cerco\', \'text\': \'Quando Comandante do Grupo de Cerco entrar no campo de batalha, crie três fichas de criatura vermelha 1/1 do tipo Goblin.\\n{1}{R}, sacrifique um Goblin: Comandante do Grupo de Cerco causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Preparar... hã... fogo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40460fde-448d-4e98-8cc4-0f3a5b3c1256\', \'multiverseId\': 444914}, \'multiverseid\': 444914}, {\'name\': \'Командир Осадчиков\', \'text\': \'Когда Командир Осадчиков выходит на поле битвы, создайте три фишки существа 1/1 красный Гоблин.\\n{1}{R}, пожертвуйте Гоблина: Командир Осадчиков наносит 2 повреждения любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин\', \'flavor\': \'«Товьсь... эм-м... пли!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aacccbd-a82d-47ff-acd3-4a4f1441fe4f\', \'multiverseId\': 445183}, \'multiverseid\': 445183}, {\'name\': \'攻城指挥官\', \'text\': \'当攻城指挥官进战场时，派出三个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物。\\n{1}{R}，牺牲一个鬼怪：攻城指挥官对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪\', \'flavor\': \'「准备. . .呃. . .射击！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bb5eeb7-7310-4334-a213-2f3a2fceda9b\', \'multiverseId\': 445452}, \'multiverseid\': 445452}, {\'name\': \'攻城指揮官\', \'text\': \'當攻城指揮官進戰場時，派出三個1/1紅色鬼怪衍生生物。\\n{1}{R}，犧牲一個鬼怪：攻城指揮官對任意一個目標造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪\', \'flavor\': \'「準備. . .呃. . .射擊！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2016b4f7-9114-478b-8ef4-c984acbc34d3\', \'multiverseId\': 445721}, \'multiverseid\': 445721}]', '[{\'name\': \'Benalische Ehrengarde\', \'text\': \'Die Benalische Ehrengarde erhält +1/+0 für jede legendäre Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Man sollte Helden nicht an ihren Leistungen messen, sondern an den Personen, die sie inspirieren." —Gerrards Triumph\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443162&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'955adb8c-d425-49a2-9ce8-d619722497ee\', \'multiverseId\': 443162}, \'multiverseid\': 443162}, {\'name\': \'Guardia de honor benalita\', \'text\': \'La Guardia de honor benalita obtiene +1/+0 por cada criatura legendaria que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La verdadera medida de todos los héroes no es lo que logran, sino a quién inspiran". —Triunfo de Gerrard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0324fd57-fc9d-40b6-95e9-08a3d0341648\', \'multiverseId\': 443431}, \'multiverseid\': 443431}, {\'name\': "Garde d\'honneur bénaliane", \'text\': "La Garde d\'honneur bénaliane gagne +1/+0 pour chaque créature légendaire que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« La valeur des héros ne se mesure pas à la grandeur de ce qu\'ils accomplissent, mais à ceux qu\'ils inspirent. » —Triomphe de Gerrard", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443700&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e5da712-d58f-432f-b025-c02e20170b2a\', \'multiverseId\': 443700}, \'multiverseid\': 443700}, {\'name\': "Guardia d\'Onore di Benalia", \'text\': "La Guardia d\'Onore di Benalia prende +1/+0 per ogni creatura leggendaria che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La vera grandezza degli eroi non si misura dalle imprese che compiono, ma dalle persone che ispirano." —Trionfo di Gerrard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9db2bb56-d22d-4c23-85bf-efa992d620b1\', \'multiverseId\': 443969}, \'multiverseid\': 443969}, {\'name\': \'ベナリアの儀仗兵\', \'text\': \'ベナリアの儀仗兵は、あなたがコントロールしている伝説のクリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「英雄というものの真の評価は、自らが成したことではなく、誰に影響を与えたかによって決まる。」 ――ジェラードの凱旋\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc965bce-817c-4707-887e-ef36b8c4b75b\', \'multiverseId\': 444238}, \'multiverseid\': 444238}, {\'name\': \'베날리아 의장대\', \'text\': \'베날리아 의장대는 당신이 조종하는 전설적 생물 한 개당 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': \'"모든 영웅들의 진정한 가치는 그들이 이룬 것이 아니라, 그들이 타인에게 미치는 영향에 있다." —제라드의 승리\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68a147dd-0364-4b3f-9be4-baa566678dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 444507}, \'multiverseid\': 444507}, {\'name\': \'Guarda de Honra de Benália\', \'text\': \'Guarda de Honra de Benália recebe +1/+0 para cada criatura lendária que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"O verdadeiro valor dos heróis não está no que fazem, mas em quem inspiram." — Triunfo de Gerrard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcc9fbf9-5dde-42dc-a65d-5f1e9fd7b2c8\', \'multiverseId\': 444776}, \'multiverseid\': 444776}, {\'name\': \'Беналийский Почетный Караул\', \'text\': \'Беналийский Почетный Караул получает +1/+0 за каждое легендарное существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'«Истинная мера для всех героев — не то, чего они достигли, а то, кого смогли вдохновить». — «Триумф Джерарда»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e72d52bb-df32-44ea-aa9c-15958decf9ff\', \'multiverseId\': 445045}, \'multiverseid\': 445045}, {\'name\': \'宾纳里亚仪队兵\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个传奇生物，宾纳里亚仪队兵便得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「评判英雄的真正标准，并非看其成就，而是看其影响。」 ～《杰拉尔德凯旋志》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c9d9d71-954b-466c-8711-0affe468ec79\', \'multiverseId\': 445314}, \'multiverseid\': 445314}, {\'name\': \'賓納里亞儀隊兵\', \'text\': \'你每操控一個傳奇生物，賓納里亞儀隊兵便得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「評判英雄的真正標準，並非看其成就，而是看其影響。」 ～《傑拉爾德凱旋誌》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a383a573-d3a0-49cc-9410-1f55fc4db1f2\', \'multiverseId\': 445583}, \'multiverseid\': 445583}]', '[{\'name\': \'Benalischer Feldmarschall\', \'text\': \'Andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Einige streben danach, den Gipfel der Ehre zu erklimmen. Die Benalier werden bereits auf diesem Gipfel geboren und steigen von dort zu den Sternen auf." —Geschichte Benalias\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443163&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48e3f308-8c36-47d4-8498-688a5819f9c0\', \'multiverseId\': 443163}, \'multiverseid\': 443163}, {\'name\': \'Mariscal benalita\', \'text\': \'Las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Algunos aspiran a escalar la montaña del honor. Los benalitas nacen en su cima y, desde allí, ascienden a las estrellas". —Historia de Benalia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'310dc526-3f19-4b97-aa3e-4e662c3086e5\', \'multiverseId\': 443432}, \'multiverseid\': 443432}, {\'name\': \'Maréchal bénalian\', \'text\': \'Les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Certains aspirent à gravir la montagne de l\'honneur. Les Bénalians naissent à son sommet et, de là, s\'élèvent parmi les étoiles. » —Histoire de Bénalia", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443701&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81d2b8dc-0606-4f1e-b653-8672b6563701\', \'multiverseId\': 443701}, \'multiverseid\': 443701}, {\'name\': \'Maresciallo di Benalia\', \'text\': \'Le altre creature che controlli prendono +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Alcuni aspirano a scalare la montagna dell\\\'Onore. Gli abitanti di Benalia sono nati sulla sua sommità e da lì ascendono alle stelle." —Storia di Benalia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e61a1d9-25c8-41e4-a5a1-212065f9d6d0\', \'multiverseId\': 443970}, \'multiverseid\': 443970}, {\'name\': \'ベナリアの軍司令\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている他のクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「一部の民は栄誉の山に登ることを切望しているが、ベナリア人はその頂上で生まれ、そこから星々の高みに昇る。」 ――ベナリア史\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c4f177e-026d-4c13-997c-5cf7dd50cea9\', \'multiverseId\': 444239}, \'multiverseid\': 444239}, {\'name\': \'베날리아 집행관\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 다른 생물들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': \'"어떤 이들은 명예의 산을 오르기를 갈망한다. 베날리아인들은 그 산의 정상에서 태어나 별을 향해 승천하는 자들이다." —베날리아의 역사\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b84ac86e-d7b5-4bd9-930e-53e81a967866\', \'multiverseId\': 444508}, \'multiverseid\': 444508}, {\'name\': \'Marechal de Benália\', \'text\': \'As outras criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Alguns aspiram à escalada ao cimo da honra. Os benalianos nascem em seu cume, e de lá ascendem às estrelas." — História de Benália\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d59f57a-2e59-4113-9b49-f4654e837cbb\', \'multiverseId\': 444777}, \'multiverseid\': 444777}, {\'name\': \'Беналийский Маршал\', \'text\': \'Другие существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'«Есть те, кто кладет все силы, чтобы подняться на гору Чести. Беналийцы же рождаются на ее вершине, а оттуда возносятся к звездам». — «История Беналии»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70eab2fb-887f-4cfd-a700-8a0031ef7e57\', \'multiverseId\': 445046}, \'multiverseid\': 445046}, {\'name\': \'宾纳里亚元帅\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「有些人一心攀登荣耀之巅。宾纳里亚人生于荣耀巅峰，更将晋升星辰之列。」 ～《宾纳里亚史》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6250c19-eb77-4b76-8c0d-2d9328136427\', \'multiverseId\': 445315}, \'multiverseid\': 445315}, {\'name\': \'賓納里亞元帥\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「有些人一心攀登榮耀之巔。賓納里亞人生於榮耀巔峰，更將晉升星辰之列。」 ～《賓納里亞史》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89dc080b-b9ca-42e2-bf40-6064404310b1\', \'multiverseId\': 445584}, \'multiverseid\': 445584}]', '[{\'name\': \'Benebeln\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -4/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Keldonen muss man erst einmal zur Ruhe bringen, bevor man ihnen Vernunft einbläuen kann. Das habe ich von Radha gelernt." —Jhoira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443202&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'616a89b7-5030-43fa-bbbc-4ebd0223c5e7\', \'multiverseId\': 443202}, \'multiverseid\': 443202}, {\'name\': \'Confundir\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -4/-0 hasta el final del turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Para poder hablar de verdad con los keldon, el truco está en hacer que se estén quietos. Me lo enseñó Radha". —Jhoira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58e264ee-ebf9-4375-b079-1424cc240138\', \'multiverseId\': 443471}, \'multiverseid\': 443471}, {\'name\': \'Stupéfier\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne -4/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Pour raisonner des Keldes, il faut qu\'ils se tiennent tranquilles. J\'ai appris ça de Radha. » —Djoïra", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443740&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'196c3287-3bf1-4735-b1ac-9e82a942cb71\', \'multiverseId\': 443740}, \'multiverseid\': 443740}, {\'name\': \'Frastornare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -4/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il trucco per far ragionare gli abitanti di Keld è riuscire a immobilizzarli. L\\\'ho imparato da Radha." —Jhoira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87e4d512-6bd2-42c6-9ae0-0a84e6238d70\', \'multiverseId\': 444009}, \'multiverseid\': 444009}, {\'name\': \'混迷\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－４/－０の修整を受ける。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ケルド人に説教するコツはね、相手をじっとさせておくことよ。ラーダがそう教えてくれたの。」 ――ジョイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ce33787-8b32-4aa1-918b-13d202d7ddea\', \'multiverseId\': 444278}, \'multiverseid\': 444278}, {\'name\': \'어리둥절\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -4/-0을 받는다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"켈드인들이 말귀를 알아듣게 하려면 가만히 있도록 붙잡아두면 돼. 라다에서 배웠지." —조이라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'411e1313-13fd-4f56-bfc9-57010222f44b\', \'multiverseId\': 444547}, \'multiverseid\': 444547}, {\'name\': \'Desconcertar\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -4/-0 até o final do turno.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O macete para chamar os keldonianos à razão é fazer com que eles parem quietos. Aprendi isso com Radha." — Jhoira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'900317f9-669b-4995-b759-dd11b6933a7c\', \'multiverseId\': 444816}, \'multiverseid\': 444816}, {\'name\': \'Сбить с Толку\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -4/-0 до конца хода.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Чтобы келдонец внял голосу разума, его просто нужно заставить постоять спокойно. Этот секрет рассказала мне Радха». — Джойра\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'318c1490-898b-4525-a3f4-309a8e2d3222\', \'multiverseId\': 445085}, \'multiverseid\': 445085}, {\'name\': \'困惑不已\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-4/-0直到回合结束。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「让凯尔顿人恢复理智的诀窍就是让他们动弹不得。这一招向拉妲学的。」 ～尤依拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46ce0dbd-2dff-41c2-8274-ef6803d87074\', \'multiverseId\': 445354}, \'multiverseid\': 445354}, {\'name\': \'困惑不已\', \'text\': \'目標生物得-4/-0直到回合結束。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「讓凱爾頓人恢復理智的訣竅就是讓他們動彈不得。這一招向拉妲學的。」 ～尤依菈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'794222c4-a352-4545-b450-8bacf086d446\', \'multiverseId\': 445623}, \'multiverseid\': 445623}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bergungselefant\', \'text\': \'Bonus {1}{W} (Du kannst zusätzlich {1}{W} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nWenn der Bergungselefant ins Spiel kommt und falls seine Bonuskosten bezahlt wurden, bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elefant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443174&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbb10370-f438-4272-81a8-4730b4b59c16\', \'multiverseId\': 443174}, \'multiverseid\': 443174}, {\'name\': \'Elefante de la excavación\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {1}{W}. (Puedes pagar {1}{W} adicionales al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nCuando el Elefante de la excavación entre al campo de batalla, si fue estimulado, regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'029865cb-726a-4409-9d14-dfac17bf2847\', \'multiverseId\': 443443}, \'multiverseid\': 443443}, {\'name\': "Éléphant d\'excavation", \'text\': "Kick {1}{W} (Vous pouvez payer {1}{W} supplémentaires au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nQuand l\'Éléphant d\'excavation arrive sur le champ de bataille, s\'il a été kické, renvoyez une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : éléphant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443712&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7ebd0d7-8013-4270-83f4-5af4ec1ba419\', \'multiverseId\': 443712}, \'multiverseid\': 443712}, {\'name\': \'Elefante da Escavazione\', \'text\': "Potenziamento {1}{W} (Puoi pagare {1}{W} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nQuando l\'Elefante da Escavazione entra nel campo di battaglia, se è stato potenziato, riprendi in mano una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d3332d1-9246-4cde-acbf-7f470931bc33\', \'multiverseId\': 443981}, \'multiverseid\': 443981}, {\'name\': \'発掘象\', \'text\': \'キッカー{1}{W}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{1}{W}を支払ってもよい。）\\n発掘象が戦場に出たとき、これがキッカーされていた場合、あなたの墓地からアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 象\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'746bc207-729c-449c-9227-137d6388be4b\', \'multiverseId\': 444250}, \'multiverseid\': 444250}, {\'name\': \'발굴 코끼리\', \'text\': \'키커 {1}{W} (당신은 이 주문을 발동하면서 추가로 {1}{W}를 지불할 수 있다.)\\n발굴 코끼리가 전장에 들어올 때, 키커 비용이 지불되었다면, 당신의 무덤에 있는 마법물체 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코끼리\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'195003bc-0b88-4e9f-af2a-4b296a83646e\', \'multiverseId\': 444519}, \'multiverseid\': 444519}, {\'name\': \'Elefante de Escavação\', \'text\': \'Reforçar {1}{W} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {1}{W} ao conjurar esta mágica.)\\nQuando Elefante de Escavação entrar no campo de batalha, se ele tiver sido reforçado, devolva o card de artefato alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'476d2121-8698-4ea4-89df-a9eacc5f611e\', \'multiverseId\': 444788}, \'multiverseid\': 444788}, {\'name\': \'Слон с Раскопок\', \'text\': \'Усилитель {1}{W} (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете дополнительно заплатить {1}{W}.)\\nКогда Слон с Раскопок выходит на поле битвы, если он получил Усилитель, верните целевую карту артефакта из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Слон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6870d590-160c-4049-acbb-bfcff0c2f491\', \'multiverseId\': 445057}, \'multiverseid\': 445057}, {\'name\': \'挖掘驮象\', \'text\': \'增幅{1}{W}（你施放此咒语时可以额外支付{1}{W}。）\\n当挖掘驮象进战场时，若它已增幅，则将目标神器牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～象\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7692bcc8-390f-4f22-8f2c-010ac52e8ec6\', \'multiverseId\': 445326}, \'multiverseid\': 445326}, {\'name\': \'挖掘馱象\', \'text\': \'增幅{1}{W}（你施放此咒語時可以額外支付{1}{W}。)\\n當挖掘馱象進戰場時，若它已增幅，則將目標神器牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～象\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06f3431f-21fc-480d-8aae-26620b4e74dd\', \'multiverseId\': 445595}, \'multiverseid\': 445595}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bernsteinmox\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe einer legendären Kreatur oder eines legendären Planeswalkers, die bzw. den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein in Form gebrachter Ausschnitt der Zeit, welcher die Macht besitzt, epische Visionen zu verwirklichen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443381&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59f73957-735e-4170-a7a3-2726ab0585e3\', \'multiverseId\': 443381}, \'multiverseid\': 443381}, {\'name\': \'Mox de ámbar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color de entre las criaturas y planeswalkers legendarios que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'Un momento tangible con el poder de hacer realidad visiones épicas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e108d5d3-c93e-4e27-8cca-ea03058492ae\', \'multiverseId\': 443650}, \'multiverseid\': 443650}, {\'name\': "Mox d\'ambre", \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix parmi les couleurs des créatures et des planeswalkers légendaires que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'Un instant rendu tangible, qui a le pouvoir de réaliser des visions épiques.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443919&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cc54406-d9b0-4771-98eb-c34e57132d77\', \'multiverseId\': 443919}, \'multiverseid\': 443919}, {\'name\': "Mox d\'Ambra", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore tra quelli dei planeswalker e delle creature leggendarie che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'Un frammento di tempo reso tangibile con il potere di trasformare in realtà visioni epiche.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e54c492f-1aab-4e06-9e63-b9750b0507e7\', \'multiverseId\': 444188}, \'multiverseid\': 444188}, {\'name\': \'モックス・アンバー\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたがコントロールしている伝説のクリーチャーとプレインズウォーカーの中の好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'瞬間が物質化したもので、壮大なビジョンを現実のものにする力がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdadf7bf-6913-4fea-acc4-c5411cecb913\', \'multiverseId\': 444457}, \'multiverseid\': 444457}, {\'name\': \'목스 호박\', \'text\': \'{T}: 당신이 조종하는 전설적 생물들과 플레인즈워커들의 색 중 한 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'시간 속의 한 순간이 뚜렷한 형태로 만들어졌으며, 그 안에는 위대한 환상을 깨달을 힘이 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27a4e285-c2b7-4121-bbe2-0e589678aa52\', \'multiverseId\': 444726}, \'multiverseid\': 444726}, {\'name\': \'Mox de Âmbar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor dentre as das criaturas e dos planeswalkers lendários que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'Um momento no tempo feito tangível, ela tem o poder de concretizar visões épicas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cd69e1f-8cc9-4bf4-824b-11badc15fabd\', \'multiverseId\': 444995}, \'multiverseid\': 444995}, {\'name\': \'Янтарный Мокс\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого из цветов среди легендарных существ и planeswalker-ов под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Момент во времени, ставший осязаемым. Его могущество помогает воплотить в жизнь самые грандиозные замыслы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52b643f8-c742-4a94-a1d2-14a73fff316f\', \'multiverseId\': 445264}, \'multiverseid\': 445264}, {\'name\': \'琥珀玛珂\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为由你操控之传奇生物和鹏洛客所具有的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'历史时刻具化成物，它拥有能实现壮绝憧憬的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03c68e36-0f94-4953-995d-0ada1da0fba1\', \'multiverseId\': 445533}, \'multiverseid\': 445533}, {\'name\': \'琥珀瑪珂\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點魔法力，其顏色為由你操控之傳奇生物和鵬洛客所具有的任一顏色。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'歷史時刻具化成物，它擁有能實現壯絕憧憬的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'897e6974-9b1b-47de-9f27-5d588b953474\', \'multiverseId\': 445802}, \'multiverseid\': 445802}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bewaffnung des Waldes\', \'text\': \'Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Die Kreatur erhält Reichweite bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Äste Llanowars sind bewaffnet, bereit für einen Herbst der eisernen Blätter." —„Freyalises Lied"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443312&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de297c14-b623-4605-86b9-934ddb2fe31b\', \'multiverseId\': 443312}, \'multiverseid\': 443312}, {\'name\': \'Armamento enramado\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo. Esa criatura gana la habilidad de alcance hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Las ramas de Llanowar siempre están al acecho para desatar un otoño de hojas de acero". —"Canción de Freyalise"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90a74215-dc58-428e-9e90-23bdb8460cde\', \'multiverseId\': 443581}, \'multiverseid\': 443581}, {\'name\': \'Armement arboricole\', \'text\': "Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée. Cette créature acquiert la portée jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Les branches de Llanowar sont toujours parées À déchaîner un automne de feuilles d\'acier. » —« Chant de Freyalise »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443850&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc7e354c-8f22-4058-b88c-41c0dc569869\', \'multiverseId\': 443850}, \'multiverseid\': 443850}, {\'name\': \'Armamento Arboreo\', \'text\': \'Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio. Quella creatura ha raggiungere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le fronde di Llanowar sono sempre pronte A scatenare un autunno di foglie d\\\'acciaio." —"Canto di Freyalise"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8682ff3-bcb2-47e0-8328-c1ea9e061dba\', \'multiverseId\': 444119}, \'multiverseid\': 444119}, {\'name\': \'高木の武装\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは到達を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ラノワールの大樹は待っていた 鉄葉の秋を解き放つときを。」 ――「フレイアリーズの歌」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a38ea2a-1be7-4776-8ce2-f75a124ac844\', \'multiverseId\': 444388}, \'multiverseid\': 444388}, {\'name\': \'숲의 군비확충\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 대공을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"라노워의 가지는 언제라도 강철의 낙엽이 떨어지는 가을을 선사할 준비가 되어 있다." —"프레얄리스의 노래"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80d781c5-ffe9-4fa3-ab86-227c7b5c027e\', \'multiverseId\': 444657}, \'multiverseid\': 444657}, {\'name\': \'Armamento Arbóreo\', \'text\': \'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo. Aquela criatura ganha alcance até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Os ramos de Llanowar estão sempre prontos Para despejar um outono de folhas de aço." — "Canção de Freyalise"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ff726ee-5bde-46af-b565-6a7b1b5d0143\', \'multiverseId\': 444926}, \'multiverseid\': 444926}, {\'name\': \'Древесное Вооружение\', \'text\': \'Положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо. То существо получает Захват до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Ветви Лановара всегда готовы Обрушить осенний стальной листопад». — «Песнь о Фреализ»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8941c680-b59a-4833-b9e5-55f4e6c48f1e\', \'multiverseId\': 445195}, \'multiverseid\': 445195}, {\'name\': \'乔木战具\', \'text\': \'在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。该生物获得延势异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「罗堰壮枝时刻准备， 对空齐射秋日钢叶。」 ～「妃雅丽兹颂歌」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d707a0d6-5615-456b-8e15-24ac9fe16d51\', \'multiverseId\': 445464}, \'multiverseid\': 445464}, {\'name\': \'喬木戰具\', \'text\': \'在目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。該生物獲得延勢異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「羅堰壯枝時刻準備， 對空齊射秋日鋼葉。」 ～「妃雅麗茲頌歌」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5ce84fe-5919-4175-8aaa-7d7ca84d2aa9\', \'multiverseId\': 445733}, \'multiverseid\': 445733}]', "[{'name': 'Bewaldete Schlucht', 'text': 'Die Bewaldete Schlucht kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Gletscher, reißende Fluten, ja sogar Zeitanomalien kamen und gingen. Die Bergen stehen immer noch, unverändert.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445867&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f1c7780-446e-410b-8faf-b14ac266baa2', 'multiverseId': 445867}, 'multiverseid': 445867}, {'name': 'Desfiladero de madera', 'text': 'El Desfiladero de madera entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Las montañas soportaron la aparición y desaparición de glaciares, inundaciones y perturbaciones temporales. A pesar de todo, siguieron en pie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445877&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c6329bf-5701-49c9-a8a3-199bc75eb852', 'multiverseId': 445877}, 'multiverseid': 445877}, {'name': 'Gorge du massif', 'text': 'La Gorge du massif arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Glaciers, crues torrentielles et perturbations temporelles se succédaient. Les montagnes, elles, restaient immuables.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445887&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44bca689-b1e6-4254-97a4-03e1673ee941', 'multiverseId': 445887}, 'multiverseid': 445887}, {'name': 'Gola Boscosa', 'text': 'La Gola Boscosa entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Ghiacciai, inondazioni torrenziali e perturbazioni temporali andavano e venivano. Solo le montagne permanevano immutate.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445897&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5615c086-953f-4647-b459-a3b4ff620696', 'multiverseId': 445897}, 'multiverseid': 445897}, {'name': '森林の地溝', 'text': '森林の地溝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '氷河、大洪水、そして時間の混乱が訪れては過ぎ去っていった。この山はそれでも変わらずここにある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445907&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46fd9bb2-4225-4870-a4ff-002d11e30859', 'multiverseId': 445907}, 'multiverseid': 445907}, {'name': '산림 협곡', 'text': '산림 협곡은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {R}나 {G}를 더한다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': '빙하, 격렬한 홍수, 시공의 흐트러짐은 나타났다가 사라졌다. 그러나 산맥은 변하지 않은 채로 서 있었다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445917&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f5dbcfa-6687-4e1d-a33d-1ab0cae0e1dc', 'multiverseId': 445917}, 'multiverseid': 445917}, {'name': 'Desfiladeiro da Mata', 'text': 'Desfiladeiro da Mata entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Geleiras, inundações e perturbações temporais vieram e se foram. As montanhas, porém, permaneceram, inalteradas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445927&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44a84e18-643a-491f-ba65-6f7aed742119', 'multiverseId': 445927}, 'multiverseid': 445927}, {'name': 'Лесная Теснина', 'text': 'Лесная Теснина выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {R} или {G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Ледники, потопы и временные возмущения приходили и исчезали без следа. Горы же стояли, недвижимые и неизменные.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445937&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d36b812-0465-4fc1-aa69-d0cce4803256', 'multiverseId': 445937}, 'multiverseid': 445937}, {'name': '林场峡谷', 'text': '林场峡谷须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '冰川、洪流、时漩易逝，然高山长存。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445947&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd934eff2-fa1c-4b69-998d-40a0d4ad2ccc', 'multiverseId': 445947}, 'multiverseid': 445947}, {'name': '林場峽谷', 'text': '林場峽谷須橫置進戰場。\\n{T} ：加{R}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '冰川、洪流、時漩易逝，然高山長存。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445957&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c03fd1ad-7b29-4b79-ae8f-d8c3f8dc5a9e', 'multiverseId': 445957}, 'multiverseid': 445957}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blitz des Zauberers\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {2} weniger, falls du einen Zauberer kontrollierst.\\nDer Blitz des Zauberers fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Mit dem ersten erfolgreichen Blitz aus der Hand einer Magierin war das Studium der Magie geboren." —Naban, Dekan der Iteration\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443309&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9ee7e94-e245-4155-be2d-65eacb4701ed\', \'multiverseId\': 443309}, \'multiverseid\': 443309}, {\'name\': \'Rayo del hechicero\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar este hechizo si controlas un Hechicero.\\nEl Rayo del hechicero hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El estudio de la magia comenzó cuando la primera maga aprendió a lanzar rayos". —Naban, decano de la iteración\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7de59a3e-5b12-46a1-a901-de7066064154\', \'multiverseId\': 443578}, \'multiverseid\': 443578}, {\'name\': \'Éclair de sorcier\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {2} de moins à lancer si vous contrôlez un sorcier.\\nL\'Éclair de sorcier inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« L\'étude de la magie commença lorsque la première mage apprit par elle-même à lancer des éclairs. » —Naban, doyen de l\'itération", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443847&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ac07a3-51bd-436f-a275-b82aa397e1dd\', \'multiverseId\': 443847}, \'multiverseid\': 443847}, {\'name\': \'Folgore dello Stregone\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {2} in meno per essere lanciata se controlli un Mago.\\nLa Folgore dello Stregone infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo studio della magia ebbe inizio quando la prima stregona imparò da autodidatta a lanciare fulmini." —Naban, decano dell\\\'iterazione\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'add31a49-f91c-476d-8249-d7d2afad1a10\', \'multiverseId\': 444116}, \'multiverseid\': 444116}, {\'name\': \'魔術師の稲妻\', \'text\': \'あなたがウィザードをコントロールしているなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\nクリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。魔術師の稲妻はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「魔法の研究は、最初の魔道士が稲妻を放つ方法を見出した時に始まった。」 ――反復の学部長、ナバン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84c16965-f91e-4837-a596-2b6e6b3dc78a\', \'multiverseId\': 444385}, \'multiverseid\': 444385}, {\'name\': \'마법사의 번개\', \'text\': \'당신이 마법사를 조종한다면 이 주문은 발동하는 데 {2}가 덜 든다.\\n원하는 목표를 정한다. 마법사의 번개는 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"마법의 연구는 최초의 마법사가 번개를 던지는 법을 스스로 터득했을 때부터 시작되었다." —반복학과 학과장, 나반\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dff222c-d89a-4ca4-8004-9fd27f33fd90\', \'multiverseId\': 444654}, \'multiverseid\': 444654}, {\'name\': \'Relâmpago do Mago\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {2} a menos para ser conjurada se você controla um Mago.\\nRelâmpago do Mago causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O estudo da magia começou quando a primeira maga aprendeu a soltar raios sozinha." — Naban, deão das iterações\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaeebe1d-5f8f-4dbe-b49e-15d934096acf\', \'multiverseId\': 444923}, \'multiverseid\': 444923}, {\'name\': \'Чародейская Молния\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {2} меньше, если вы контролируете Чародея.\\nЧародейская Молния наносит 3 повреждения любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Изучение магии началось с того момента, когда первая чародейка научилась творить молнии». — Набан, декан итераций\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35699219-5053-46d8-9877-0694266961bc\', \'multiverseId\': 445192}, \'multiverseid\': 445192}, {\'name\': \'法师雷击\', \'text\': \'如果你操控法术师，则此咒语减少{2}来施放。\\n法师雷击对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「魔法研究起源于第一位自学投掷闪电成功的法师。」 ～迭演院长奈班\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd98470-cbd8-495c-b9cf-582c19a637ed\', \'multiverseId\': 445461}, \'multiverseid\': 445461}, {\'name\': \'法師雷擊\', \'text\': \'如果你操控魔法師，則此咒語減少{2}來施放。\\n法師雷擊對任意一個目標造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「魔法研究起源於第一位自學投擲閃電成功的法師。」 ～迭演院長奈班\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'158ca8bc-7a25-4d2f-9765-bdb08445ada6\', \'multiverseId\': 445730}, \'multiverseid\': 445730}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutstein-Goblin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch samt Bonuskosten wirkst, erhält der Blutstein-Goblin +1/+1 und Bedrohlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Er kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Der Stein flüstert Geschichten von Dunkelheit und Feuer. „Erzähl mir mehr!", erwidert der Goblin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443272&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'968d0b3e-00b9-4607-b2c1-003adf8641c0\', \'multiverseId\': 443272}, \'multiverseid\': 443272}, {\'name\': \'Trasgo de la piedra sangrienta\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo, si ese hechizo fue estimulado, la Trasgo de la piedra sangrienta obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de amenaza hasta el final del turno. (No puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'La piedra susurra historias de oscuridad y de fuego. Ella le responde: "Cuéntame más".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cfb4a1f-e57a-4110-9fd3-f97d067b2c16\', \'multiverseId\': 443541}, \'multiverseid\': 443541}, {\'name\': "Gobelin d\'hématite", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, si ce sort a été kické, le Gobelin d\'hématite gagne +1/+1 et acquiert la menace jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Il ne peut pas être bloqué excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "La pierre murmure des récits de ténèbres et de feu. Il lui répond : « Dis-m\'en plus. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443810&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbbfe53b-3477-4e97-9617-1c62525abe58\', \'multiverseId\': 443810}, \'multiverseid\': 443810}, {\'name\': "Goblin dell\'Eliotropio", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia, se quella magia è stata potenziata, la Goblin dell\'Eliotropio prende +1/+1 e ha minacciare fino alla fine del turno. (Non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'La pietra sussurra racconti di tenebre e fuoco. Lei risponde: "Dimmi di più."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0420dc2b-5a1a-4a7e-bc93-ebf07154f959\', \'multiverseId\': 444079}, \'multiverseid\': 444079}, {\'name\': \'血石のゴブリン\', \'text\': \'あなたが呪文を唱えるたび、その呪文がキッカーされていた場合、ターン終了時まで、血石のゴブリンは＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに威迫を得る。（これは２体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'その石は闇と火の物語をささやく。彼女は言った。「もっと聞かせて。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8340aff-405a-4142-947f-dffeb54197eb\', \'multiverseId\': 444348}, \'multiverseid\': 444348}, {\'name\': \'혈석 고블린\', \'text\': \'당신이 주문을 발동할 때마다, 그 주문의 키커 비용이 지불되었다면, 혈석 고블린은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 호전적을 얻는다. (이 생물은 두 개 이상의 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고블린 전사\', \'flavor\': \'돌은 어둠과 불의 이야기를 속삭인다. 그녀는 "더 얘기해 줘."라고 대답한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'463ff75b-258d-4ae6-bd0c-3399af02faec\', \'multiverseId\': 444617}, \'multiverseid\': 444617}, {\'name\': \'Goblin do Jaspe Vermelho\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica, se aquela mágica foi reforçada, Goblin do Jaspe Vermelho recebe +1/+1 e ganha ameaçar até o final do turno. (Ele só pode ser bloqueado por duas ou mais criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'A pedra sussurra histórias de trevas e fogo. Ela responde: "Conte mais."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be013d21-64a4-476f-95d4-9b679f317b24\', \'multiverseId\': 444886}, \'multiverseid\': 444886}, {\'name\': \'Гоблин с Кровавого Утеса\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, если то заклинание получило Усилитель, Гоблин с Кровавого Утеса получает +1/+1 и Угрозу до конца хода. (Он не может быть заблокирован менее чем двумя существами.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Камень шептал истории о темноте и огне. Она отвечала: «Расскажи еще».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'761ef957-02fa-4bee-946e-e809b16fdd58\', \'multiverseId\': 445155}, \'multiverseid\': 445155}, {\'name\': \'血玉髓鬼怪\', \'text\': \'每当你施放咒语时，若该咒语已增幅，则直到回合结束，血玉髓鬼怪得+1/+1且具有威慑异能。（它只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'玉髓低声讲述黑暗与烈火的故事。她回应道，「多说点。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8012bbff-8147-46d9-833a-c684f40f371a\', \'multiverseId\': 445424}, \'multiverseid\': 445424}, {\'name\': \'血玉髓鬼怪\', \'text\': \'每當你施放咒語時，若該咒語已增幅，則直到回合結束，血玉髓鬼怪得+1/+1且具有威懾異能。（它只能被兩個或更多生物阻擋。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'玉髓低聲講述黑暗與烈火的故事。她回應道，「多說點。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1979b0a4-507c-4613-9212-dd3070cbe928\', \'multiverseId\': 445693}, \'multiverseid\': 445693}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bluttalgkerze\', \'text\': \'{6}, {T}, opfere die Bluttalgkerze: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -5/-5 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Reiche mir eine Engelsfeder und ich gebe dir dafür einen Tod. Sowie die Kerze entzündet ist, gibt es kein Zurück." —Wisper, die Blutliturgistin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443369&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85ec621c-006f-4f13-bd95-7615cdae9cf9\', \'multiverseId\': 443369}, \'multiverseid\': 443369}, {\'name\': \'Vela de sebo sangriento\', \'text\': \'{6}, {T}, sacrificar la Vela de sebo sangriento: La criatura objetivo obtiene -5/-5 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Tráeme la pluma de un ángel y te daré a cambio una muerte. Una vez que se enciende la vela, no hay vuelta atrás". —Susurro, liturgista de la sangre\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e077fd93-14fc-4b8d-a387-1811ebeb12ff\', \'multiverseId\': 443638}, \'multiverseid\': 443638}, {\'name\': \'Chandelle de suif de sang\', \'text\': "{6}, {T}, sacrifiez la Chandelle de suif de sang : La créature ciblée gagne -5/-5 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Donnez-moi une plume d\'ange, et je vous donnerai une mort en échange. Une fois que la chandelle est allumée, on ne peut plus revenir en arrière. » —Murmure, liturgiste de sang", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443907&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8d63e4b-45dc-481f-bc32-31588d892882\', \'multiverseId\': 443907}, \'multiverseid\': 443907}, {\'name\': \'Candela di Cera Sanguigna\', \'text\': \'{6}, {T}, Sacrifica la Candela di Cera Sanguigna: Una creatura bersaglio prende -5/-5 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Portami una piuma d\\\'angelo e in cambio ti donerò una morte. Una volta accesa la candela, non si può tornare indietro." —Sussurro, liturgista sanguigna\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbef586a-27fc-4755-8512-46b65c5d0b90\', \'multiverseId\': 444176}, \'multiverseid\': 444176}, {\'name\': \'獣血蝋燭\', \'text\': \'{6}, {T}, 獣血蝋燭を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－５/－５の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「天使の羽根を１枚持ってくれば、引き換えに１人の死をくれてやる。この蝋燭に火を灯したら後戻りはできぬ。」 ――血の儀式司、ウィスパー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'151405b2-e584-4114-b50f-340609aa0dca\', \'multiverseId\': 444445}, \'multiverseid\': 444445}, {\'name\': \'혈액수지 양초\', \'text\': \'{6}, {T}, 혈액수지 양초를 희생한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -5/-5를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"내게 천사의 깃털을 가져와라. 그러면 대가로 네게 죽음 하나를 주겠다. 양초에 불이 붙으면 그때는 돌이킬 수 없다." —피의 예배학자, 위스퍼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8281e830-06f4-4b77-986f-516e1f9b09ea\', \'multiverseId\': 444714}, \'multiverseid\': 444714}, {\'name\': \'Vela de Sanguinossebo\', \'text\': \'{6}, {T}, sacrifique Vela de Sanguinossebo: A criatura alvo recebe -5/-5 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Traga-me uma pena de anjo e, em troca, eu lhe darei uma morte. Uma vez que a vela é acesa, não há mais volta." — Sussurro, liturgista do sangue\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72e8448e-8ea5-46be-b54a-caf265d18597\', \'multiverseId\': 444983}, \'multiverseid\': 444983}, {\'name\': \'Свеча из Кровяного Воска\', \'text\': \'{6}, {T}, пожертвуйте Свечу из Кровяного Воска: целевое существо получает -5/-5 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Принеси мне перо ангела, и взамен я дам тебе одну смерть. После того как свеча будет зажжена, повернуть назад уже нельзя». — Шепот, литургист крови\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5da03923-a96c-4ef3-97dd-649b9cdd8329\', \'multiverseId\': 445252}, \'multiverseid\': 445252}, {\'name\': \'鲜血蜡烛\', \'text\': \'{6}，{T}，牺牲鲜血蜡烛：目标生物得-5/-5直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「帮我找来一根天使羽毛，我便会助你夺人一命为报。蜡烛点燃之后，就再也不能回头。」 ～鲜血仪礼师魏飒璞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23a8c0bb-65ef-4c5e-b16f-8aefdea9eb55\', \'multiverseId\': 445521}, \'multiverseid\': 445521}, {\'name\': \'鮮血蠟燭\', \'text\': \'{6}，{T}，犧牲鮮血蠟燭：目標生物得-5/-5直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「幫我找來一根天使羽毛，我便會助你奪人一命為報。蠟燭點燃之後，就再也不能回頭。」 ～鮮血儀禮師魏颯璞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b3c25ec-cd1c-422c-af10-3471ae7542c5\', \'multiverseId\': 445790}, \'multiverseid\': 445790}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chainers Qualen\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI, II — Chainers Qualen fügt jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu, und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nIII — Erzeuge einen X/X schwarzen Nachtmahr-Schrecken-Kreaturenspielstein, wobei X gleich der Hälfte deines Lebenspunktestands, aufgerundet, ist. Er fügt dir X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443239&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'787a0a6e-2552-439c-8445-bd39ea5d5b0a\', \'multiverseId\': 443239}, \'multiverseid\': 443239}, {\'name\': \'Tormento de Cadenero\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI, II — El Tormento de Cadenero hace 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente y tú ganas 2 vidas.\\nIII — Crea una ficha de criatura Horror Pesadilla negra X/X, donde X es la mitad de tu total de vidas, redondeando hacia arriba. Te hace X puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bd8c1bd-57d3-4f46-9b26-dd1b00be741f\', \'multiverseId\': 443508}, \'multiverseid\': 443508}, {\'name\': \'Tourment de Chaînes\', \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI, II — Le Tourment de Chaînes inflige 2 blessures à chaque adversaire et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\nIII — Créez un jeton de créature X/X noire Cauchemar et Horreur, X étant la moitié de vos points de vie, arrondie à l\'unité supérieure. Il vous inflige X blessures.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443777&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0fcff4a-a61d-4ca0-869b-1647acdec9ea\', \'multiverseId\': 443777}, \'multiverseid\': 443777}, {\'name\': \'Tormento di Chainer\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI, II — Il Tormento di Chainer infligge 2 danni a ogni avversario e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.\\nIII — Crea una pedina creatura Orrore Incubo X/X nera, dove X è pari a metà dei tuoi punti vita, arrotondati per eccesso. Ti infligge X danni.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba6d8461-af13-4c43-ab77-b7b72f396203\', \'multiverseId\': 444046}, \'multiverseid\': 444046}, {\'name\': \'チェイナーの苦悩\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI, II ― チェイナーの苦悩は各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与え、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\nIII ― 黒のＸ/Ｘのナイトメア・ホラー・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。Ｘはあなたのライフ総量の端数を切り上げた半分に等しい。それはあなたにＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'375af6ce-62b0-4bbb-87b4-76fe9bb3a070\', \'multiverseId\': 444315}, \'multiverseid\': 444315}, {\'name\': \'체이너의 고뇌\', \'text\': \'(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. III 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI, II — 체이너의 고뇌는 각 상대에게 피해 2점을 입히고 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\\nIII — X/X 흑색 나이트메어 괴수 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. X는 당신의 생명 총점의 절반을 올림한 값이다. 그 생물은 당신에게 피해 X점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 서사시\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f65de074-6450-4ef4-8820-d10763c1f18d\', \'multiverseId\': 444584}, \'multiverseid\': 444584}, {\'name\': \'Tormento de Chainer\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI, II — Tormento de Chainer causa 2 pontos de dano a cada oponente e você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\\nIII — Crie uma ficha de criatura preta X/X do tipo Pesadelo Horror, sendo X metade de seu total de pontos de vida, arredondada para cima. Ela causa X pontos de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6fc526e-09b9-44ac-ac53-a92127d6241a\', \'multiverseId\': 444853}, \'multiverseid\': 444853}, {\'name\': \'Муки Цепника\', \'text\': \'(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после III.)\\nI, II — Муки Цепника наносят 2 повреждения каждому оппоненту, а вы получаете 2 жизни.\\nIII — Создайте одну фишку существа X/X черный Кошмар Ужас, где X — половина вашего количества жизней, округленная в большую сторону. Она наносит вам X повреждений.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Сага\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6941e13a-1d84-4922-a836-f4e8e6bf53b0\', \'multiverseId\': 445122}, \'multiverseid\': 445122}, {\'name\': \'崔纳的绝境\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI, II — 崔纳的绝境向每位对手各造成2点伤害且你获得2点生命。\\nIII — 派出一个X/X黑色梦魇／惊惧兽衍生生物，X为你总生命的一半，小数点后进位。它对你造成X点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7db7bca2-6d03-4a36-9b58-592cf5816ee6\', \'multiverseId\': 445391}, \'multiverseid\': 445391}, {\'name\': \'崔納的絕境\', \'text\': \'（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到III後犧牲之。）\\nI, II — 崔納的絕境向每位對手各造成2點傷害且你獲得2點生命。\\nIII — 派出一個X/X黑色夢魘／驚懼獸衍生生物，X為你總生命的一半，小數點後進位。它對你造成X點傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～傳紀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9650a62-9025-43bd-9706-637c11d46464\', \'multiverseId\': 445660}, \'multiverseid\': 445660}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion der Flamme\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDer Champion der Flamme erhält +2/+2 für jede Aura und jede Ausrüstung, die an ihn angelegt ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Die Herausforderer der Obersten Kriegsfürstin Radha verlieren immer, aber sie belohnt die leidenschaftlichsten unter ihnen mit der Flamme von Keld. Danach sind sie alle Feuer und Flamme für sie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443273&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f133ef76-4a84-41e4-92d2-8fd9744d697e\', \'multiverseId\': 443273}, \'multiverseid\': 443273}, {\'name\': \'Campeón de la Llama\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nEl Campeón de la Llama obtiene +2/+2 por cada Aura y Equipo anexados a él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Quienes desafían a la Gran Señora Guerrera Radha siempre acaban derrotados; aun así, ella recompensa a los más osados con la Llama de Keld. Después de eso, se consumen de fervor por ella.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'303dbc8f-1445-4551-8fd8-ba6f4740ff4b\', \'multiverseId\': 443542}, \'multiverseid\': 443542}, {\'name\': \'Champion de la Flamme\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nLe Champion de la Flamme gagne +2/+2 pour chaque aura et équipement qui lui sont attachés.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Les adversaires du Grand seigneur de guerre Radha sont toujours vaincus, mais elle récompense les plus passionnés avec la Flamme de Keld. Après ça, ils s\'enflamment pour elle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443811&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e026563c-b726-4253-a527-62bd75452bc8\', \'multiverseId\': 443811}, \'multiverseid\': 443811}, {\'name\': \'Campione della Fiamma\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nIl Campione della Fiamma prende +2/+2 per ogni Aura ed Equipaggiamento ad esso assegnati.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Radha, suprema signora della guerra, sconfigge sempre i suoi sfidanti, ma ricompensa i più veementi con la Fiamma di Keld. Da quel momento, ardono per lei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6b21bd0-78e7-4bc4-af24-23ffc2e9a40f\', \'multiverseId\': 444080}, \'multiverseid\': 444080}, {\'name\': \'炎のチャンピオン\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n炎のチャンピオンは、これにつけられているオーラと装備品１つにつき＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'総将軍ラーダに立ち向かった者たちはみな打ち負かされたが、彼女はそのうち最も熱心であった者にケルドの炎を下賜した。それ以来、その者たちは彼女の炎となった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c8bfd04-7d11-4630-906a-ca0d14e61f47\', \'multiverseId\': 444349}, \'multiverseid\': 444349}, {\'name\': \'불꽃의 용사\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n불꽃의 용사는 자신에게 부착된 마법진 및 장비 한 개당 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'위대한 전쟁군주 라다에게 도전한 자들은 언제나 패배했지만, 그녀는 가장 열정적인 자에게 켈드의 불길을 선사한다. 이를 받은 자는 그 이후, 그녀를 위해 불타오른다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'495ad01e-7ef9-4105-976f-16ca6d9875eb\', \'multiverseId\': 444618}, \'multiverseid\': 444618}, {\'name\': \'Campeão da Chama\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nCampeão da Chama recebe +2/+2 para cada Aura e Equipamento anexado a ele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Os desafiantes de Radha, Grã-senhora da Guerra, são sempre derrotados, mas ela recompensa os mais impetuosos com a Chama de Keld. Depois disso, eles ardem por ela.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab0ce123-2a85-49f0-8739-a2ebac3eb03f\', \'multiverseId\': 444887}, \'multiverseid\': 444887}, {\'name\': \'Поборник Пламени\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nПоборник Пламени получает +2/+2 за каждую прикрепленную к нему Ауру и Снаряжение.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Всех, кто бросает вызов великому вождю Радхе, неизменно ждет поражение, но самых страстных бойцов она награждает Огнем Келда. После этого они горят — горят за нее.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79d6f9e0-cc9f-413c-b33d-32130c709376\', \'multiverseId\': 445156}, \'multiverseid\': 445156}, {\'name\': \'源火斗士\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n源火斗士上每结附一个灵气或每装备一个武具，便得+2/+2。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'挑战大军阀拉妲的人悉数落败，但她会以凯尔顿源火奖励表现最激昂者。此后，他们便为她而燃烧。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5030b0c8-d2aa-47e7-9776-8bfb432b6f08\', \'multiverseId\': 445425}, \'multiverseid\': 445425}, {\'name\': \'源火鬥士\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n源火鬥士上每結附一個靈氣或每裝備一個武具，便得+2/+2。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'挑戰大軍閥拉妲的人悉數落敗，但她會以凱爾頓源火獎勵表現最激昂者。此後，他們便為她而燃燒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e137aa9b-592a-4827-bf4b-1862ceee3e3b\', \'multiverseId\': 445694}, \'multiverseid\': 445694}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, kühne Pyromagierin\', \'text\': \'+1: Erzeuge {R}{R}. Chandra, kühne Pyromagierin, fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n—3: Chandra, kühne Pyromagierin, fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n—7: Chandra, kühne Pyromagierin, fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl und allen Kreaturen und Planeswalkern, die er kontrolliert, je 10 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445863&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7917dc3b-47ef-435e-a50d-2eba6e48492a\', \'multiverseId\': 445863}, \'multiverseid\': 445863}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, piromante audaz\', \'text\': \'+1: Agrega {R}{R}. Chandra, piromante audaz hace 2 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo.\\n−3: Chandra, piromante audaz hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\\n−7: Chandra, piromante audaz hace 10 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo y a cada criatura y planeswalker que este jugador controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8825dc01-5714-4094-9758-c19c8d43c307\', \'multiverseId\': 445873}, \'multiverseid\': 445873}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, pyromancienne audacieuse\', \'text\': "+1 : Ajoutez {R}{R}. Chandra, pyromancienne audacieuse inflige 2 blessures à un joueur ciblé.\\n-3 : Chandra, pyromancienne audacieuse inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker.\\n-7 : Chandra, pyromancienne audacieuse inflige 10 blessures à un joueur ciblé et à chaque créature et planeswalker qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445883&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb46a6c2-f16a-4f23-ab66-4108e8ebfd09\', \'multiverseId\': 445883}, \'multiverseid\': 445883}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Piromante Ardita\', \'text\': \'+1: Aggiungi {R}{R}. Chandra, Piromante Ardita infligge 2 danni a un giocatore bersaglio.\\n-3: Chandra, Piromante Ardita infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\\n-7: Chandra, Piromante Ardita infligge 10 danni a un giocatore bersaglio e a ogni creatura e planeswalker che controlla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09e44454-a08f-48b2-978e-d6f6f1b913f1\', \'multiverseId\': 445893}, \'multiverseid\': 445893}, {\'name\': \'勇敢な紅蓮術師、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'+1：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。{R}{R}を加える。勇敢な紅蓮術師、チャンドラはそのプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。\\n-3：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。勇敢な紅蓮術師、チャンドラはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n-7：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。勇敢な紅蓮術師、チャンドラは、そのプレイヤーとそのプレイヤーがコントロールしている各クリーチャーと各プレインズウォーカーに、それぞれ10点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8976e546-39c6-4f34-ae82-d649473d8666\', \'multiverseId\': 445903}, \'multiverseid\': 445903}, {\'name\': \'대담한 화염술사, 찬드라\', \'text\': \'+1: {R}{R}를 더한다. 대담한 화염술사, 찬드라는 각 상대에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\\n−3: 생물이나 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 대담한 화염술사, 찬드라는 그 목표에게 피해 4점을 입힌다.\\n-7: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 대담한 화염술사, 찬드라는 그 플레이어와 그가 조종하는 각 생물과 플레인즈워커에게 피해 10점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 찬드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3d712ea-b8ad-471d-9bcb-26543b3d7dd5\', \'multiverseId\': 445913}, \'multiverseid\': 445913}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Piromante Ousada\', \'text\': \'+1: Adicione {R}{R}. Chandra, Piromante Ousada, causa 2 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo.\\n−3: Chandra, Piromante Ousada, causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo.\\n−7: Chandra, Piromante Ousada, causa 10 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo e a cada criatura e planeswalker que ele controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a348674f-e75d-4877-8b81-636b81b8548d\', \'multiverseId\': 445923}, \'multiverseid\': 445923}, {\'name\': \'Чандра, Дерзкий Пиромант\', \'text\': \'+1: добавьте {R}{R}. Чандра, Дерзкий Пиромант наносит 2 повреждения целевому игроку.\\n—3: Чандра, Дерзкий Пиромант наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или planeswalker-у.\\n—7: Чандра, Дерзкий Пиромант наносит 10 повреждений целевому игроку и каждому существу и planeswalker-у под его контролем.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3d31510-d13d-4f91-8a75-5cc9fee73c1c\', \'multiverseId\': 445933}, \'multiverseid\': 445933}, {\'name\': \'舞焰勇将茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：加{R}{R}。舞焰勇将茜卓对目标牌手造成2点伤害。\\n−3：舞焰勇将茜卓对目标生物或鹏洛客造成3点伤害。\\n−7：舞焰勇将茜卓对目标牌手及每个由其操控的生物与鹏洛客各造成10点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fca01531-8ade-4059-8f90-5f464f2d600b\', \'multiverseId\': 445943}, \'multiverseid\': 445943}, {\'name\': \'舞焰勇將茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：加{R}{R}。舞焰勇將茜卓對目標玩家造成2點傷害。\\n−3：舞焰勇將茜卓對目標生物或鵬洛客造成3點傷害。\\n−7：舞焰勇將茜卓對目標玩家及每個由其操控的生物與鵬洛客各造成10點傷害。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'347f2933-4486-40cf-8e1e-db30e7fdb5ee\', \'multiverseId\': 445953}, \'multiverseid\': 445953}]', "[{'name': 'Chandras Wutausbruch', 'text': 'Chandras Wutausbruch fügt einem Spieler oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek und/oder deinen Friedhof nach einer Karte namens Chandra, kühne Pyromagierin, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische sie danach.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445864&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76673977-66e3-431f-ad22-3275f9e3de44', 'multiverseId': 445864}, 'multiverseid': 445864}, {'name': 'Explosión de Chandra', 'text': 'La Explosión de Chandra hace 4 puntos de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo.\\nBusca en tu biblioteca y/o cementerio una carta llamada Chandra, piromante audaz, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, barájala.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445874&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ec2c07f-7581-481f-9354-2e98ca982bd0', 'multiverseId': 445874}, 'multiverseid': 445874}, {'name': 'Surgissement de Chandra', 'text': 'Le Surgissement de Chandra inflige 4 blessures à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker.\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque et/ou votre cimetière une carte appelée Chandra, pyromancienne audacieuse, révélez-la et mettez-la dans votre main. Si vous cherchez dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez-la.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445884&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '219c5f8e-37ea-493f-bace-301561438aff', 'multiverseId': 445884}, 'multiverseid': 445884}, {'name': 'Sfuriata di Chandra', 'text': 'La Sfuriata di Chandra infligge 4 danni a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio e/o il tuo cimitero per una carta chiamata Chandra, Piromante Ardita, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Se passi in rassegna il tuo grimorio in questo modo, rimescolalo.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445894&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7fabc231-bc65-4468-90bb-0b37fc51730b', 'multiverseId': 445894}, 'multiverseid': 445894}, {'name': 'チャンドラの激高', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。チャンドラの激高はそれに４点のダメージを与える。\\nあなたのライブラリーやあなたの墓地から「勇敢な紅蓮術師、チャンドラ」という名前のカード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。あなたがこれによりあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、そのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445904&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '630db808-1745-490e-9231-1aea5488a4ff', 'multiverseId': 445904}, 'multiverseid': 445904}, {'name': '찬드라의 분출', 'text': '플레이어나 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 찬드라의 분출은 그 목표에게 피해 4점을 입힌다.\\n당신은 당신의 서고 그리고/또는 무덤에서 이름이 대담한 화염술사, 찬드라인 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 당신이 이런 식으로 당신의 서고를 찾아보았다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445914&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50496c6b-b124-48a6-a61b-ec278597a115', 'multiverseId': 445914}, 'multiverseid': 445914}, {'name': 'Explosão de Chandra', 'text': 'Explosão de Chandra causa 4 pontos de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker alvo.\\nProcure um card com o nome Chandra, Piromante Ousada, em seu grimório e/ou cemitério, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Se procurar em seu grimório desta maneira, embaralhe-o.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445924&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '177fbd15-243c-4b44-b600-a478668cae39', 'multiverseId': 445924}, 'multiverseid': 445924}, {'name': 'Вспышка Чандры', 'text': 'Вспышка Чандры наносит 4 повреждения целевому игроку или planeswalker-у.\\nНайдите в вашей библиотеке и (или) на вашем кладбище карту с именем Чандра, Дерзкий Пиромант, покажите ее и положите в вашу руку. Если вы ищете таким образом в вашей библиотеке, перетасуйте ее.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445934&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '389317ee-cf16-49ee-8bed-2b1f413bf01d', 'multiverseId': 445934}, 'multiverseid': 445934}, {'name': '茜卓的爆发', 'text': '茜卓的爆发对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成4点伤害。\\n从你的牌库和／或坟墓场中搜寻一张名称为舞焰勇将茜卓的牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则将它洗牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445944&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7433e508-48b8-491c-bc10-bacc8b577c54', 'multiverseId': 445944}, 'multiverseid': 445944}, {'name': '茜卓的爆發', 'text': '茜卓的爆發對目標玩家或鵬洛客造成4點傷害。\\n從你的牌庫和／或墳墓場中搜尋一張名稱為舞焰勇將茜卓的牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上。如果你以此法搜尋你的牌庫，則將它洗牌。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445954&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f051fcae-aa68-493d-8655-fb03120b8c9f', 'multiverseId': 445954}, 'multiverseid': 445954}]", '[{\'name\': \'Danitha Capashen, die Vorbildliche\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, Wachsamkeit, Lebensverknüpfung\\nAura- und Ausrüstung-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde die Schwachen beschützen. Ich werde inbrünstig lieben. Ich werde mich der Verzweiflung stellen und weiterkämpfen. Als eine Capashen ist dies meine Pflicht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443169&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01ebd04f-2dac-40b7-ab06-6874799e3bcb\', \'multiverseId\': 443169}, \'multiverseid\': 443169}, {\'name\': \'Danitha Capashen, la ejemplar\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, vigilancia, vínculo vital.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos de Aura o de Equipo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Protegeré a los menos afortunados, amaré con valentía, me enfrentaré a la desesperanza y seguiré luchando. Como Capashen, no puedo hacer menos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'988cd8ef-1dfe-4642-b3af-3164ca8523a8\', \'multiverseId\': 443438}, \'multiverseid\': 443438}, {\'name\': \'Danitha Capashen, parangon\', \'text\': "Initiative, vigilance, lien de vie\\nLes sorts d\'aura et d\'équipement que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Je protégerai les malheureux. J\'aimerai courageusement. J\'affronterai le désespoir et continuerai à me battre. Je suis une Capashen, c\'est le moins que je puisse faire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443707&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b96baf02-3c22-407a-acb2-1d2e028d9ba9\', \'multiverseId\': 443707}, \'multiverseid\': 443707}, {\'name\': "Danitha Capashen, l\'Esemplare", \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, cautela, legame vitale\\nLe magie Aura ed Equipaggiamento che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Proteggerò i meno fortunati, amerò con coraggio, affronterò la disperazione e continuerò a combattere. Sono una Capashen, è il minimo che io possa fare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80221e0c-5ecf-4391-8393-25893838fff5\', \'multiverseId\': 443976}, \'multiverseid\': 443976}, {\'name\': \'模範となる者、ダニサ・キャパシェン\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、警戒、絆魂\\nあなたがオーラか装備品である呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「不運な者を守り、勇敢に愛する。絶望に向き合い、闘い続ける。キャパシェンとして、為すべきことを為す。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68277465-68b3-4841-84ee-49950253acbe\', \'multiverseId\': 444245}, \'multiverseid\': 444245}, {\'name\': \'모범이 되는 자, 다니사 카파셴\', \'text\': \'선제공격, 경계, 생명연결\\n당신이 발동하는 마법진과 장비 주문은 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': \'"나는 불우한 자들을 보호하고 용기를 사랑하며, 절망에 맞서 싸워나갈 것이다. 이는 카파셴의 이름을 가진 내가 마땅히 해야 할 일이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05a20ea1-9094-4698-9241-ca17bae127f5\', \'multiverseId\': 444514}, \'multiverseid\': 444514}, {\'name\': \'Danitha Capashena, Paradigma\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa, vigilância, vínculo com a vida\\nAs mágicas de Aura e Equipamento que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Protegerei os menos afortunados. Amarei bravamente. Enfrentarei o desespero e continuarei a lutar. Sendo capashena, não posso fazer menos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44b57da2-4a70-4617-806d-a8aa91dc5fd0\', \'multiverseId\': 444783}, \'multiverseid\': 444783}, {\'name\': \'Данита Капашен, Образец\', \'text\': \'Первый удар, Бдительность, Цепь жизни\\nРазыгрываемые вами заклинания Аур и Снаряжения стоят на {1} меньше.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'«Я буду защищать тех, кто немощен. Буду любить, не зная страха. Взгляну в лицо отчаянью — и продолжу бой. Я — Капашен, и я не могу поступать иначе».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2e524f6-6185-4e41-82c5-5aa011291ae2\', \'multiverseId\': 445052}, \'multiverseid\': 445052}, {\'name\': \'典范达妮莎卡帕轩\', \'text\': \'先攻，警戒，系命\\n你施放的灵气与武具咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「我将保护不幸者。我愿勇敢去爱。我会面对困厄，奋战不懈。卡帕轩家训必不或忘。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b1ab782-8c86-4d88-ba9d-28f665745579\', \'multiverseId\': 445321}, \'multiverseid\': 445321}, {\'name\': \'典範達妮莎卡帕軒\', \'text\': \'先攻，警戒，繫命\\n你施放的靈氣與武具咒語減少{1}來施放。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「我將保護不幸者。我願勇敢去愛。我會面對困厄，奮戰不懈。卡帕軒家訓必不或忘。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28e91fcc-7b97-4382-8e11-72e8fc453c2d\', \'multiverseId\': 445590}, \'multiverseid\': 445590}]', '[{\'name\': \'Darigaaz der Wiedergeborene\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden, Eile\\nFalls Darigaaz der Wiedergeborene sterben würde, schicke ihn stattdessen mit drei Ei-Marken auf ihm ins Exil.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls sich Darigaaz mit einer Ei-Marke auf ihm im Exil befindet, entferne eine Ei-Marke von ihm. Falls dann keine Ei-Marke auf Darigaaz liegt, bringe ihn ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443350&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d03494c-6848-4b9d-950a-8ea3073e2c5e\', \'multiverseId\': 443350}, \'multiverseid\': 443350}, {\'name\': \'Dárigaaz reencarnado\', \'text\': \'Vuela, arrolla, prisa.\\nSi Dárigaaz reencarnado fuera a morir, en vez de eso, exílialo con tres contadores de huevo sobre él.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si Dárigaaz está exiliado con algún contador de huevo sobre él, remueve un contador de huevo de él. Luego, si Dárigaaz no tiene contadores de huevo sobre él, regrésalo al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf1adcde-f1f2-428c-add5-daae357c2ec0\', \'multiverseId\': 443619}, \'multiverseid\': 443619}, {\'name\': \'Darigaaz réincarné\', \'text\': "Vol, piétinement, célérité\\nSi Darigaaz réincarné devait mourir, à la place exilez-le avec trois marqueurs « œuf » sur lui.\\nAu début de votre entretien, si Darigaaz est exilé avec un marqueur « œuf » sur lui, retirez-lui un marqueur « œuf ». Puis si Darigaaz n\'a pas de marqueur « œuf » sur lui, renvoyez-le sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443888&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f3f3fe0-37e8-4a0b-9859-89d582b1b203\', \'multiverseId\': 443888}, \'multiverseid\': 443888}, {\'name\': \'Darigaaz Reincarnato\', \'text\': "Volare, travolgere, rapidità\\nSe Darigaaz Reincarnato sta per morire, invece esilialo con tre segnalini uovo su di esso.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se Darigaaz è esiliato con un segnalino uovo, rimuovi un segnalino uovo da esso. Poi, se Darigaaz non ha segnalini uovo, rimettilo sul campo di battaglia.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e7f1f10-20bd-42fc-9de2-36e0ebd57378\', \'multiverseId\': 444157}, \'multiverseid\': 444157}, {\'name\': \'転生するデアリガズ\', \'text\': \'飛行、トランプル、速攻\\n転生するデアリガズが死亡するなら、代わりに、これを卵カウンターを３個置いた状態で追放する。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、転生するデアリガズが卵カウンターが置かれた状態で追放されている場合、これの上から卵カウンターを１個取り除く。その後、転生するデアリガズの上に卵カウンターが置かれていないなら、これを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6ad2da2-c989-4651-b4b9-e3cc50d16046\', \'multiverseId\': 444426}, \'multiverseid\': 444426}, {\'name\': \'환생한 다리가즈\', \'text\': \'비행, 돌진, 신속\\n환생한 다리가즈가 죽으려고 하면, 대신 다리가즈에 알 카운터 세 개를 올려놓고 추방한다.\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 다리가즈가 알 카운터를 가진 채로 추방되어 있다면, 다리가즈에서 알 카운터 한 개를 제거한다. 그 후 다리가즈에 놓인 알 카운터가 없다면, 다리가즈를 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59769e0f-b4e7-476d-8b7d-79e1fa8e689a\', \'multiverseId\': 444695}, \'multiverseid\': 444695}, {\'name\': \'Darigaaz Reencarnado\', \'text\': \'Voar, atropelar, ímpeto\\nSe Darigaaz Reencarnado morreria, em vez disso, exile-o com três marcadores de ovo.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, se Darigaaz estiver exilado com um marcador de ovo, remova um marcador de ovo dele. Em seguida, se Darigaaz não tiver marcadores de ovo, devolva-o ao campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc0da595-c63c-4d4c-aabc-5d5d1c5e7bd9\', \'multiverseId\': 444964}, \'multiverseid\': 444964}, {\'name\': \'Даригааз, Переродившийся\', \'text\': \'Полет, Пробивной удар, Ускорение\\nЕсли Даригааз, Переродившийся должен умереть, вместо этого изгоните его с тремя жетонами яйца на нем.\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки, если Даригааз находится в изгнании с жетоном яйца на нем, удалите с него один жетон яйца. Затем, если на Даригаазе нет жетонов яйца, верните его на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb387aa2-9d91-4cac-a00b-fbc582190463\', \'multiverseId\': 445233}, \'multiverseid\': 445233}, {\'name\': \'复焚龙王达里迦\', \'text\': \'飞行，践踏，敏捷\\n如果复焚龙王达里迦将死去，则改为将它放逐且上面有三个蛋卵指示物。\\n在你的维持开始时，若达里迦已放逐且其上有蛋卵指示物，则从其上移去一个蛋卵指示物。然后如果达里迦上没有蛋卵指示物，则将它移回战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edd50055-d5a7-4018-b3d1-d1a12ceaebf3\', \'multiverseId\': 445502}, \'multiverseid\': 445502}, {\'name\': \'復焚龍王達里迦\', \'text\': \'飛行，踐踏，敏捷\\n如果復焚龍王達里迦將死去，則改為將它放逐且上面有三個蛋卵指示物。\\n在你的維持開始時，若達里迦已放逐且其上有蛋卵指示物，則從其上移去一個蛋卵指示物。然後如果達里迦上沒有蛋卵指示物，則將它移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f2b6147-4a41-403b-9a30-f613d08dac11\', \'multiverseId\': 445771}, \'multiverseid\': 445771}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Artefakt-Krieg\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI, II — Schaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Artefaktkarte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nIII — Artefakte, die du kontrollierst, werden bis zum Ende des Zuges zu Artefaktkreaturen mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 5/5.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443199&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8e896a3-9e74-469a-abef-8160bfd0db57\', \'multiverseId\': 443199}, \'multiverseid\': 443199}, {\'name\': \'La Guerra de las Antigüedades\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI, II — Mira las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de artefacto que se encuentre entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\nIII — Los artefactos que controlas se convierten en criaturas artefacto con una fuerza y resistencia base de 5/5 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e534028-a76a-4059-863b-832e47c4dde3\', \'multiverseId\': 443468}, \'multiverseid\': 443468}, {\'name\': \'La Guerre des Antiquités\', \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI, II — Regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'artefact parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nIII — Les artefacts que vous contrôlez deviennent des créatures-artefacts ayant une force et une endurance de base de 5/5 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443737&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd0f79c8-e7df-4739-8b5d-4fb6c2417d7a\', \'multiverseId\': 443737}, \'multiverseid\': 443737}, {\'name\': \'La Guerra delle Antichità\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI, II — Guarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta artefatto scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\nIII — Gli artefatti che controlli diventano creature artefatto con forza e costituzione base 5/5 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58f8485a-2f1a-49ca-a6c2-b9422e797412\', \'multiverseId\': 444006}, \'multiverseid\': 444006}, {\'name\': \'アンティキティー戦争\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI, II ― あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚見る。あなたはその中からアーティファクト・カード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\nIII ― ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトは基本のパワーとタフネスが５/５のアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f3cc2a5-f9b8-4abb-a3ed-fbbfd9a193d1\', \'multiverseId\': 444275}, \'multiverseid\': 444275}, {\'name\': \'유물 전쟁\', \'text\': \'(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. III 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI, II — 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 다섯 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 마법물체 카드 한 장을 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 무작위 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\\nIII — 당신이 조종하는 마법물체들은 턴종료까지 기본 공격력과 방어력이 5/5인 마법물체 생물이 된다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 서사시\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f6642de-6044-49c3-a874-6beacea4460a\', \'multiverseId\': 444544}, \'multiverseid\': 444544}, {\'name\': \'A Guerra das Antiguidades\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI, II — Olhe os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de artefato dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\nIII — Os artefatos que você controla se tornam criaturas artefato com poder e resistência básicos 5/5 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e84a3752-10dc-455a-82bf-85fe678cba87\', \'multiverseId\': 444813}, \'multiverseid\': 444813}, {\'name\': \'Война Древностей\', \'text\': \'(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после III.)\\nI, II — Посмотрите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту артефакта и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\\nIII — Артефакты под вашим контролем становятся артефактами существами с базовыми силой и выносливостью 5/5 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Сага\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0b847ec-a020-4ef5-b670-48f91dcdf160\', \'multiverseId\': 445082}, \'multiverseid\': 445082}, {\'name\': \'古文明之战\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI, II — 检视你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以展示其中的一张神器牌，并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\\nIII — 由你操控的神器均成为基础力量与防御力为5/5的神器生物直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39d730d6-7f8e-4847-8365-3f8b9fb250a1\', \'multiverseId\': 445351}, \'multiverseid\': 445351}, {\'name\': \'古文明之戰\', \'text\': \'（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到III後犧牲之。）\\nI, II — 檢視你牌庫頂的五張牌。你可以展示其中的一張神器牌，並將它置於你手上。將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\\nIII — 由你操控的神器均成為基礎力量與防禦力為5/5的神器生物直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～傳紀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f549bec2-0616-480c-93e2-68f578fc5c7e\', \'multiverseId\': 445620}, \'multiverseid\': 445620}]', "[{'name': 'Der Urzeitdrachen glorreiche Wiedergeburt', 'text': '(Legendäre Hexereien kannst du nur wirken, falls du eine legendäre Kreatur oder einen legendären Planeswalker kontrollierst.)\\nBringe alle legendären bleibenden Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Legendäre Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Vor vielen Jahrhunderten überwanden fünf Drachen den Tod, um über die Sterblichen zu herrschen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443358&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf67889f-5949-4c6b-ba85-a3e6ac2f373d', 'multiverseId': 443358}, 'multiverseid': 443358}, {'name': 'Renacer glorioso de los Primigenios', 'text': '(Solo puedes lanzar un conjuro legendario si controlas una criatura o planeswalker legendario.)\\nRegresa todas las cartas de permanente legendarias de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.', 'type': 'Conjuro legendario', 'flavor': 'Hace siglos, cinco dragones vencieron a la muerte para gobernar sobre los vivos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443627&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83d21118-3c6c-4b13-a675-911661e615cc', 'multiverseId': 443627}, 'multiverseid': 443627}, {'name': 'Renaissance glorieuse des Archéens', 'text': '(Vous ne pouvez lancer un rituel légendaire que si vous contrôlez une créature légendaire ou un planeswalker.)\\nRenvoyez sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes de permanent légendaire depuis votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Rituel légendaire', 'flavor': 'Il y a des siècles, cinq dragons conquirent la mort pour régner sur les vivants.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443896&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '106bdfbd-3e5f-4657-bcf7-e50d0db5b756', 'multiverseId': 443896}, 'multiverseid': 443896}, {'name': 'Rinascita Gloriosa dei Primevi', 'text': '(Puoi lanciare una stregoneria leggendaria solo se controlli una creatura o un planeswalker leggendari.)\\nRimetti sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte permanente leggendario dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Stregoneria Leggendaria', 'flavor': 'Secoli fa, cinque draghi trionfarono sulla morte per dominare i vivi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444165&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b4453a0e-1262-43c4-9c66-080f54b6c9bd', 'multiverseId': 444165}, 'multiverseid': 444165}, {'name': '上古族の栄華な再誕', 'text': '（伝説のソーサリーは、あなたが伝説のクリーチャーか伝説のプレインズウォーカーをコントロールしているときにのみ唱えられる。）\\nあなたの墓地から伝説のパーマネント・カードをすべて戦場に戻す。', 'type': '伝説のソーサリー', 'flavor': '数世紀前、５頭のドラゴンが死を征服し生を支配した。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444434&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a12f763-076d-4da6-8adb-8b8239d766b7', 'multiverseId': 444434}, 'multiverseid': 444434}, {'name': '원시용들의 영광스러운 재탄생', 'text': '(당신이 전설적 생물이나 플레인즈워커를 조종할 때만 전설적 집중마법을 발동할 수 있다.)\\n당신의 무덤에 있는 모든 전설적 지속물 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다.', 'type': '전설적 집중마법', 'flavor': '수 세기 전, 다섯 마리의 용이 죽음을 지배하여 산 자들을 다스렸다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444703&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd35bb59-571f-4d34-86e9-7daf9ac765d4', 'multiverseId': 444703}, 'multiverseid': 444703}, {'name': 'Renascer Glorioso dos Primevos', 'text': '(Você só pode conjurar um feitiço lendário se controlar uma criatura lendária ou um planeswalker lendário.)\\nDevolva todos os cards de permanente lendários de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.', 'type': 'Feitiço Lendário', 'flavor': 'Séculos atrás, cinco dragões venceram a morte para governar os vivos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444972&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf74e48c-e7ba-481c-b0de-8412856fbbb0', 'multiverseId': 444972}, 'multiverseid': 444972}, {'name': 'Славное Возрождение Первозданных', 'text': '(Вы можете разыгрывать легендарное волшебство, только если контролируете легендарное существо или planeswalker-а.)\\nВерните все карты легендарных перманентов из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.', 'type': 'Легендарное Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Много веков назад пятеро драконов победили смерть, чтобы править над живыми.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445241&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a46f790-7475-4f82-9d65-0cc4c8760597', 'multiverseId': 445241}, 'multiverseid': 445241}, {'name': '太古诸龙的辉煌重生', 'text': '（只能于你操控传奇生物或鹏洛客时施放传奇法术。）\\n将所有传奇永久物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。', 'type': '传奇法术', 'flavor': '数世纪前，五位龙王征服死亡统治众生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445510&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12ca6138-a023-4f9b-b9cb-c92e97ff7c28', 'multiverseId': 445510}, 'multiverseid': 445510}, {'name': '太古諸龍的輝煌重生', 'text': '（只能於你操控傳奇生物或鵬洛客時施放傳奇巫術。）\\n將所有傳奇永久物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。', 'type': '傳奇巫術', 'flavor': '數世紀前，五位龍王征服死亡統治眾生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445779&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'efd3e195-e728-49a7-990f-5e2d3e29ed2a', 'multiverseId': 445779}, 'multiverseid': 445779}]", "[{'name': 'Die Erste Eruption', 'text': '(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Die Erste Eruption fügt jeder nichtfliegenden Kreatur 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nII — Erzeuge {R}{R}.\\nIII — Opfere ein Gebirge. Falls du dies tust, fügt die Erste Eruption jeder Kreatur 3 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Sage', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443279&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1e8268f-a767-4d82-861a-81bcb6102b28', 'multiverseId': 443279}, 'multiverseid': 443279}, {'name': 'La primera erupción', 'text': '(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — La primera erupción hace 1 punto de daño a cada criatura sin la habilidad de volar.\\nII — Agrega {R}{R}.\\nIII — Sacrifica una Montaña. Si lo haces, La primera erupción hace 3 puntos de daño a cada criatura.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443548&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f90786d7-c4d2-48c1-885c-65dbf97fd364', 'multiverseId': 443548}, 'multiverseid': 443548}, {'name': 'La première éruption', 'text': '(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — La première éruption inflige 1 blessure à chaque créature sans le vol.\\nII — Ajoutez {R}{R}.\\nIII — Sacrifiez une montagne. Si vous faites ainsi, La première éruption inflige 3 blessures à chaque créature.', 'type': 'Enchantement : saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443817&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c4a4397-1b8e-4337-bc9e-bb3a06f50b80', 'multiverseId': 443817}, 'multiverseid': 443817}, {'name': 'La Prima Eruzione', 'text': '(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — La Prima Eruzione infligge 1 danno a ogni creatura senza volare.\\nII — Aggiungi {R}{R}.\\nIII — Sacrifica una Montagna. Se lo fai, La Prima Eruzione infligge 3 danni a ogni creatura.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444086&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00702e15-b2f8-4901-b7c4-781e763597b6', 'multiverseId': 444086}, 'multiverseid': 444086}, {'name': '最初の噴火', 'text': '（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― 最初の噴火は、飛行を持たない各クリーチャーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\nII ― {R}{R}を加える。\\nIII ― 山１つを生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、最初の噴火は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ３点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'エンチャント — 英雄譚', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444355&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e55d388e-05eb-44e0-8989-6dee835ef3e4', 'multiverseId': 444355}, 'multiverseid': 444355}, {'name': '최초의 분출', 'text': '(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. III 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI — 최초의 분출은 비행이 없는 각 생물에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\\nII — {R}{R}를 추가한다.\\nIII — 산 한 개를 희생한다. 그렇게 한다면, 최초의 분출은 각 생물에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 서사시', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444624&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '176aadd7-4240-487f-a05d-8221cd7bb7b5', 'multiverseId': 444624}, 'multiverseid': 444624}, {'name': 'A Primeira Erupção', 'text': '(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — A Primeira Erupção causa 1 ponto de dano a cada criatura sem voar.\\nII — Adicione {R}{R}.\\nIII — Sacrifique uma Montanha. Se fizer isso, A Primeira Erupção causará 3 pontos de dano a cada criatura.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444893&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10fe39b9-62a5-467e-9473-e7c840a95cea', 'multiverseId': 444893}, 'multiverseid': 444893}, {'name': 'Первое Извержение', 'text': '(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после III.)\\nI — Первое Извержение наносит 1 повреждение каждому существу без Полета.\\nII — Добавьте {R}{R}.\\nIII — Пожертвуйте Гору. Если вы это делаете, Первое Извержение наносит 3 повреждения каждому существу.', 'type': 'Чары — Сага', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445162&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e64a8070-654f-4938-9d5b-81b773037e6a', 'multiverseId': 445162}, 'multiverseid': 445162}, {'name': '创世涌动', 'text': '（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 创世涌动对每个不具飞行异能的生物各造成1点伤害。\\nII — 加{R}{R}。\\nIII — 牺牲一个山脉。如果你如此作，则创世涌动对每个生物各造成3点伤害。', 'type': '结界 ～传纪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445431&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c382931-de4a-4399-a234-6d4aac9edffe', 'multiverseId': 445431}, 'multiverseid': 445431}, {'name': '創世湧動', 'text': '（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到III後犧牲之。）\\nI — 創世湧動對每個不具飛行異能的生物各造成1點傷害。\\nII — 加{R}{R}。\\nIII — 犧牲一個山脈。如果你如此作，則創世湧動對每個生物各造成3點傷害。', 'type': '結界 ～傳紀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445700&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68fcc7af-c97f-4b9b-ae85-0e6f515c452a', 'multiverseId': 445700}, 'multiverseid': 445700}]", "[{'name': 'Die Flamme von Keld', 'text': '(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Wirf alle Karten aus deiner Hand ab.\\nII — Ziehe zwei Karten.\\nIII — Falls eine rote Quelle, die du kontrollierst, einer bleibenden Karte oder einem Spieler in diesem Zug Schaden zufügen würde, fügt sie stattdessen so viele Schadenspunkte plus 2 zu.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Sage', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443280&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2b0add5-345e-464c-b3dc-56346fcfab49', 'multiverseId': 443280}, 'multiverseid': 443280}, {'name': 'La Llama de Keld', 'text': '(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Descarta tu mano.\\nII — Roba dos cartas.\\nIII — Si una fuente roja que controlas fuera a hacer daño a un permanente o jugador este turno, en vez de eso, hace esa misma cantidad de daño más 2 a ese permanente o jugador.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443549&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ff68d03-f5b3-478f-bcf3-275d0addb7f3', 'multiverseId': 443549}, 'multiverseid': 443549}, {'name': 'La Flamme de Keld', 'text': '(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Défaussez-vous de votre main.\\nII — Piochez deux cartes.\\nIII — Si une source rouge que vous contrôlez devait infliger des blessures à un permanent ou à un joueur ce tour-ci, elle inflige autant de blessures plus 2 à ce permanent ou à ce joueur à la place.', 'type': 'Enchantement : saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443818&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e495b52-ee76-440c-aaa6-4d552ba963c8', 'multiverseId': 443818}, 'multiverseid': 443818}, {'name': 'La Fiamma di Keld', 'text': '(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Scarta la tua mano.\\nII — Pesca due carte.\\nIII — Se una fonte rossa che controlli sta per infliggere danno a un permanente o a un giocatore in questo turno, infligge invece altrettanti danni più 2 a quel permanente o giocatore.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444087&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '839aa24f-d87c-41d8-8836-ff8ace878ccd', 'multiverseId': 444087}, 'multiverseid': 444087}, {'name': 'ケルドの炎', 'text': '（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― あなたの手札を捨てる。\\nII ― カードを２枚引く。\\nIII ― このターン、あなたがコントロールしている赤の発生源がパーマネントかプレイヤーにダメージを与えるなら、代わりに、それはそのパーマネントやプレイヤーに、その点数に２を足した点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'エンチャント — 英雄譚', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444356&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a2ab788-a223-4e77-b0b8-ef3ec943c3c6', 'multiverseId': 444356}, 'multiverseid': 444356}, {'name': '켈드의 불길', 'text': '(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. III 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI — 당신의 손을 버린다.\\nII — 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\\nIII — 당신이 조종하는 적색 원천이 이번 턴에 지속물이나 플레이어에게 피해를 입히려 한다면, 대신에 그 피해에 2를 더한 만큼의 피해를 입힌다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 서사시', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444625&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b3bb6f2-ad05-4b4b-bd40-132e9b93378c', 'multiverseId': 444625}, 'multiverseid': 444625}, {'name': 'A Chama de Keld', 'text': '(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Descarte sua mão.\\nII — Compre dois cards.\\nIII — Se uma fonte vermelha sob seu controle causaria dano a uma permanente ou jogador neste turno, ela causa, em vez disso, aquela quantidade de dano mais 2 àquela permanente ou jogador.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444894&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea23a7a1-73b3-483a-bef1-d33f182b72a7', 'multiverseId': 444894}, 'multiverseid': 444894}, {'name': 'Огонь Келда', 'text': '(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после III.)\\nI — Сбросьте вашу руку.\\nII — Возьмите две карты.\\nIII — Если красный источник под вашим контролем должен нанести повреждения перманенту или игроку в этом ходу, вместо этого он наносит тому перманенту или игроку на 2 повреждения больше.', 'type': 'Чары — Сага', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445163&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ba62c83-ea20-4930-b5bd-d6b896c587dc', 'multiverseId': 445163}, 'multiverseid': 445163}, {'name': '凯尔顿源火', 'text': '（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 弃掉你的手牌。\\nII — 抓两张牌。\\nIII — 本回合中，如果某个由你操控的红色来源将对任一永久物或牌手造成伤害，则改为它对该永久物或牌手造成原数量加2点伤害。', 'type': '结界 ～传纪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445432&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58a38040-21cf-4062-8a4d-2ae182a43941', 'multiverseId': 445432}, 'multiverseid': 445432}, {'name': '凱爾頓源火', 'text': '（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到III後犧牲之。）\\nI — 棄掉你的手牌。\\nII — 抽兩張牌。\\nIII — 本回合中，如果某個由你操控的紅色來源將對任一永久物或玩家造成傷害，則改為它對該永久物或玩家造成原數量加2點傷害。', 'type': '結界 ～傳紀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445701&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b471934-7040-4019-a99a-c4e0d6591a82', 'multiverseId': 445701}, 'multiverseid': 445701}]", '[{\'name\': \'Die Kavallerie rufen\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge zwei 2/2 weiße Ritter-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Wachsamkeit.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Benalische Bürger, die unter derselben Sternenkonstellation geboren werden, teilen sich einen Sternenklan. Ihre Loyalität untereinander verbindet die Sieben Häuser.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443166&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c963a546-d355-4652-9c62-dfd3aab685c1\', \'multiverseId\': 443166}, \'multiverseid\': 443166}, {\'name\': \'Llamar a la caballería\', \'text\': \'Crea dos fichas de criatura Caballero blancas 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los ciudadanos benalitas nacidos bajo la misma constelación comparten clan astral, y la lealtad que les une entrelaza las Siete Casas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7e025de-8801-4a6b-a8e9-a9b44eb4213d\', \'multiverseId\': 443435}, \'multiverseid\': 443435}, {\'name\': \'Appel de la cavalerie\', \'text\': \'Créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 blanche Chevalier avec la vigilance.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les citoyens bénalians nés sous une même constellation appartiennent au même clan stellaire. Leur loyauté s\'entrelace avec celle des Sept Maisons.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443704&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e08f513-a128-4dda-8108-c4866f377241\', \'multiverseId\': 443704}, \'multiverseid\': 443704}, {\'name\': \'Convocare la Cavalleria\', \'text\': \'Crea due pedine creatura Cavaliere 2/2 bianche con cautela.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli abitanti di Benalia nati sotto la stessa costellazione appartengono a un unico clan astrale. La loro lealtà reciproca è il legame che intreccia le Sette Case tra loro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4e7233b-28af-456f-98ae-10051d47d0ba\', \'multiverseId\': 443973}, \'multiverseid\': 443973}, {\'name\': \'騎兵呼集\', \'text\': \'警戒を持つ白の２/２の騎士・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'同じ星座の下に生まれたベナリアの市民は星族を構成する。星族間の忠誠が、七侯家を織りなしている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38ac5d2a-5c93-477a-a798-75cacd155579\', \'multiverseId\': 444242}, \'multiverseid\': 444242}, {\'name\': \'기병대 호출\', \'text\': \'경계를 가진 2/2 백색 기사 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'같은 별자리 아래에서 태어난 베날리아 시민들은 성족을 공유한다. 서로를 향한 그들의 충성심은 7대 가문에 걸쳐 얽혀 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ecb6e4b-afe9-4011-8978-518fdea1d519\', \'multiverseId\': 444511}, \'multiverseid\': 444511}, {\'name\': \'Chamar a Cavalaria\', \'text\': \'Crie duas fichas de criatura branca 2/2 do tipo Cavaleiro com vigilância.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os cidadãos de Benália nascidos sob a mesma constelação formam um clã das estrelas. Sua lealdade uns aos outros perpassa as Sete Casas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1ba723f-a7c7-4e57-b77e-b425488a6908\', \'multiverseId\': 444780}, \'multiverseid\': 444780}, {\'name\': \'Призыв Кавалерии\', \'text\': \'Создайте две фишки существа 2/2 белый Рыцарь с Бдительностью.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Беналийцы, рожденные под одним и тем же созвездием, входят в один звездный клан. Их верность друг другу тесно переплетается с верностью Семи Домам.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c6528d7-c6d1-40ed-959e-7c62cbbb9c45\', \'multiverseId\': 445049}, \'multiverseid\': 445049}, {\'name\': \'召集骑队\', \'text\': \'派出两个2/2白色，具警戒异能的骑士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'同属一个星座的宾纳里亚人归于同一星族。彼此间的忠诚与七大家族的关系互相交织。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8c5faf6-0e95-412c-af1e-87d504a0d06a\', \'multiverseId\': 445318}, \'multiverseid\': 445318}, {\'name\': \'召集騎隊\', \'text\': \'派出兩個2/2白色，具警戒異能的騎士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'同個星座的賓納里亞人歸屬同一星族。彼此間的忠誠與七大家族的關係互相交織。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f2f4927-eddb-43af-9609-2865222ae967\', \'multiverseId\': 445587}, \'multiverseid\': 445587}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Mirari-Hypothese\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Bringe eine Spontanzauberkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nII — Bringe eine Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nIII — Immer wenn du bis zum Ende des Zuges einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, kopiere ihn bzw. sie. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443214&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0ac46ac-1692-48a2-aded-f8e4cfbd8b1a\', \'multiverseId\': 443214}, \'multiverseid\': 443214}, {\'name\': \'La conjetura del Mirari\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Regresa la carta de instantáneo objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nII — Regresa la carta de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nIII — Hasta el final del turno, siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, cópialo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a634add8-73fb-477e-b013-683c425a20e3\', \'multiverseId\': 443483}, \'multiverseid\': 443483}, {\'name\': \'La conjecture du Mirari\', \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Renvoyez une carte d\'éphémère ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nII — Renvoyez une carte de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nIII — Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, à chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, copiez-le. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443752&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0432175c-4811-46ef-b387-92f013862cd5\', \'multiverseId\': 443752}, \'multiverseid\': 443752}, {\'name\': \'Congettura sul Mirari\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Riprendi in mano una carta istantaneo bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\nII — Riprendi in mano una carta stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\nIII — Fino alla fine del turno, ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, copiala. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e80b8166-61b5-4c00-bf55-03a9bfff51fa\', \'multiverseId\': 444021}, \'multiverseid\': 444021}, {\'name\': \'ミラーリ予想\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― あなたの墓地からインスタント・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\nII ― あなたの墓地からソーサリー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\nIII ― ターン終了時まで、あなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、それをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7717a1f9-ac50-4b2e-9a51-6bd0a3854512\', \'multiverseId\': 444290}, \'multiverseid\': 444290}, {\'name\': \'미라리의 예측\', \'text\': \'(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. III 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI — 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\\nII — 당신의 무덤에 있는 집중마법 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\\nIII — 턴종료까지, 당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 그 주문을 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본의 목표를 새로 정할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 서사시\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f8cea0f-521c-4ce1-87ee-21ec62cc2801\', \'multiverseId\': 444559}, \'multiverseid\': 444559}, {\'name\': \'A Conjectura do Mirari\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Devolva o card de mágica instantânea alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\nII — Devolva o card de feitiço alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\nIII — Até o final do turno, toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, copie-o. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8afdeb9-5d8c-48a8-a4bf-69dc125862eb\', \'multiverseId\': 444828}, \'multiverseid\': 444828}, {\'name\': \'Гипотеза о Мирари\', \'text\': \'(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после III.)\\nI — Верните целевую карту мгновенного заклинания из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\nII — Верните целевую карту волшебства из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\nIII — До конца хода, каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, скопируйте его. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Сага\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1275dded-610b-4b2c-b689-02532d05d1c6\', \'multiverseId\': 445097}, \'multiverseid\': 445097}, {\'name\': \'映奇宝珠探究\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 将目标瞬间牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\nII — 将目标法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\nIII — 直到回合结束，每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，将其复制。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f2d018d-661f-436a-ab6c-bebf5a7e0a22\', \'multiverseId\': 445366}, \'multiverseid\': 445366}, {\'name\': \'映奇寶珠探究\', \'text\': \'（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到III後犧牲之。）\\nI — 將目標瞬間牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\\nII — 將目標巫術牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\\nIII — 直到回合結束，每當你施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，將其複製。你可以為該複製品選擇新的目標。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～傳紀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f2f3968-9095-4838-a495-8acfaf58ace6\', \'multiverseId\': 445635}, \'multiverseid\': 445635}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Wiedergeburt des Ältesten\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Jeder Gegner opfert eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker.\\nII — Jeder Gegner wirft eine Karte ab.\\nIII — Bringe eine Kreaturen- oder Planeswalkerkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443247&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6ddd398-6ea8-4cb3-973c-a54626c1e3f0\', \'multiverseId\': 443247}, \'multiverseid\': 443247}, {\'name\': \'El gran anciano renacido\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Cada oponente sacrifica una criatura o un planeswalker.\\nII — Cada oponente descarta una carta.\\nIII — Pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control la carta de criatura o planeswalker objetivo de un cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa0897b2-4546-4c48-9e5a-8aa7d6a8514f\', \'multiverseId\': 443516}, \'multiverseid\': 443516}, {\'name\': "La Renaissance de l\'aîné", \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature ou un planeswalker.\\nII — Chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte.\\nIII — Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ou de planeswalker ciblée depuis un cimetière.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443785&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01847122-1395-494a-9802-dafbeabca7fe\', \'multiverseId\': 443785}, \'multiverseid\': 443785}, {\'name\': "Rinascita dell\'Antico", \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Ogni avversario sacrifica una creatura o un planeswalker.\\nII — Ogni avversario scarta una carta.\\nIII — Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura o planeswalker bersaglio da un cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e438600-1f1a-44c3-b8bb-4d8ac20d12a8\', \'multiverseId\': 444054}, \'multiverseid\': 444054}, {\'name\': \'最古再誕\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― 各対戦相手はそれぞれクリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nII ― 各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。\\nIII ― 墓地からクリーチャーかプレインズウォーカーであるカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'936ae9ea-a3bf-4261-b1ef-e8a2702716fa\', \'multiverseId\': 444323}, \'multiverseid\': 444323}, {\'name\': \'가장 오래된 재탄생\', \'text\': \'(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. III 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI — 각 상대는 생물 또는 플레인즈워커 한 개를 희생한다.\\nII — 각 상대는 카드 한 장을 버린다.\\nIII — 무덤에 있는 생물 또는 플레인즈워커 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 조종하에 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 서사시\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eda7f95-06ff-4f4f-b446-fe77e3bea9d6\', \'multiverseId\': 444592}, \'multiverseid\': 444592}, {\'name\': \'O Ancião Renascido\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Cada oponente sacrifica uma criatura ou um planeswalker.\\nII — Cada oponente descarta um card.\\nIII — Coloque o card de criatura ou planeswalker alvo de um cemitério no campo de batalha sob o seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eae874ac-cfee-4765-be9d-89155e6e451f\', \'multiverseId\': 444861}, \'multiverseid\': 444861}, {\'name\': \'Перерождение Древнейшего\', \'text\': \'(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после III.)\\nI — Каждый оппонент жертвует существо или planeswalker-а.\\nII — Каждый оппонент сбрасывает карту.\\nIII — Положите целевую карту существа или planeswalker-а из кладбища на поле битвы под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Сага\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'255563e1-60aa-45d4-9523-33814061d2a0\', \'multiverseId\': 445130}, \'multiverseid\': 445130}, {\'name\': \'恶源重生\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 每位对手各牺牲一个生物或鹏洛客。\\nII — 每位对手各弃一张牌。\\nIII — 将目标生物或鹏洛客牌在你的操控下从坟墓场放进战场。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aff065d8-5fb7-42cc-9cae-8314b02031c7\', \'multiverseId\': 445399}, \'multiverseid\': 445399}, {\'name\': \'惡源重生\', \'text\': \'（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到III後犧牲之。）\\nI — 每位對手各犧牲一個生物或鵬洛客。\\nII — 每位對手各棄一張牌。\\nIII — 將目標生物或鵬洛客牌在你的操控下從墳墓場放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～傳紀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94a50f14-c25a-4cfe-9cea-68d7a9363f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 445668}, \'multiverseid\': 445668}]', "[{'name': 'Die Wiederherstellung Dominarias', 'text': '(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI, II — Lege die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof. Dann kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\\nIII — Bringe alle Länderkarten aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück und mische dann deinen Friedhof in deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Sage', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443330&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65df82d7-079b-46b4-bea7-ab38b3fd93ac', 'multiverseId': 443330}, 'multiverseid': 443330}, {'name': 'La Reparación de Dominaria', 'text': '(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI, II — Pon las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio. Luego, puedes regresar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nIII — Regresa todas las cartas de tierra de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Luego, baraja tu cementerio en tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443599&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0adfec89-0570-4e3e-9337-406cd22c7e52', 'multiverseId': 443599}, 'multiverseid': 443599}, {'name': 'La Restauration de Dominaria', 'text': '(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI, II — Mettez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière, puis vous pouvez renvoyer une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nIII — Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes de terrain depuis votre cimetière, puis mélangez votre cimetière dans votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Enchantement : saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443868&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a58fd70c-0b94-4832-8b55-86bda28fc1a8', 'multiverseId': 443868}, 'multiverseid': 443868}, {'name': 'La Riparazione di Dominaria', 'text': '(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI, II — Metti nel tuo cimitero le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi puoi riprendere in mano una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero.\\nIII — Rimetti sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte terra dal tuo cimitero, poi rimescola il tuo cimitero nel tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444137&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b3fb6e2-7349-4ae4-b97d-82476368856d', 'multiverseId': 444137}, 'multiverseid': 444137}, {'name': 'ドミナリアの大修復', 'text': '（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI, II ― あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚あなたの墓地に置く。その後、あなたはあなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\\nIII ― あなたの墓地から土地・カードをすべて戦場に戻す。その後、あなたの墓地をあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — 英雄譚', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444406&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33431662-b658-45dd-bbc0-983376b0c95f', 'multiverseId': 444406}, 'multiverseid': 444406}, {'name': '도미나리아의 수복', 'text': '(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. III 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI, II — 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 두 장을 당신의 무덤에 넣은 후, 당신은 당신의 무덤에서 생물 카드 한 장을 당신의 손으로 되돌릴 수 있다.\\nIII — 당신의 무덤에 있는 모든 대지 카드를 전장으로 되돌린 후, 당신의 무덤을 당신의 서고에 섞어 넣는다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 서사시', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444675&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11529c65-f687-492c-8dc5-eb2fe312ec75', 'multiverseId': 444675}, 'multiverseid': 444675}, {'name': 'A Emenda de Dominária', 'text': '(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI, II — Coloque os dois cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério. Depois, você pode devolver um card de criatura de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\nIII — Devolva todos os cards de terreno de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha e depois embaralhe seu cemitério em seu grimório.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444944&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e3f67fc-ad5c-4c1e-9936-240c51b3be62', 'multiverseId': 444944}, 'multiverseid': 444944}, {'name': 'Исцеление Доминарии', 'text': '(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после III.)\\nI, II — Положите две верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище, затем вы можете вернуть карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\nIII — Верните все карты земель из вашего кладбища на поле битвы, затем втасуйте ваше кладбище в вашу библиотеку.', 'type': 'Чары — Сага', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445213&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1df61bf5-df1b-4f5b-b328-05eb54e44a41', 'multiverseId': 445213}, 'multiverseid': 445213}, {'name': '多明纳里亚愈合', 'text': '（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI, II — 将你牌库顶的两张牌置入你的坟墓场，然后你可以将一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\nIII — 将所有地牌从你的坟墓场移回战场，然后将你的坟墓场洗入你的牌库。', 'type': '结界 ～传纪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445482&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6733bf71-b1ed-4284-92f3-13d74a224ba3', 'multiverseId': 445482}, 'multiverseid': 445482}, {'name': '多明納里亞癒合', 'text': '（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到III後犧牲之。）\\nI, II — 將你牌庫頂的兩張牌置入你的墳墓場，然後你可以將一張生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\\nIII — 將所有地牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場，然後將你的墳墓場洗入你的牌庫。', 'type': '結界 ～傳紀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445751&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a879d3f7-2e48-4bd5-801f-b88e1a754c38', 'multiverseId': 445751}, 'multiverseid': 445751}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dornenelementar\', \'text\': \'Du kannst das Dornenelementar seinen Kampfschaden zuweisen lassen, als ob es nicht geblockt worden wäre.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Das Hacken von Feuerholz kann Leben retten. In Yavimaya kann es das Leben kosten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443342&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6babcf54-3d9b-4689-b072-17d83e0f74ec\', \'multiverseId\': 443342}, \'multiverseid\': 443342}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de espinas\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que el Elemental de espinas haga su daño de combate como si no hubiera sido bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'La primera ley de Yavimaya es que los invitados solo tienen permitido matar para sobrevivir. Como no es necesario encender ningún fuego en el clima cálido, cortar árboles significa la muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ae4d2a9-2415-4474-8ba0-4edcdc2f478c\', \'multiverseId\': 443611}, \'multiverseid\': 443611}, {\'name\': "Élémental d\'épines", \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que l\'Élémental d\'épines attribue ses blessures de combat comme s\'il n\'était pas bloqué.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "D\'après la première loi de la Yavimaya, les invités ne peuvent tuer que pour survivre. Comme les feux ne sont pas nécessaires par temps chaud, couper des arbres pour avoir du bois signifie la mort.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443880&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41292e54-6f17-4a0f-be5a-e6d304d54acf\', \'multiverseId\': 443880}, \'multiverseid\': 443880}, {\'name\': \'Elementale Spinato\', \'text\': "Puoi far assegnare dall\'Elementale Spinato il suo danno da combattimento come se non fosse bloccato.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'La prima legge di Yavimaya prevede che gli ospiti possano uccidere solo per sopravvivere. I fuochi sono superflui nel suo clima temperato, quindi tagliare alberi per la legna equivale a morire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'944e702c-3260-49a8-8432-b1d99d3ff0e0\', \'multiverseId\': 444149}, \'multiverseid\': 444149}, {\'name\': \'茨の精霊\', \'text\': \'あなたは茨の精霊の戦闘ダメージを、これがブロックされなかったかのように割り振ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'ヤヴィマヤの第一の掟は、外来者は生きるためにのみ命を奪ってもよい、ということだ。気候が温暖で火は必要不可欠とは言えず、木を切る行為は死に値する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2f662bd-ce46-46d8-a376-8e85cd24a6c8\', \'multiverseId\': 444418}, \'multiverseid\': 444418}, {\'name\': \'가시 정령\', \'text\': \'당신은 가시 정령의 전투피해를 가시 정령이 방어되지 않은 것처럼 배정할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': \'야비마야의 첫 번째 법은 손님은 오직 살아남기 위해서만 다른 생명을 빼앗을 수 있다는 것이다. 따스한 날에는 불이 필요하지 않으므로, 장작으로 쓰기 위해 나무를 자른다는 것은 곧 죽음을 뜻한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52ea83c6-3fa7-4d80-b67c-e1d379c607f8\', \'multiverseId\': 444687}, \'multiverseid\': 444687}, {\'name\': \'Elemental dos Espinhos\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Elemental dos Espinhos atribua seu dano de combate como se não tivesse sido bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'A primeira regra de Yavimaya é a de que os hóspedes só podem matar para sobreviver. Como fogueiras não são necessárias no clima quente, cortar árvores para obter lenha significa a morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'049946b6-c6e0-4cdc-b786-a1ef8d2d4575\', \'multiverseId\': 444956}, \'multiverseid\': 444956}, {\'name\': \'Элементаль Колючек\', \'text\': \'Вы можете заставить Элементаля Колючек распределить его боевые повреждения, как если бы он не был заблокирован.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'Первый закон Явимайи гласит, что гости вправе убивать лишь для того, чтобы выжить. В теплом климате костры не нужны, и поэтому срубившего дерево на дрова ждет смерть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72b41832-5fde-4283-b43c-b7612838d8a1\', \'multiverseId\': 445225}, \'multiverseid\': 445225}, {\'name\': \'刺棘元素\', \'text\': \'你可以让刺棘元素如同未受阻挡地分配战斗伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': \'亚维马雅的首要法则，是来客只能为了生存而杀生。由于在温暖的气候下无需生火，所以伐木砍柴是死罪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72457384-b28c-438e-bbc1-8820a098e0f3\', \'multiverseId\': 445494}, \'multiverseid\': 445494}, {\'name\': \'刺棘元素\', \'text\': \'你可以讓刺棘元素如同未受阻擋地分配戰鬥傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': \'亞維馬雅的首要法則，是來客只能為了生存而殺生。由於在溫暖的氣候下無需生火，所以伐木砍柴是死罪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'122cf436-49e3-4868-b3df-42b11b8a3439\', \'multiverseId\': 445763}, \'multiverseid\': 445763}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durchtrennte Bande\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl. Du kannst eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann es nicht ertragen, eine weitere Welt zerbrechen zu sehen, solange meine eigene Heimat in Scherben liegt. Verzeiht mir, doch ich kann nicht länger Wache halten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443314&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ecb2ee1-f38e-4f0c-b80a-b5a4a8d6eb5a\', \'multiverseId\': 443314}, \'multiverseid\': 443314}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo roto\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"No soporto ver otro plano hecho trizas antes de reconstruir mi propio hogar. Lo siento, pero mi guardia terminó".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'639f652c-7d68-4fd0-8997-797f9885476a\', \'multiverseId\': 443583}, \'multiverseid\': 443583}, {\'name\': \'Lien brisé\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain de votre main.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne supporterai pas de voir un autre plan brisé avant que je n\'aie pu rebâtir le mien. Je suis désolée, mais j\'en ai terminé avec les Sentinelles. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443852&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f894a4be-b074-4a30-9a05-28d4412341e8\', \'multiverseId\': 443852}, \'multiverseid\': 443852}, {\'name\': \'Legame Spezzato\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio. Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non posso sopportare di vedere un altro piano devastato prima di aver risanato la mia terra. Mi spiace, ma devo abbandonarvi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce519224-19d9-48ea-86ff-30c613c648e3\', \'multiverseId\': 444121}, \'multiverseid\': 444121}, {\'name\': \'壊れた絆\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。あなたは、あなたの手札から土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「自分の故郷も再建できていないうちに、別の次元が壊れていくのを見ていられないの。申し訳ないけど、私はゲートウォッチを辞めるわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7e62e3b-7868-4225-80e9-c76f803eadf9\', \'multiverseId\': 444390}, \'multiverseid\': 444390}, {\'name\': \'깨진 유대\', \'text\': \'마법물체나 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다. 당신은 당신의 손에서 대지 카드 한 장을 전장에 놓을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"내 고향이 온전해지기도 전에 또 다른 차원이 파괴되는 것을 견딜 수 없어. 미안하지만, 내 수호는 이것으로 끝이야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4a4ee9e-b7a6-4e57-85b6-f62270817d1c\', \'multiverseId\': 444659}, \'multiverseid\': 444659}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo Quebrado\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo. Você pode colocar um card de terreno de sua mão no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Não consigo suportar ver outro plano destruído antes mesmo de conseguir reconstruir o meu. Desculpem, mas não sou mais uma sentinela."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e217f06a-f901-4fa4-8de4-fdbc556bd95d\', \'multiverseId\': 444928}, \'multiverseid\': 444928}, {\'name\': \'Разорванные Узы\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или чары. Вы можете положить карту земли из вашей руки на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не вынесу вида еще одного сломленного мира, когда так и не исцелила свой собственный дом. Простите меня... моя стража окончена».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86dffd83-bc42-4fbb-9979-c21dfac1afec\', \'multiverseId\': 445197}, \'multiverseid\': 445197}, {\'name\': \'缘尽而去\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器或结界。你可以将一张地牌从你手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我还没有完全修复自己的家园，却又见到另一个时空四分五裂。我不忍再这样下去。抱歉，我的守护到此为止。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'984cd3cd-9fe7-4073-afc0-42980fd21ac7\', \'multiverseId\': 445466}, \'multiverseid\': 445466}, {\'name\': \'緣盡而去\', \'text\': \'消滅目標神器或結界。你可以將一張地牌從你手上放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我還沒有完全修復自己的家園，卻又見到另一個時空四分五裂。我不忍再這樣下去。抱歉，我的守護到此為止。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ae65bd0-06ab-4dae-a09f-8de4fb35e310\', \'multiverseId\': 445735}, \'multiverseid\': 445735}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämonenfürst Belzenlok\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn Dämonenfürst Belzenlok ins Spiel kommt, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Karte ins Exil schickst, die kein Land ist, und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Falls ihre umgewandelten Manakosten 4 oder mehr betragen, wiederhole diesen Vorgang. Der Dämonenfürst Belzenlok fügt dir für jede Karte, die du auf diese Weise auf deine Hand genommen hast, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443243&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbd6df77-d524-4523-be9e-9c640172077a\', \'multiverseId\': 443243}, \'multiverseid\': 443243}, {\'name\': \'Belzenlok, señor demonio\', \'text\': \'Vuela, arrolla.\\nCuando Belzenlok, señor demonio entre al campo de batalla, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra. Luego, pon esa carta en tu mano. Si el coste de maná convertido de la carta es 4 o más, repite este proceso. Belzenlok, señor demonio te hace 1 punto de daño por cada carta puesta en tu mano de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Demonio anciano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'592d949b-1617-4967-82fd-768534f4ead8\', \'multiverseId\': 443512}, \'multiverseid\': 443512}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur démon Belzenlok\', \'text\': "Vol, piétinement\\nQuand le Seigneur démon Belzenlok arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain, puis mettez cette carte dans votre main. Si le coût converti de mana de la carte est supérieur ou égal à 4, répétez ce processus. Le Seigneur démon Belzenlok vous inflige 1 blessure pour chaque carte mise dans votre main de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ancêtre et démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443781&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80fbe7b1-d822-43bd-a5a3-2d9017a31ea2\', \'multiverseId\': 443781}, \'multiverseid\': 443781}, {\'name\': \'Belzenlok, Signore dei Demoni\', \'text\': \'Volare, travolgere\\nQuando Belzenlok, Signore dei Demoni entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra, poi aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano. Se il costo di mana convertito della carta è pari o superiore a 4, ripeti questo procedimento. Belzenlok, Signore dei Demoni ti infligge 1 danno per ogni carta aggiunta alla tua mano in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Antico Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ddd5b8c-ab92-47d9-b7c0-8c2f33229b34\', \'multiverseId\': 444050}, \'multiverseid\': 444050}, {\'name\': \'悪魔王ベルゼンロック\', \'text\': \'飛行、トランプル\\n悪魔王ベルゼンロックが戦場に出たとき、土地でないカードが追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ追放する。その後、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。そのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストが４以上なら、この手順を繰り返す。悪魔王ベルゼンロックはあなたに、これによりあなたの手札に加えられたカード１枚につき１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07967d50-d614-402b-8a49-28d0c00a7211\', \'multiverseId\': 444319}, \'multiverseid\': 444319}, {\'name\': \'악마군주 벨젠로크\', \'text\': \'비행, 돌진\\n악마군주 벨젠로크가 전장에 들어올 때, 대지가 아닌 카드를 추방할 때까지 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드들을 추방한 후, 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 가져온다. 그 카드의 전환마나비용이 4 이상이라면, 이 과정을 반복한다. 이렇게 당신의 손으로 가져온 카드 한 장당 악마군주 벨젠로크는 당신에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 장로 악마\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20e470a1-4855-4a77-a365-317e1b1bdacb\', \'multiverseId\': 444588}, \'multiverseid\': 444588}, {\'name\': \'Senhor Demônio Belzenlok\', \'text\': \'Voar, atropelar\\nQuando Senhor Demônio Belzenlok entrar no campo de batalha, exile cards do topo de seu grimório até exilar um card que não seja de terreno; depois, coloque aquele card em sua mão. Se o custo de mana convertido do card for igual ou superior a 4, repita este processo. Senhor Demônio Belzenlok causa 1 ponto de dano a você para cada card colocado em sua mão desta forma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Ancião Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd971535-dc39-4758-b665-c0c26204f492\', \'multiverseId\': 444857}, \'multiverseid\': 444857}, {\'name\': \'Демон-Владыка Бельзенлок\', \'text\': \'Полет, Пробивной удар\\nКогда Демон-Владыка Бельзенлок выходит на поле битвы, изгоняйте карты с верха вашей библиотеки, пока не изгоните не являющуюся землей карту, затем положите ту карту в вашу руку. Если конвертированная мана-стоимость той карты равна 4 или больше, повторите этот процесс. Демон-Владыка Бельзенлок наносит вам 1 повреждение за каждую карту, положенную в вашу руку таким образом.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Старейшина Демон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56614ef6-4423-4285-9f6a-c1b14ad93648\', \'multiverseId\': 445126}, \'multiverseid\': 445126}, {\'name\': \'恶魔领主贝赞洛\', \'text\': \'飞行，践踏\\n当恶魔领主贝赞洛进战场时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张非地牌为止，然后将该牌置于你手上。若该牌的总法术力费用等于或大于4，则重复此流程。每以此法将一张牌置于你手上，恶魔领主贝赞洛便对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～长老／恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2128d88a-8e6d-4a75-830f-589fdd899c84\', \'multiverseId\': 445395}, \'multiverseid\': 445395}, {\'name\': \'惡魔領主貝贊洛\', \'text\': \'飛行，踐踏\\n當惡魔領主貝贊洛進戰場時，從你的牌庫頂開始放逐牌，直到放逐一張非地牌為止，然後將該牌置於你手上。若該牌的總魔法力費用等於或大於4，則重複此流程。每以此法將一張牌置於你手上，惡魔領主貝贊洛便對你造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～長老／惡魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20d1fce8-dc18-44d6-9f96-fd80f7995674\', \'multiverseId\': 445664}, \'multiverseid\': 445664}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämonische Lebenskraft\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1.\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur stirbt, bringe ihre Karte auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Bei den Kabbalisten ist der Tod nur ein weiteres Zeichen ihrer Ergebenheit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443242&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad310cc3-1c83-4e96-a7df-5d701ea8f806\', \'multiverseId\': 443242}, \'multiverseid\': 443242}, {\'name\': \'Vigor demoníaco\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1.\\nCuando la criatura encantada muera, regresa esa carta a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'En la Cábala, la muerte no es más que otra señal de devoción.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'670b0d3c-ce04-44a3-80e5-b73b7ab99766\', \'multiverseId\': 443511}, \'multiverseid\': 443511}, {\'name\': \'Vigueur démoniaque\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1.\\nQuand la créature enchantée meurt, renvoyez cette carte dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Pour la Coterie, la mort n\'est qu\'un gage de dévotion parmi d\'autres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443780&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'014a35d4-93d3-4ab4-8dc2-27e70e7f5463\', \'multiverseId\': 443780}, \'multiverseid\': 443780}, {\'name\': \'Vigore Demoniaco\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1.\\nQuando la creatura incantata muore, fai tornare quella carta in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Nella Cabala, la morte non è che un altro segno di devozione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1e3142f-cfbf-4ba9-ae90-2ae96bc2887b\', \'multiverseId\': 444049}, \'multiverseid\': 444049}, {\'name\': \'悪魔的活力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、そのカードをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'陰謀団では、死は専心の一つの目安に過ぎない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'875795d0-294a-4783-9f7b-b9c34f77ea63\', \'multiverseId\': 444318}, \'multiverseid\': 444318}, {\'name\': \'악마적인 활력\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n부여된 생물이 죽을 때, 그 카드를 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'도당에서, 죽음은 신앙심의 또 다른 표시일 뿐이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0d90a50-8534-441a-b39d-c12c04624c0c\', \'multiverseId\': 444587}, \'multiverseid\': 444587}, {\'name\': \'Vigor Demoníaco\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1.\\nQuando a criatura encantada morrer, devolva aquele card para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Na Cabala, a morte é apenas mais uma marca de devoção.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26ccfbd6-11df-4246-9e3d-0a45047cb552\', \'multiverseId\': 444856}, \'multiverseid\': 444856}, {\'name\': \'Демоническая Живучесть\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1.\\nКогда зачарованное существо умирает, верните ту карту в руку ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Среди кабалов смерть — лишь еще одно свидетельство преданности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec840246-7d47-4056-bf25-cb0b7ad3df73\', \'multiverseId\': 445125}, \'multiverseid\': 445125}, {\'name\': \'恶魔活力\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1。\\n当所结附的生物死去时，将该牌移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'在柯帮，死亡只是另一种奉献的标记。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c3a4a3d-01dd-466a-ad57-f8d84ca38835\', \'multiverseId\': 445394}, \'multiverseid\': 445394}, {\'name\': \'惡魔活力\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+1/+1。\\n當所結附的生物死去時，將該牌移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'在柯幫，死亡只是另一種奉獻的標記。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8748e90-28ea-40f2-addb-6a16b7d3bca6\', \'multiverseId\': 445663}, \'multiverseid\': 445663}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämpfende Sphäre\', \'text\': \'Falls ein Land für zwei oder mehr Mana getappt wird, erzeugt es {C} anstatt jedes anderen Typs und jeder anderen Anzahl.\\nJeder Zauberspruch, den ein Spieler wirkt, kostet beim Wirken für jeden anderen Zauberspruch, den er in diesem Zug bereits gewirkt hat, {1} mehr.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Thran-Relikt, das zehntausend Jahre damit verbracht hat, absolut gar nichts zu tun.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443370&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a52480ea-0f2c-4bd7-bef5-47274c12189c\', \'multiverseId\': 443370}, \'multiverseid\': 443370}, {\'name\': \'Esfera de amortiguamiento\', \'text\': \'Si una tierra se gira para obtener dos o más manás, produce {C} en vez de cualquier otro tipo y cantidad.\\nCada hechizo que lance un jugador cuesta {1} más por cada otro hechizo que lanzó anteriormente este turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Una reliquia thran que lleva diez mil años haciendo absolutamente nada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87902ef3-d697-4173-9f80-8952dbd0cbc2\', \'multiverseId\': 443639}, \'multiverseid\': 443639}, {\'name\': "Sphère d\'amortissement", \'text\': "Si un terrain est engagé pour au moins deux manas, il produit {C} à la place de n\'importe quel autre type et quantité.\\nChaque sort lancé par un joueur coûte {1} de plus à lancer pour chaque autre sort lancé par ce joueur ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Cette relique thran a passé dix millénaires à ne rien faire du tout.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443908&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8ffe441-fef8-4dc4-8997-61f6ff9da611\', \'multiverseId\': 443908}, \'multiverseid\': 443908}, {\'name\': \'Sfera Smorzante\', \'text\': \'Se una terra viene TAPpata per attingere due o più mana, produce {C} invece di qualsiasi altro tipo e ammontare.\\nOgni magia lanciata da un giocatore costa {1} in più per essere lanciata per ogni altra magia che quel giocatore ha lanciato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Una reliquia dei Thran che ha passato diecimila anni nella più assoluta inerzia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1f45dd3-70aa-4089-b399-a8432d0c85a6\', \'multiverseId\': 444177}, \'multiverseid\': 444177}, {\'name\': \'減衰球\', \'text\': \'２点以上のマナを引き出す目的で土地が１つタップされるなら、それは他のタイプや点数の代わりに{C}を生み出す。\\nプレイヤーが各呪文を唱えるためのコストはそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがこのターンに唱えた他の呪文１つにつき{1}多くなる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'スランの秘宝だが、１万年間まったく何もしていない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a98702c-e64e-41ff-9860-8254e8b28736\', \'multiverseId\': 444446}, \'multiverseid\': 444446}, {\'name\': \'제동의 구체\', \'text\': \'두 개 이상의 마나를 얻기 위해 대지가 탭된다면, 그 대지는 다른 유형이나 수량 대신 {C}를 생산한다.\\n플레이어가 이번 턴에 발동한 다른 주문 한 개당, 그 플레이어의 주문은 발동하는 데 {1}이 더 든다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'만 년 동안 그야말로 아무것도 하지 않고 세월을 보낸 트란의 유물이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d64ec6ce-7778-4166-b7c4-30b0a76ad5bf\', \'multiverseId\': 444715}, \'multiverseid\': 444715}, {\'name\': \'Esfera Amortecedora\', \'text\': \'Se um terreno for virado para gerar dois ou mais manas, este gerará {C} em vez de qualquer outro tipo e quantidade.\\nCada mágica que um jogador conjura custa {1} a mais para ser conjurada para cada outra mágica que aquele jogador conjurou neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Uma relíquia dos Thran, ela passou dez mil anos sem fazer absolutamente nada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e47593a0-3eda-4a1d-a082-e2f054d9817d\', \'multiverseId\': 444984}, \'multiverseid\': 444984}, {\'name\': \'Сфера Подавления\', \'text\': \'Если земля поворачивается для получения более чем одной маны, она производит {C} вместо любых других типов и количества.\\nРазыгрывание игроком каждого заклинания стоит на {1} больше за каждое другое заклинание, разыгранное тем игроком в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Транская реликвия, которая провела десять тысяч лет в абсолютном бездействии.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e6dd09e-88c4-448f-bcf4-fce3db2fa3e8\', \'multiverseId\': 445253}, \'multiverseid\': 445253}, {\'name\': \'滞阻法球\', \'text\': \'如果横置某个地以产生两点或更多法术力，则它改为产生{C}，而非其他类别和数量。\\n牌手施放的咒语增加若干费用来施放，其数量为「该牌手本回合每施放过一个其他咒语，便需增加{1}」。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'这件索蓝遗宝万年来仅成就一事：「无事」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc85a961-597e-4da9-8010-bb0541fdca4a\', \'multiverseId\': 445522}, \'multiverseid\': 445522}, {\'name\': \'滯阻法球\', \'text\': \'如果橫置某個地以產生兩點或更多魔法力，則它改為產生{C}，而非其他類別和數量。\\n玩家施放的咒語增加若干費用來施放，其數量為「該玩家本回合每施放過一個其他咒語，便增加{1}」。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'這件索藍遺寶萬年來僅成就一事：「無事」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf3349de-7072-4b6d-8d5a-9c7bb3726fe1\', \'multiverseId\': 445791}, \'multiverseid\': 445791}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düsterer Handel\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm zwei davon auf deine Hand und lege die andere auf deinen Friedhof. Der Düstere Handel fügt dir 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe Pusteln des großen Ratadrabik im Angebot. Nicht? Dann sucht Ihr sicher nach einer Tinktur aus den pulverisierten Gebeinen Nevinyrrals. Mit Echtheitszertifikat!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443240&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63557966-9c40-4d69-b565-c2631a9b5241\', \'multiverseId\': 443240}, \'multiverseid\': 443240}, {\'name\': \'Intercambio oscuro\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon dos de ellas en tu mano y la otra en tu cementerio. El Intercambio oscuro te hace 2 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tengo pústulas del gran Rátadrabik, muy baratas. ¿No? Entonces seguro que quieres una infusión de los restos pulverizados de Nevinyrral. ¡Sabe auténtica!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5832e69b-d8dc-4d77-b0c1-c9563d2a1172\', \'multiverseId\': 443509}, \'multiverseid\': 443509}, {\'name\': \'Obscur marché\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez deux d\'entre elles dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière. L\'Obscur marché vous inflige 2 blessures.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Pustules du grand Ratadrabik, pas cher. Non ? J\'ai aussi une teinture faite des restes pulvérisés de Nevinyrral. Produit authentique ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443778&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d61cee2a-54b5-43dc-a6cc-9e5b8bb3c8b1\', \'multiverseId\': 443778}, \'multiverseid\': 443778}, {\'name\': \'Transazione Oscura\', \'text\': "Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine due alla tua mano e metti l\'altra nel tuo cimitero. La Transazione Oscura ti infligge 2 danni.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho delle pustole del grande Ratadrabik a buon prezzo. Non ti interessano? Allora non potrai rifiutare una tintura a base dei resti polverizzati di Nevinyrral. Roba genuina!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6c66c3d-281d-49b1-a237-1e0321d2210b\', \'multiverseId\': 444047}, \'multiverseid\': 444047}, {\'name\': \'闇の取り引き\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見る。そのうち２枚をあなたの手札に加え、他の１枚をあなたの墓地に置く。闇の取り引きはあなたに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「大ラタドラビックの膿疱がある。安くしとくよ。だめかい？じゃあ、ネビニラルの屍骸粉液ならいいだろう。本物だよ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b1eef05-e2d7-41be-b301-43e7ee22f56c\', \'multiverseId\': 444316}, \'multiverseid\': 444316}, {\'name\': \'사악한 거래\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 그중 두 장을 당신의 손으로 가져가고 다른 한 장은 당신의 무덤에 넣는다. 사악한 거래는 당신에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"내겐 위대한 라타드라빅의 고름집이 있소. 싸게 드리지. 생각 없다고? 그럼 네비니랄의 유해를 짓이겨 만든 팅크는 마음에 들 거요. 진품이라니까!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0057e0c2-0ad7-4f47-9773-14dc29dd716b\', \'multiverseId\': 444585}, \'multiverseid\': 444585}, {\'name\': \'Barganha Sombria\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque dois deles em sua mão e o outro em seu cemitério. Barganha Sombria causa 2 pontos de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Tenho pústulas do grande Ratadrabik, bem baratinhas. Não? Com certeza você vai querer uma tintura dos restos pulverizados de Nevinyrral. Genuína!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a0ac231-1d15-47ae-a8cd-99c2b0753441\', \'multiverseId\': 444854}, \'multiverseid\': 444854}, {\'name\': \'Темная Сделка\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите две из них в вашу руку, а оставшуюся — на ваше кладбище. Темная Сделка наносит вам 2 повреждения.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«У меня есть гнойники великого Ратадрабика, очень дешево. Нет? Тогда тебе наверняка нужна настойка на толченых мощах Невиниррала. Настоящая, без подделок!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7356d056-e51e-40fc-8fcc-8a95b188a615\', \'multiverseId\': 445123}, \'multiverseid\': 445123}, {\'name\': \'黯境交易\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。将其中两张置于你手上，另一张置入你的坟墓场。黯境交易对你造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我这里有拉塔札比大人身上的脓泡，非常便宜。不要？那你八成想来点妮维亚洛化为灰烬的遗骸。如假包换！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c63c6470-95ed-4cda-abd2-b37b48f922d8\', \'multiverseId\': 445392}, \'multiverseid\': 445392}, {\'name\': \'闇境交易\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。將其中兩張置於你手上，另一張置入你的墳墓場。闇境交易對你造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我這裡有拉塔札比大人身上的膿泡，非常便宜。不要？那你八成想來點妮維亞洛化為灰燼的遺骸。如假包換！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcb2ceea-9e54-4d2c-9499-52329aa6afb0\', \'multiverseId\': 445661}, \'multiverseid\': 445661}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443407&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5febd293-0161-4515-b483-61d20cacb89c', 'multiverseId': 443407}, 'multiverseid': 443407}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443676&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53851513-cb81-4f59-864e-a467301e5bf6', 'multiverseId': 443676}, 'multiverseid': 443676}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443945&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95a8a8ef-dd82-410d-95c6-5fca3da95612', 'multiverseId': 443945}, 'multiverseid': 443945}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444214&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8251cb27-49c4-45d7-96bb-a652b29d3aa5', 'multiverseId': 444214}, 'multiverseid': 444214}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444483&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5127b31b-5d89-4a66-9d8c-92daf62d4a84', 'multiverseId': 444483}, 'multiverseid': 444483}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444752&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e399491-cf90-4c37-ab0d-9eceb46a417a', 'multiverseId': 444752}, 'multiverseid': 444752}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445021&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8eb9fd9-7c81-4f75-b440-cb50450f2757', 'multiverseId': 445021}, 'multiverseid': 445021}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445290&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9c2cd53-d148-4624-925d-cfa92e19d879', 'multiverseId': 445290}, 'multiverseid': 445290}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445559&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0bb80e5-d384-45b1-8491-54f66a80ce46', 'multiverseId': 445559}, 'multiverseid': 445559}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445828&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0bda550-fa4a-4f53-aafd-b22679e4a379', 'multiverseId': 445828}, 'multiverseid': 445828}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443408&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fdd0180-f872-4d42-8128-a856f178fbeb', 'multiverseId': 443408}, 'multiverseid': 443408}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443677&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '175f21f8-3b57-45d4-b2b7-90eb0127f96c', 'multiverseId': 443677}, 'multiverseid': 443677}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=443946&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd63f2c3a-f314-4ec0-9288-151d95b74cc6', 'multiverseId': 443946}, 'multiverseid': 443946}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444215&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2fd9eed-fe10-4769-86cd-7c5a975ed50a', 'multiverseId': 444215}, 'multiverseid': 444215}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444484&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43ab496a-6168-43fd-abf8-1d034c1ec338', 'multiverseId': 444484}, 'multiverseid': 444484}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=444753&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bafc3137-5cdd-40be-b791-39f3ecd58ff2', 'multiverseId': 444753}, 'multiverseid': 444753}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445022&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42ed3aff-d7e2-4b6f-8943-8754845f914a', 'multiverseId': 445022}, 'multiverseid': 445022}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445291&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8bb271af-1b0e-4480-807f-1c15af781041', 'multiverseId': 445291}, 'multiverseid': 445291}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445560&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc239235-da84-4fa3-a76b-ef63dc427331', 'multiverseId': 445560}, 'multiverseid': 445560}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=445829&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa1562ac-890d-4843-a4ab-c60a1122f341', 'multiverseId': 445829}, 'multiverseid': 445829}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl':